<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Onobasulu - translator team - Village Checked Version September 2003</book>
  <para style="h">Hilibaisi Daalu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hilibaisi Daalu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hilibaisi Daalu</para>
  <para style="toc3">HD</para>
  <para style="mt">Hilibaisi Daalu</para>
  <para style="rem">Check the footnotes</para>
  <para style="imt">Sulu samini alegaeyo</para>
  <para style="ip">Bugo ewehe, kegele hilibaisi daalu inolo ili amofea holobagalu amone saaba sulu selesia awafe. Bugo eweda selelu inolo, amo Lugu e. Lugu Bugoda selelu amo e waaga. Lugu Bugo amohe, Yesu sulu solu amoda, kegele E mololu amoda, amone saaba sulu selefe. Inolo Luguhe Hilibaisi Daalu Bugo ewe seleba ofelesiamo, Lugu Bugo amofea gegoaba seleba ufulu. Yesuda hebene ana felafia labe fogo ami, kegele hala holobagalu amone sadalu awafe. Yesune sese Yuda aleba ami holobagalu amone sadalu awafe. Aufia dufia, sese amo bulesia, helefealu sunia doba sigilu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Lugu ehe ewegubada waleyo hamefe. Oloba huliale sulu, Godehe samini Isolaele idele inolofea saaba ufulu amohe, aga Yesune kuliba silo ili aleba ami holobagafe amo, wakaliba hugafe. Bugo ewe walesia, Yesune Awalu Sulu Nafulu amo Yudane mosomu inesuale. Aubale. Helefealu mosomu sunia ilida, Awalu Sulu Nafulu ewe diyo dobuba walefe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hilibaisi Daalu bugo usu ami, olaibo kegele uleno amo, Asubane Noekenene dabalu. Asubane Noekenemo, Gode Ene Asubane. Maugabamo, Fedikoso Sigilo hilia ami, Asubane Noekenemo, Yesune walelu faibili ili amofea huga mulu. Aufia dufiamo, Asubane Noekenehe ine asigi uluba dibia dedalesia, kiwigagalu meba yaalu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nini bugo ewe alegasiamo, hilibaisi daalu noolone sadalu alegasu. Sadalu aleba ami, wedinalemo, Fidadai, Folodai, mololu amone saaba sulu solu dobu. Fida e-mo, Yesu galiba siba ado amone walelu faibe uleno e. Auluso, Folomo, e maugabamo Yesu kuliba daaluale. Aubale. Samini ehe Yesune sese idele inolo dufa dafogoyone dabalu kiwigaaba moloba alolu. E auba labi, Yesuhe Folo wefasia ami, e-mo Ene dabalu molomesi inolo olaibo koleba gadefalu.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Separator Artwork for the Onobasulu NT - Waves" file="Separator1Onobasulu.tiff" size="span" loc="Between Book entry and text of the NT" copy="Johann Alberts, based on Onobasulu artwork" ref="1.0" /></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="s">Yesuhe saaba ofelesia, E Godene Asubane Noekenemo mebaiyoba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:3">Lug 1.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Diofilusu, bugo na gafea samini seleba ufulumo,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Bugo samini seleba ufulumo</char><char style="ft" closed="false">, Lugu Bugo amone iminiba selefe.</char></note> kegele Yesu mololumoda, mana E walelumoda, amone saaba sulu seleba melu. <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />Na bugo amo seleba ofelesiamo, na Yesune sadalu eweguba selelu. Maugaiya amifia, maugaba awaba melabia inigia, Godehe E Hebene diba lagosi elolu. E aso diba lagobale labi, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> alefasia, Ene molobebelelu <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> ili amofea amoguba molomaleba saaba melu. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Lug 24.36-49</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:41">HD 10.41</ref></char></note>Naga diba olafasia, Yesu haiba degelu. Aufasia, ilihe E seale bebea labebuba eloba bamesifia, Ehe kegele wedinale moloba walelu. Hilia daabuluba biniba ami, E ili labea holobagaba ligia, ilifea Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada amone saaba melu. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:49">Lug 24.49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 14:16-17">Yon 14.16-17</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:33">HD 2.33</ref></char></note> E ilidai naiyo naba ligia, ilifea eweguba saaba mesia selesia, “Naohe gilifea ulu kegele meyoba saaba ufulu. Na gilifea auba selesi, gili dubulu. Aulugulu, gili Yelusalame gadefia malabiyo. Aubale. Ulu kegele amo memesi yasiba melale. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mad 3.11</ref></char></note>Maumo, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yone</char> alefasia, idele inolomo hano balu geluso, hilia bilale alefasia, gilimo Asubane Noekenemohe geyobafe.” Yesu ilifea auba solu.<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 24:21">Lug 24.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fogo amoyamo, amida gagaiyolu faibili ilihe Efea doba bisigia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, saminimo, kinihe <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu uluba aloluguba, fogo aga ewe haiba auba melesine, Gahe yaagi momoloba ufiyobasela?” <verse eid="ACT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:32">Mag 13.32</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Ehe ilifea selesia, “Hiliada, halosida, Nao Ene kiwigagalu alefasia, madenelu dobu amone asigiyomo, gineale. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:19">Mad 28.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:48">Lug 24.48</ref></char></note>Auluso, Godene Asubane Noekene amo inigia, gilidai adesi, gili kiwigagalu diyobafe. Ausi, gilihe Ne sulu mana walelabia abia, Yelusalameda, Yudia hele suniada, aufia Samalia hele suniada, aufia hele kulia suniada, saaba sigiyobafe.”<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu E hebene diba lagolu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maga 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Lugu 24.50-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Yesuhe sulu auba safasia labi, ilihe sidafia labi, E ana diba lagolu. E diba lagosi, iwa inigia, E-mo ine si saabia gasiagusi, ili E abuluale. <verse eid="ACT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Ilihe E anakiwifealo lago aafemone si galiba sidafia ligia, bosolufalumo, inolo aidamo fagulo hoolu kaalu ili aniba yoba labi abulu. <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:64">Mad 26.64</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:27">Lug 21.27</ref></char></note>Aalu amohe ilifea selesia, “Galili inolo, gili eneyone anakiwi lago sidafia ele? Yesu ewe, aga gili afasia, <char style="w">hebene</char> diba lagolu amo, gilihe E hebene aasi abulu hamagubasu, haiba obegeba miyobafe.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yudasane hele fogo amo dimesine, ilihe Madiase molobebelelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Lug 24.50-53</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, hilibailu inolo ili hele gale Olifiba sodomo gadefia, Yelusalame ami obegeba dedalelu. Hele gale amo Yelusalame aniba hagoaleba labe. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mad 10.2-4</ref></char></note>Ili Yelusalame goafasia, molo lalolu ili asela ami felafia sugalu. Ili ami asulumo, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yoneda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemeseda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Adulu">Aduluda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Filibi[[1]], Yesune walelu faibe">Filibida</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Domase">Domaseda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Badolomiyu">Badolomiyuda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Madiyu - Lifai">Madiyuda</char>, aufia <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[2]], Alufiusune faibe">Alufiusune faibe Yemese</char> no, eda, aufia <char style="w" lemma="Saimono Selodo mosomune faibe">Saimono</char>, <char style="w">Selodo mosomu</char> inolo no amo eda, aufia <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[3]], Yemesene faibe">Yemesene faibe Yudasa</char> eda, ili ami asulu. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Inolo ili amo suniada, idele noolomoda, Yesune enae <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[1]], Yesune enae">Maliada</char>, Yesune elewodali ilida, hilise ule alefasia, gagaiyofasia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu sodomo</char> afelesiale, fedoba sefia selaba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Hilia fogo amoyamo, asigi ule ufulu idele inolo ami gagaiyofia asulumone, alegalumo 120 amoguba asulu. Aufia, Fida e ili aleba degefia, selesia, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:9">Sng 41.9</ref></char></note>“Nelewodali, samini <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidihe</char> sulu solu amo Godene Bugo selelu dobu. Sulu amo <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[1]], Isakaliodo">Yudasa</char> mololumo amone saaba selesia solu. Inolo ulenohe Yesu semesi inolo noolofea holonoba meyobafeba saaba ufulu. Deibidihe auba saaba ufulu amo aga koleba wakaliba hugalubu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Saminimo, Yudasa e nine mosomu alolune, e dabalu nini molofeguba, imini moloba ado alolu.<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:3-8">Mad 27.3-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, inolo Yudasa ewe, mana isoluale e mololu amone mole elebe dulumohe, gelu uleno elegeba dulu. Aufia dufiamo, e geiya ami hodobaisia, kubale fisasia, ene galisalo hele ami suluba dafalilu. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Idele inolo Yelusalame kakainalu amo, ili sunia kegele holobagalu amo dofasia, ‘Gelu amo ine sulubamo Akeledamaba’ sodo. Sulu amone kiwi sisamo ewe, Ibi Hele.” <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:25">Sng 69.25</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:8">109.8</ref></char></note>Fidahe sulu gegoaba selesia, “Gasa Bugo eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 1:20" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">
    <char style="qt">‘Hele eda alolumo, elabu hele melesi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">
    <char style="qt">inolo uleno ami waagi melamabiyo.’</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 1:20" />
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 1:20">Bugo amone nolobalomo eweguba selefe,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 1:20" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">
    <char style="qt">‘Inolo nohe ene dabalu fogo amo alibiaba diyo dobu.’</char><verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Aulugulu, nini kolebamo, Yudasane hele dimesine, nini aleba ami inolo uleno molobebeleyoba. Saminilo Yesu E aso nini galiba labi fogo amo, inolo hilia sunia ninidai alolu ili aleba ami, nini uleno molobebeleyoba. <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:9">Mag 1.9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:19">16.19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:27">Yon 15.27</ref></char></note>Maugaba <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonehe</char> idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geiya</char> amifia inigia, hilia Yesu nini afasia diba lagosi, ninidai adomone inolo uleno molobebeleyoba. Maumo, inolo amogulumo, eda Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degefia</char> labi si abuluba ulufaba saaba dafelagoyobafe. E auba ligia, ninidai dabalu ua moloyobafe.”<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Fida auba selesi, ilihe inolo aidane wi seleba dafogolu. Nomo, <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yosebe</char>, ilihe ene wi no Basabasaba sodo. Aufia, ene wi nomo, Yasudusu. Aufia inolo nomo, Madiase. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Aufia, ilihe Godedai sulu selesia, “Saminilo, Ga inolo suniane libo bologulu, Gahe inolo aida ewe aleba ami, abe ehe Yudasane fogo alibiamesi molobebelelu amone, ninifea walema. <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />Yudasa e hele eda miliyobafeba daiyaia ami daalu. Aulugulu, inolo abehe Yudasane hilibailu dabalu fogo dimesi, ninifea walema.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Godedai sulu auba safasia, ilihe abe difelaba babiyone abane gofo dafogolu. Auba ausi, Madiasene abane amodale holobagasi, ilihe e <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolo</char> kileleba amodai gegoaba ufulu.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Godene Asubane Noekenemo huga mulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:15-21">Wkp 23.15-21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:9-11">Lo 16.9-11</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Fedikoso Sigilo Hilia</char> amo adesi, asigi ule ufulu ili amo molo ule gagaiyofia alebailu. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Gagaiyoba gosia, dobelesufalumo, gala uleno <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">Hebenefia</char> huga saabi dubulu. Gala amo, fufulo kolelu galalogulu dobelesia, molo ilida saabea ami, wasigaaba dafulu. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mad 3.11</ref></char></note>Ausi, ili bosolufalumo, kegele de waiyagulu holobagafia, osolaba dedalesia, ilifea elebi elebibafea adaaba yaasi abulu. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:31">HD 4.31</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:44-46">10.44-46</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:6">19.6</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:17">Mag 16.17</ref></char></note>Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> ili suniafea wasigaalu. Ausimo, ili amo sulu nonoba Asubanehe ilifea saamesi asigiba ofelefeguba selaba yaalu.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Hilia amoyamo, Godene wida digiba sodo <char style="w">Yuda</char> idele inolo noolomo, hele kulia suniafia milibaifasia, Yelusalame ami kakainalu. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Gala amo dowesi dofasia, idele inolo ilimo hidigiba sogolugaba gagaiyolu. Enebamo, ili elebi elebiba ine suluba selefemo dobolaba yaalu. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Ili momoleba hidigiba selesia, “Suluda selefe ili ogo, sunia Galili mosomu idele inolo alebaibubu! <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Auluso, ninihe sulu ili selesi dobelesia, nine suluba selesi dobolaba yaasu ewe, enesi aufebi? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9-11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9-11" />Nini suniamo, hele nonoba amifia iwi milibailu lolu. Nini noolomo, seale Yuda mosomu idele inolo alebaibi, noolomo yau alefasia, Yudane gulugululo kuliba dedalelo idele inolo alebaibu. Nini noolomo, halo holobagalo hele afasia milibaisi, noolomo halo sugalo hele afasia milibaisi, noolomo lagolo hele afasia milibaisi, noolomo ilogolo hele afasia, iwi milibaifia lolu. Nini noolomo, sidi bule Lome amifia mulu inolo lolu. Noolomo, saidudu Kilidi amifia mulu inolo labi, noolomo hele falalu Alebia amifia mulu inolo lolu. Nini sunia sulu nonoba soda amifia iwi milibailu ligiaso, ilihe sulu selesi, nini ule uleba ene eneba nine suluba dobolaba yaasubu. Godehe kegele bule mololuba selefe dobelesu.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.9-11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ga Buk Baibel me Igilisi Baibolo alegasiamo, lalolu 2.9-11 iwi hele wi wedinale alegaeyobafe. Onobasulu besilo ninihe iwi aboboba seleba ufulu. Hele wi amo ewe: Fadia, Midia, Elamo, Mesofodemia, Yudia, Kabodosia, Fodusu, Asia, Filigia, Famifilia Isibi, Libia amo Salini dauno aniba dobu, Lome sidi, saidudu Kilidi, Alebia.</char></note><verse eid="ACT 2:9-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Hidigifia, asigi keleba hilisefia, ili ine geleba waneba yaasia selesia, “Kegele aga molofe ewe, ene moloyone molofebi?” <verse eid="ACT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Ausi, noolohe egewi diba selesia, “Ili ogo waini hano nenalebalu wedinale mololune, kagoafebuba” solu.<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidahe Godene sulu mana walelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e, inolo kileleba amo galiba ligia, idele inolone si saabia kalugaafia ligia, koleba wuaaba selesia, “Yuda inoloda, Yelusalame kakainabu gili suniada, doma! Gilihe na sulu selesu ewe nafuluba dofasia, asigiba dima. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Gili hilisesia, inolo nini ewe kagoafebuba hilisefela? Aa, nini kagoafale. Enebamo, aga aso keafa halosi agofolo labe. <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Kegele aga molofe ewe, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo Yoele samini saaba ufuluguba molofe. <verse eid="ACT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17-21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:28-32">Jol 2.28-32</ref> </char></note>E eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 2:17" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">
    <char style="qt">Gode selesia, ‘Aleba eloyo hilia hagoalesi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">
    <char style="qt">Nahe Ne Asubanemo idele inolo suniafea sagaeyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">
    <char style="qt">Ausi, gine faibilidalida, gine gelewelidalida,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">
    <char style="qt">ilihe Ne sulu mana saaba ofa saeyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, gine faibe fisamilihe si halaga babiyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">
    <char style="qt">Gine asidasile udia bologuba babiyobafe.</char><verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />
    <char style="qt">Seale, hilia amo adesi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">
    <char style="qt">Nahe Ne dabalu mololo idele inolofea Ne Asubane sagaeyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">
    <char style="qt">Ausi, ilihe saaba ofa saeyobafe.</char><verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Nahe anakiwi lago <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> walesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">
    <char style="qt">helefealu sisa ami eloba bamesine kegele moloyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">
    <char style="qt">Ibida, deda, de kawa buleda, holobagaeyobafe.</char><verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />
    <char style="qt">Ausi, haloda nigilisia, aubeda ibigulu miliyobafe.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">
    <char style="qt">Auba holobagafia labi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">
    <char style="qt">
      <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> hilia bulemo kiwigagaludai holobagaeyobafe.</char><verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />
    <char style="qt">Ausi, idele inolo sunia abehe Saminilone wi wesenaga, ili amo siba dafiyobafe.’</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 2:21" />
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 2:21">Saaba ofolo Yoelehe sulu auba solu.<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaele inolo</char> gili, sulu na selesu ewe doma. Nasalede inolo Yesu amo alefasia, Godehe gili aleba ami, eloba bamesi <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> nokene nokeneba moloba yaasi, gili besabeo. Aulugulu, Yesu E Godene iminilu inolo labebuba gili asigibu. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Godehe dufia moloyobafeba daiyaba hilisefia, inolo amo gine sone saabia ufulu. Aufia labi, gilihe wolu mololo inolo noolomofea nini sagoba homasia, E-mo imolane uluba ofelesia, dufa olalu. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Inolo amo olalo alefasia dofalu aloluso, Godehe E dofaiya amifia sububa dafogosia, E haiba degeba ifolu. Olalohe E sefia miliyodoluale. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:8-11">Sng 16.8-11</ref></char></note>Amakele <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidihe</char> inolo amo iminisia, eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 2:25" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">
    <char style="qt">‘Hilia sunia, Saminilo na olegiasu labi bosolu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">
    <char style="qt">E ne sone lilibefealo ligia, kiwigagalu meba labegulu,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">
    <char style="qt">kegele uleno baafia sagilifia, na waminiyale.</char><verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />
    <char style="qt">Aulugulu, na asigi nokene henesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">
    <char style="qt">ne mofehe henelu sulu selabasu lolu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">
    <char style="qt">Godehe ne domalafea nafulu moloyobafemofea</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">
    <char style="qt">na <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasiba</char> lolu.</char><verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />
    <char style="qt">Mau enebamo, Gahe na-mo daneba yaalu yasiba ada ami waagi melesi gadefaeyobafale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">
    <char style="qt">Seale, Gahe Ge <char style="w">Muuba Kalilu</char> Inolomo dana usu sesenemesi gadefaeyobafale.</char><verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />
    <char style="qt">Gahe nafea miliyolu miliyo diyo eno walelu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">
    <char style="qt">Na Gadai labi, Gahe ne libo henelo wasigaaba ufiyobafe.’</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 2:28" />
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 2:28">Deibidihe Yesu iminisia auba solu.<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 2:10">1Kin 2.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nelewodali, nanodali, nine nauwa Deibidi e olalu baliba dobiyo. Na auba selesenaga, gili hidigiba dubiyobafale. Enebamo, ene danamo aga nini aleba aso ufiyasu labeo. Ausi, e na dana usu sesenelu babiyobafaleba solu ogo, eneba selese? <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:12">2Sml 7.12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:3-4">Sng 89.3-4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 132:11">132.11</ref></char></note>Asigima. Deibidi hilisesia, Godehe efea sulu kolelu eweguba <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba solubiyoba</char> hiliselu. ‘Dufiamo, Nahe ge gauwadali ogone uleno ge kinine asefalu ailaiya yoba melesine gadefaeyobasu.’ <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 16:10">Sng 16.10</ref></char></note>Deibidi saaba ofolo inolo alolumone, ehe kegele dufia moloyobafemone bisigia, <char style="w">Keliso</char> <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba</char> ifoyomone sulu amo saaba ufulu. Amone iminisia, e selesia, ‘E-mo daneba yaalu yasiba ada ami waagi melaeyobafale. Aufia, Ene domala sesenelu babiyobafaleba’ solu. <verse eid="ACT 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Aulune, Godehe inolo Yesu ewe haiba degeba ifolumo, E seale degesi, nini sunia E si abulu amone selefe. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:31">HD 5.31</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:55-56">7.55-56</ref></char></note>Aufia, Yesu E ana diba lagofia, Godene sone lilibefealo yoba asulu. Godehe saaba ofelesia, Ene Asubane idele inolofea sagaeyobafeba solu. Aga mololumo, amo koleba! Yesuhe Enaofea alefasia, <char style="w">Asubane Noekene</char> difasia ninifea sagalu. Amone koleba, gilihe aga dobelesia besabeo. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sng 110.1</ref></char></note>Deibidimo, Yesu E <char style="w">hebene</char> diba lagoluguba, diba lagoluale. Auluso, Deibidihe saaba ofa selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 2:34" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">
    <char style="qt">‘Saminilo Ehe ne Saminilofea selesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">
    <char style="qt">Ga koleba, Ne sone lilibefealo yoba mesa.</char><verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Nahe Ge gisamo Ge emo sisa melesi gadefaeyobasu.’</char><verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:30-31">HD 5.30-31</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Deibidi auba saaba ufulugulu, <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu, gili sunia eweguba hilisema. Yesu, gilihe <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ufulu amo, Godehe E-mo Saminilo melesi gadefasia, molobebelefia, iminilu inolomo wi Keliso, Efea melu. Auba mololumo, ofalu dobuba asigima.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Idele inolo wedinale asigi besisi, ili hano gelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> sulu solu amo dobelesia, idele inolo ine asigine libo odesi, Fidafeada, <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolo</char> noolo ilifeada, doba bisigia, selesia, “Nelewodali, aga nini eneba moloyobi?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Ausi, Fidahe ilifea selesia, “Gili koleba <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besimale</char>. Aufasia, gili elebi elebiba Yesu Kelisone wi saabia waagi <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> homalemale. Ausi, Godehe gine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> hamasia, heesia galiyobafe. Aufia, Ehe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> gilifea mesi, gili amo diyobafe. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 57:19">Ais 57.19</ref></char></note>Maumo, Godehe auba moloyobafeba saaba ufulumo, gine gilifeada, gine faibilifeada, aufia idele inolo hago alebaibu ili suniafeada, Ene Asubane auba meyobafeba saaba ufulu. Godehe Ene Asubane auba dimesine weyobafe idele inolo, ili sunia auba diyobafe.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Fidahe sulu noolo wedinaleda safasia, ilifea koleba haguguba selesia, “Nafuluba. Gili koleba, koagelu mana mololo mosomudai woba dafolosi. Gili Godefea nini mosomu ewe aleba iwifia waagi gasiba dimalemale.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:47">HD 2.47</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:4">4.4</ref></char></note>Fidahe sulu solu heneba dubulu idele inolo ili amo sunia hano geba waalelu. Auba ausi, hilia amoyamo asigi ule ufulu ili amofea idele inolo saii osoloa (3,000) gegoaba ufulu.<verse eid="ACT 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Asigi ule ufulu idele inolo ili amo hilise ule alolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2.42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 20:7">HD 20.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolohe <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> sulu mana walefemo nafuluba sigiba dubulu. Ilihe ine meleba hilise ule adesia, gagaiyofia naiyoda ua naba ligia,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dawalolo inolo wedinale hilisesia, Kelisone mosomu maugaba alolu ili amo gagaiyoba ua naiyo nolo. Ine naiyo naba samodofasia, ilihe Yesune badoda ibida asigisia, boledidai, waini hanodai, dilo.</char></note> Godedai sulu amoda ua sodo. Ili aubasu moloyone helegeba ado. <verse eid="ACT 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Aufia, idele inolo suniahe, hilibaisi daalu inolo <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> wedinale moloba yaafemo bafasia, hidigifia sagililu. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:32-35">HD 4.32-35</ref></char></note><char style="w">Asigi ule ufulu</char> idele inolo ili amo ua ligia, ili sunia hilise uluse ado. Aufia, ili aleba ami ine kegelemo, uane kegele ofolo. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Ilihe inolo noolofea hele haisida, kegeleda, elegefia, mole amo difasia, weagulu idele inolofea osolaba ofolo. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Hilia sunia ili <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu ami afelesiale, gagaiyobasu ado. Aufia, ili uamo no moloa no moloaba, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo asigisia naiyo nolo">Yesu asigisia naiyo naiyo</char> maiyoba ado. Ine asigi nafulu alefasia, henefasia, naiyo ua nabia heafuba waalelo. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:7">HD 6.7</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 11:21">11.21</ref></char></note>Auba ligia, ili Godene wisu digiba selaba labihe, idele inolo suniahe ilifea asigi henelu. Auba labi, Saminilohe hilia sunia idele inolo siba dafelagofe ili amofea gegoabasu alolu.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Fidahe inolo emo wolu uleno waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Hilia uleno halosi osolo, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu sodo</char> halosi adesi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidadai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonedai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele moloa</char> ami fela daalu. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Aufia, aalu bisigia, bosolufalumo, inolo uleno emo wolumo sebele molo eno saliba Yogoleluba sodofealo ami yoba saabi abulu. Hilia sunia, inolo noolohe e ikauba dibia inigiamo, idele inolo sebele molone yala usu hugafe amofea mole haalimesisia, ami diba ofolaba ado. Inolo amone emo aidamo, enae seba duliya waagifia, wolu alolu. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Inolo amohe Fidadai, Yonedai, sebele molo usu sugaeyo aafe bisigia, aalufea mole haalilu. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:9">HD 14.9</ref></char></note>Ausi, Fidadai, Yonedai, aalu e si galiba bisigia, Fida selesia, “Ga ani bama!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Auba selesi, inolo amohe aalufea kegele diyobasubusia, aalu si galiba sidalu.<verse eid="ACT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 4:10">HD 4.10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 16:18">16.18</ref></char>
    </note>Ausi, Fida selesia, “Moleda, belemeda, na male. Auluso, kegele no sebumo, na gafea meyobasu. Amo ewe. Nasaledene Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> wi saabia, na gafea selesu, ‘Ga degefia mala!’” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Aufia, Fidahe e sagoba ofelesia, ene sone inaloalo sefia, gasiba ifolu. Auba ausi, hamagi, ene emo hugulumodai, ene emo gasodai, amo kiwigaalu. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Ausi, e degefia, ibalabia siba alolu. Aufia, e aalu galiba abia, aleba lagolabia, Godene wi digiba selabia abia, sebele molone yala usu hugalu.<figure style="fig" alt="Peter heals lame beggar" file="C093.JPG" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="3.1-11">Fidahe inolo emo wolu uleno waiba ofelefe.</figure> <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Idele inolo suniahe e Godene wi digiba selabia siba adefe amone bisigia, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />ilihe e eloba bisigia, inolo amomo sebele molo eno saliba Yogoleluba soda ami, mole haaliba ado hamaganebuba hiliselu. Kegele efea mololu amone baafia, ili hidigifia momolelu.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidahe sebele molone yala usu Godene sulu mana walelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Haaliba ado inolo amohe <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidadai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonedai</char>, fedoba sefia labi, idele inolo sunia momoleba bisigia, naguba inigia sebele moloa, <char style="w" lemma="Solomono">Solomono</char> Saloaiyaba soda ami, fuluba milibailu. <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Ausi, Fidahe idele inolo auba milibaifemo baafia, ilifea selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaele idele inolo</char> gili, kegele ewe holobagalu baafia, mau enene hidigiba bese? Mau enene, gilihe ani si galiba bese? Gili hilisesia, anibisune kiwigagalu alefasia aulula, me anibisu Godene si saabia nafulu alefasia, inolo ewe malalububa hilisesela? Aubale koleba. <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Kis 3.6</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 3:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Lug 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:23">HD 2.23</ref></char></note>Gode, E-mo <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamaneda</char>, Aisegeneda, <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yekoboneda</char>, ine Gode labe. Aulugulu, nine nauwadaline Gode amo Ehe, Ene dabalu mololo Yesufea wi wabialelo melu. Inolo Yesu amo, gilihe E dumesi seba meso. <char style="w" lemma="Filadusu">Filadusuhe</char> e subu dafogoyoba hiliseluso, gilihe E waaselaba bisigia, Efea faiso mesia, Filadusufea selesiamo, ogo sububa dafogomabiyoba seleso. <verse eid="ACT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />Auba molosiamo, gilihe <char style="w">Muuba Kalilu</char> Isolu Inolomo waaselaba bisigia, Efea faiso mesia, Filadusufea selesia, inoloda dufa olalo ulenomo sububa dafogomaba seleso. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Auba solumo alefasia, gilihe Miliyolu Miliyone Mau amone dufa olaso. Auluso, Godehe E olaiya amifia <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifosomone</char>, anine si abulu amone sulu saaba dafelagoba lolu. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Anihe Yesufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulune</char>, Yesune wifea alefasia, inolo ewe gili sunia bolomo, aga iwida besabe ogo, aga waiso. Yesu Ene alefasia, anine asigi ule ufulu kiwigaaba ofelesi, anihe asigi ule ufulu amofea alefasia, inolo amo waiyolu waiba ofelesi, gili besabego.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 23:34">Lug 23.34</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 1:13">1Dim 1.13</ref></char>
    </note>Nelewodali, nanodali, doma. Na asigisia, gilidai, gine guni inolodai, sawaba asigibale ligia, Yesufea mana wolu auba mololu. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Auluso, amakele Godehe <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo ine mofeyofeafia saaba ofelesiamo, eweguba solubiyo. Ene Keliso, Inolo E molobebelefia iminiba ufulu amo, naga naiyobafeba saaba ofa solu. Aulune, mana gili mololumofea alefasia, Gode saaba ufulumo auba wakaliba hugaso. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:38">HD 2.38</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, Godehe gine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> hamasia, galisia heeba damesine, gili koleba gine asigi wolu faiso mefia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besifia</char>, Godefealo nolofia mala. <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />Gili auba molosenaga, amo <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> olegiafia hisu heda diyobafe. Ausi, Ehe Keliso gineba samini iminiba ufulumo, Yesu E-mo hilibaiyobafe. <verse eid="ACT 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />Aga E koleba aso <char style="w">Hebene</char> ligia, Godehe kegele sunia hili momolomesi yasiyo dobu. Amakele waagifia, saaba ofolo muuba kalilu ine mofeyo alefasia, E dabalu auba moloyobafeba iminiba saaba ufulubiyo. <verse eid="ACT 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 18:15">Lo 18.15</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 18:18-19">18-19</ref></char></note>Amakele <char style="w">Mosese</char> selesia, ‘<char style="qt">Gine Saminilo Gode Ehe gili aleba ami, saaba ofolo inolo uleno, na lolugulu, iminiba ufiyobafe. Aulugulu, gili koleba, sulu E gilifea selesi dobelefe amoguba, sunia kuliba malale.</char> <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" /><char style="qt">Aufia, saaba ofolo amone sulu sigiba dobelefale ili amo, Isolaele mosomufeafia dufa dafaliyobafe.</char>’<verse eid="ACT 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Aufia, saaba ofolo suniahe, Samuelefea maugafia inigia, saaba ofolo dufia e faisa adabia mulumo, ili saaba ofelesia, hilia aga ewe holobagaeyobafeba saaba ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 22:18">Stt 22.18</ref></char></note>Gili saaba ofolone daalo dilo faibili ligia, gili oloba hulialeba saaba ufulu amone mosomu labe. Godehe Abalahamafea selesia, ‘Ge sebe amofea alefasia, helefealu mosomu sunia <char style="w" lemma="Edililo - Ediliba Ofolo">ediliba ufiyobafeba</char>’ solu. Auba selesiamo, nine nauwadalifea <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> amone saaba, sulu iminiba solu. <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:46">HD 13.46</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, Godehe gilidale hilisesia, Ene dabalu mololo inolo degeba ifofasia, gili gine wolufealo afasia besiba dafelesia, gili ediliba homesine, E-mo gili labea hilibailu.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Ilihe Fidadai Yonedai dibolo dafogolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Fidadai, Yonedai, aaluhe idele inolofea sulu auba selaba labi, <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> nooloda, <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> ibolo selune guni inoloda, <char style="w">Sadiyusi</char> inoloda, ili alebale aalu labea milibailu. <verse eid="ACT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Aaluhe idele inolofea selesia, Yesu olafia <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeluguba</char>, idele inolo ilida olafia Yesu alefasia, haiba degeba ifoyobafeba selefemone, ilihe aalufea habosia gadilu bule alolu. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Aulune, ilihe aalu godoyosia seba hugalu. Halo uluba seyo hagoalesi, ilihe aalu dibolo dafogofia ligia, adigi keafa yasifia alolu. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:41">HD 2.41</ref></char></note>Auluso, idele inolo wedinale sulu Fidadai, Yonedai solu amo dofasia, ili <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char>. Asigi ule ufulu inolomone sobosi, gegoaba alegalumo, saii bia (5,000) amoguba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Fidadai, Yonedai, galisolone si saabia fadaalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Adigi keafamo, Yudane saminilo inoloda, guni inoloda, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane dawalolu inoloda</char>, ili Yelusalame gagaiyolu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" /><char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">Soba melone guni inolo</char> Anase eda, Kaiafaseda, Yoneda, Alegesadada, aufia soba melone guni inolone damene nooloda, ili sunia ua gagaiyolu. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Gagaiyofia, ilihe Fidadai Yonedai uluba difasia, ine si saabia kalugamafia, ili aalufea doba bisigia selesia, “Dabalu aalihe aide mololu ogo, auba moloyone kiwigagalu halagulumone alefasia mololu? Aali ogo abene wi saabia alefasia auba mololu?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidafea</char> wasigaasi, e selesia, “Isolaelene saminilo inoloda, guni inoloda, gili koleba doma! <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />Anihe inolo emo wolu sagoba ufulu amone, gilihe ani godosela? Anihe e halaguba waiba ufuluba doba bisigia, gilihe ani fadaasela? <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:6">HD 3.6</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 3:13-16">13-16</ref></char></note>Auba ausenaga, amo gilida, <char style="w">Isolaele</char> inolo suniada, eweguba hilisema. Inolo gine si saabia aga waiba ufulu degeba labe ewe, amo e Nasaledene Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> wi alefasia waiba ufulu labe. Yesu amo, gilihe <char style="w">imolane</char> uluba ufuluso, Godehe E-mo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifolu</char>.<verse eid="ACT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Sng 118.22</ref>
      </char>
    </note> <char style="qt">Abanemo, moloda dilo gilihe wolubusia waaselaba abulumo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">
    <char style="qt">Yesu amo E.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">
    <char style="qt">Auluso, aga E-mo, moloda kiwigaaba sefia melesine,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">
    <char style="qt">duguiya ikau olaibo kolebamo, E labe.</char><verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 1:21">Mad 1.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo no alefasia, nini <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> obegeba diyodoluale. Aubale. Yesune wi ulesu alefasia, helefealu idele inolo nini gasiba dafelagoba miliyo dobu. Wi solu no male koleba.” Fidahe auba solu.<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Ausi, guni inolo ilihe Fidadai, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonedai</char>, aalu yuasia sagilisiale, asigi kolefia selefe dobelesia, hidigiba dubulu. Enebamo, ili asigisia, aalumo sugululuale balu inolo labebuba hiliselu. Aufia, ili hilisesia, aalu samini Yesudai adomoba hiliselu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Aufia, ilihe inolo waiba ufulu amone aaludai yoba labemone bisigia, ili sulu noda aalufea obegeba saeyomo, male alolu. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Aulugulu, ilihe aalufea galisolone molo lalolu gadefia daafia, baea yasiba melalu. Aalu baea daafia labi, ili ine geleba sulu nenesia selesia, <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />“Nini inolo aida ogofea eneba moloyobi? Aaluhe <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> mololumo, idele inolo Yelusalame alebaibu ili sunia hiliseba samodobugulu, ninihe auba mololualeba saeyodolualebu. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Auluso, sulu ewe idele inolo noolo saabia doba sigilosine, ninihe aalufea Yesune wi amone saaba idele inolo noolofea sulu samabuba saeyoba.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:28">HD 5.28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba nenefasia, ilihe aalu obegeba huga milafia, selesia, “Yesune wi amone saaba idele inolofea saabia no sulu walemabiyoba” solu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:29">HD 5.29</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Fidadai, Yonedai, aaluhe ine sulu amone obegeba selesia, “Mana halane Godene si saabia isolubu? Anihe Godene sulu kuliba maiyomobile, me gine sulu kuliba maiyomobile? Gine gili osolama. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Auluso, anine mofe kaeyodoluale adesia, ani si abulumoda, koneni dubulumoda, sunia saeyo dobu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Aalu auba selesi, galisolo inolo ilihe aalufea saabia haguguba auba molomabiyoba safasia, aalu waagi malalu. Maumo, ilihe idele inolo baaba sagilisia aulu. Idele inolo sunia hilisesia, kegele ewe Gode alefasia mololumone, Ene wi digiyosu molofe baafia, guni inolo ilihe aalu falasiyomone eno male alolu. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Enebamo, aaluhe momolelu kegele molosia waiba ufulu inolo amone hamumo, daabuluba binibamo sunialu alolu.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigidubulu idele inolo ilihe Godedai sulu koleba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Galisolo inolo ilihe, Fidadai, Yonedai, sububa dafogosi, aaluhe aine damenedali saabea obegeba daafia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melo inoloda</char>, guni inoloda, ili aalufea solumo ilifea saaba melu. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:11">Kis 20.11</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:6">Neh 9.6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Sng 146.6</ref></char></note>Selefe amo dofasia, ili ami hilise ule alefasia, Godedai sulu mofeyo gagaiyoba saaba lagosia selesia, “Gode-ooo, nine Biso, Ga koleba. Anakiwida, helefealuda, salu hanoda, kegele sunia ami waalebu amoda, Gahe sunia mololu. <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:1-2">Sng 2.1-2</ref></char></note>Amakelemo, Ge dabalu mololo, nine nauwa <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> mofeyohe, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> alefasia, Gahe eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 4:25" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">
    <char style="qt">‘Helefealu mosomu idele inolo sunia kanofe ogo, mau enesi aufe?</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">
    <char style="qt">Mau enene idele inolo ilihe balu waagi wolu moloyone nenefe?</char><verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />
    <char style="qt">Helefealune kini sunia yoboyone madenefia alebaibi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">
    <char style="qt">guni inolo ilida gagaiyofia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">
    <char style="qt">ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminiloda</char>, Ene Iminilu Inoloda, dufa dafogoyone daiyafe.’</char><verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mad 27.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:7-11">Lug 23.7-11</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 3:13">HD 3.13</ref></char>
    </note>Seale, amo aga wakaliba hugafe. <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[2]], Adibasa">Helododai</char>, Fodiusu <char style="w" lemma="Filadusu">Filadusudai</char>, aaluda, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomuda</char>, aufia <char style="w">Isolaele</char> inolo noolo ilida, ilihe sidi iwi gagaiyofia, Ge Muuba Kalilu Dabalu Mololo Faibe Yesu amo, Ge Iminilu amo koleba, dufa dafogoyone guni gagafia nenelu. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:23">HD 2.23</ref></char></note>Ili kegele auba molosiamo, ilihe Ga samini Ge hiliseda, Ge kiwigagaluda alefasia, holobagamesisia daiyaba ufuluguba mololu. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:19">Efe 6.19</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, Saminilo, aga Gahe sulu sunia ilihe nini sagilimesine solu amo hilisesia, Ge dabalu mololo faibili nini sagoba homale. Ninihe ge sulu mana saeyo sagilisiale saeyone kiwigaaba homa. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Aufia, walefalu inolo haiba waiba waalemesi, Ga koleba Ge sone ogo isoma. Ge Muuba Kalilu Dabalu Mololo Faibe Yesu amone wi saabia alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Momolelu kegele">eloba bamesine momolelu kegele</char> nokene nokeneba molomale.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Ili Godedai sulu auba saaba samodosi, molo ilida gagaiyofia asulu amo waminisi, Asubane Noekenemo ilifea wasigaasi, ili Godene sulu mana selesiamo, saeyo sagilisiale kiwigaaba selaba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sigidubulu idele inolo suniahe idele inolo noolo anogo sagoba ofolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4.32 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:44">HD 2.44</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> sunia hilise ule alebailu. Inolo ulenohe ene kegele no baafia, ewe nelebine kegeleba sodale alolu. Ausi, ine kegelemo sunia uanesu ofolo. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Ausi, <char style="w">hilibaisi daalu inolo</char> ilihe Saminilo Yesu degelumone awaba mesia, sulu amo kiwigaaba koleba saaba dafelagolu. Auba ausi, Godehe idele inolo amo sagoba ufiyo bule hamefia, Ehe ili nafuluba ediliba ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34-35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34-35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.34-35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:45">HD 2.45</ref></char></note>Idele inolo ili amo aleba ami, naiyo kegeleda diyoluba alolu uleno male ado. Enebamo, heleda me moloda biso ili amo, ine heleda, me ine moloda elegefasia, mole amo difasia, dia inigia, hilibaisi daalu inolo ine sone saabia meba ofolo. Auba ausi, hilibailu inolo ilihe, mole amo kegele diyoluba labeguba ilifea osolaba ofolo.<verse eid="ACT 4:34-35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36-37" />Aufia, Lifai inolo uleno, saidudu Saibulusufia mulumo, ene wi <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[6]], ene wi no Banabasa">Yosebe</char>, ehe gelu e enaolumo elegefasia, mole amo difasia, hilibailu inolo ine sone saabia ufulu. Hilibailu inolo ilihe inolo amone wi no mesia, <char style="w" lemma="Banabasa">Banabasaba</char> wi melu. Wi amone kiwi sisamo eweguba: inolone libo kiwigaaba ofolo.<verse eid="ACT 4:36-37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananaiasedai, Safailadai, aaluhe Gode gegeyo weiyaalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Inolo uleno alolumo, ene wi Ananaiase, ehe, ene eamono Safailadai, aine hele haisi ulenomo inolo nofea elegelu. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:34-35">HD 4.34-35</ref></char></note>Aufia, mole e dulu amo, haisi no ene diba ufulu. Ene eamonomoda amo asigifia alolu. Aufia, Ananaiasehe haisi no amo dibia inigia, <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolo</char> ine sone saabia ufulu.<verse eid="ACT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 13:2">Yon 13.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> selesia, “Ananaiase, gahe <char style="w">Sedene</char> ge libo waagi wasigamesi molosego, enelune ause? E ge libo auba wasigaasi, gahe <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemone</char> gegefia, ge hele haisi elegelumone mole dulu noolomo gene diba ufulugo, enebane ause? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Ge hele haisi amo aso elegeluale dobimo, amo gene diba ufulu. Elegelu dobimo, amida mole amo gene koleba diba ufulu. Mole amohe gahe gene hamefeguba molobaiyo. Auluso, agamo, gahe haisi gene diba ofasia, iwi inigia, gegesusia, mole sunia ulu mesuba solugo, auba moloyone, enesi ge asigi usu daiyalu? Gahe auba molosiamo, ga inolofea gegesiale, Godefea koleba gegelu.”<verse eid="ACT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Ananaiase e sulu Fida selefe amo dobelesia, gelebaifia olalu. Ausi, auba mololumone dubulu ili sunia bule koleba sagililu. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Ausi, faibili fisamili noolo milibaifasia, Ananaiasene domalamo fagulo masofia digifia, daafia baliba ufulu.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Halosi osoloa daafia labi, Ananaiase ene eamono kegele holobagalumo asigibale suga mulu. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Ausi, Fida efea selesia, “Ga nafea saaba mema, mole aine hele haisi elegefasia dulu amo yagala?” Fida auba selesi, Safaila selesia, “Amo seale, yagaba” solu. <verse eid="ACT 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Auba selesi, Fidahe ido amofea selesia, “Aalihe sulu daiyafia, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> Asubane dedeyone eelu ogo, enebane ause? Doma! Inolo ge gainoda baliyo daalumo, ili amo eno suga miyo saabe asogo. Ilihe ga-da digifia maiyobafe.”<verse eid="ACT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Fida auba selesi, alebale hamagi, ido amo Fidane emo aniba gelebaifia olalu. Ausi, faibili fisamili ili amo suga milibaifasia, ido amo olalu dobi baafia, ilihe e digifia abia, ene ainoda balia aniba ami baliba ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Auba ausi, <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo suniada, mololu amone dubulu amoda, ili wedinale sagililu.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Momolelu kegele nokene nokeneba holobagalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:43">HD 2.43</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:3">14.3</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">Hilibailu inolo</char> ine sone alefasia <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> nokene nokeneba idele inolo aleba ami moloba alolu. Aufia, asigi ule ufulu idele inolomo, ili sunia hilise ule ofasia, sebele molone yala usu <char style="w" lemma="Solomono">Solomono</char> Saloaiya ami gagaiyolo. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Idele inolo noolo ilidai gegoaba ami ua misiyo sagiliba aloluso, ilihe asigi ule ufulu amone wi digilo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Idele inolo ili amo sigidubuludai ua misiyone sagililumo, mau ewe, guni inolo ilihe Yesune kuliba silo ilimo woba dafiyo hamefe. Aulune, idele inolo yuasia, idele inolo si saabia sigidubulu galiba gagaiyoyone sagililu.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Auluso, idele inolo wedinale saabia saabiaba Saminilofea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesia</char>, ili asigi ule ufulu alegalumofea gegoaba alolu. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Aufia, hilibailu inolo ilihe momolelu kegele molofemo baafia, idele inolo ilihe walefalu inolo ikauba dia milibaisia, geda saabiada, molobu saabiada hanemafia, eno kia diba waalelu. Auba ofolaba adalomo, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e amolo aasi, halo neehe efea neeba dowesi, ene asubanemo walefalu inolomofea baasia, ili waimesifia auba mololu. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Idele inolo ili Yelusalame anibalo kakainalu amifiada, ine walefalu inoloda, <char style="w">asubane wolu</char> alolu inoloda, ulubia abia, hilibailu inolo alebaibia dibia milibaisi, walefalu inolo ili amo sunia waiba waalelu.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hilibailu inolo dibolo ufulumo, Godene sulu dia anohe sububa dafogolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Ausi, hilibailu inolo ilihe auba molofe amo baafia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone yasilo</char> inoloda, ene damenedali <char style="w">Sadiyusi</char> mosomu alolu amo ilida, ilihe ine asigi ilifea gogoloba hilisesia, ili babiyo habolu. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Ausi, ili degefia inigia, <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolo</char> seba yaafia, dibolo dafogoba yaalu. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:7-10">HD 12.7-10</ref></char></note>Auluso, ili ami dafogofia labi, nigiliba ami, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> inolo ulenohe dibolo molo eno sogofia, ili baea lubia felasia, selesia, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Gili koleba, <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu sugafia, kalugaafia, idele inolofea miliyolu miliyone sulu ewene saaba memale.”<verse eid="ACT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Hilibailu inolo ili sulu amo dofasia, ili keafale koleba sebele molone yala usu suga daafia, idele inolofea Godene sulu mana walelu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Ili ami auba waleba labihe, soba melone yasiloda, ene damenedalida, galisolo moloa goafia, galisolo inoloda, <char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaelene</char> asidalu inoloda, sunia weba gagaiyolu. Aufia ilihe, ibolo selu inolofea dibolo moloa daafia, hilibailu inolo ilimo amifia lubia milalelu. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Ausi, ibolo selu inolo ami goasia, bosolufalumo ili dibolo moloa ami male abulu. Ili ami male baafia, ili obegeba daafia, galisolo inolo ilifea selesia, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Ninihe dibolo moloa daafia, molo amone enomo koleba kaalu dobi abulu. Aufia, enoda yasiba yaalomo, eno sunia yasiba yaalu abuluso, eno sogosia, bosolufalumo, ninihe inolo uleno usu ami male abulu.” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Sebele molone ibolo selu guni inoloda, soba melone guni inoloda, ilihe sulu amo dofasia, ili keleba hilisefia selesia, “Kegele ewene faisamo, enegulu holobagaeyobafebi?”<verse eid="ACT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Auba hiliseba labi, inolo uleno goasia, ilifea selesia, “Doma, inolo ili gilihe dibolo dafogolumo, agamo ili sebele molone yala usu ligia, idele inolofea Godene sulu mana waleba labe.” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Sulu amo dofasia, guni inolomoda, ene ibolo selu inolodalida, ili sebele moloa daafia, hilibailu inolo ulubia miyone selu. Auluso, idele inolohe ili abane odosisia, ibolo selu inolo ilihe hilibailu inolo ilifea kiwigagaba uleno mololualeso, esebalo ulubia daalu.<verse eid="ACT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hilibailu inolo ili galisolo si saabia Godene sulu mana saeyo sagililuale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Ibolo selu inolo ilihe, hilibailu inolo ulubia milibaifasia, ili galisolo si saabia fadaayone yoba melalu. Melafia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone yasilo</char> inolohe ilifea selesia, <verse eid="ACT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:25">Mad 27.25</ref></char></note>“Ninihe gilifea inolo ogone wi walemabiyoba koleba selesia, elo ufulu. Auluso, gilihe sulu mana amo aso walebasu labi, Yelusalame idele inolo sunia doba liliba samodobu. Aufia, gilihe ninifea inolo ogo nini dufa olaluba egedidiba oloba koweba selefe.”<verse eid="ACT 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 4:19">HD 4.19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolo</char> nooloda, ili obegeba selesia, “Ninihe Godene suludale kuliba maiyo dobu. Ninihe inolone sulu kuliba maiyale. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Inolo Yesu gilihe imolane uluba ofelesia, dufa olalu amo, nine nauwadaline Gode amo, Ehe E <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifolu</char>. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:33-34">HD 2.33-34</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:20">Efe 1.20</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:10">Hib 2.10</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:2">12.2</ref></char></note>Aufasia, Godehe Yesu diba lagofia, Efea wi mefia, Saminiloda, <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">Gasiba Dafelagoba Diloda</char>, wi melu. Aufia Ehe, E-mo Ene sone lilibefealo yoba melalu. <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu ine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besimesisia</char>, Ehe Yesu ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> hamasia, galisia heeyone gadefalu. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Ninimo, kegele amo mololumo nine si baafia, nini olofa ligia, amone sulu saaba dafelagoba lolu. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char>, Eda olofa ligia, kegele amonesu sulu saaba dafelagoba labe. Asubane Noekene amo, Godehe idele inolo E sisa ligia, Ene suluda kuliba aafe ili amofea melu.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo Gamalile ehe galisolofea selesia, hilibailu inolofea esebaloba molomaleba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Galisolo inolo ilihe Fida auba selefemo dofasia, ili asigi woba kanofia, hilibailu inolo ili amo dufa olaeyo hiliselu. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Auluso, galisolo inolo ili aleba ami, <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo uleno alolumo, ene wi Gamalile. Inolo amo muguli mana walelo ligia, idele inolo suniahe ene wi digiba sodo. Aga e degefia, ibolo selu inolo noolofea selesia, hilibailu inolo ogo baea aso fogo bilale melesi ulubia malaba solu.<verse eid="ACT 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Ili baea daafia labi, Gamalilehe galisolo inolo ilifea selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaele inolo</char> gili, doma! Nafuluba. Gilihe kegele uleno inolo ili ogofea moloyo hamesenaga, amo gilihe samini aso nafuluba hilisema. <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:38">HD 21.38</ref></char></note>Gili asigibu, samini inolo uleno, ene wi Dudase, degefia selesia, na saminilo wida loluba seleso. Auba selesi, inolo fula biniba (400) amoguba e kuliba dedaleso. Auluso, gamane inolo ilihe e dufa olasihe, inolo e selefe sigiba dobolomoda fisaba dedaleba yaasia, ine dabalu mololumo balu weaseso. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Aufia, dufiamo, gamanehe idele inolo wi alegaba selelu fogo ami, Galili inolo uleno, ene wi Yudasa, e holobagalu. Ehe inolo noolone asigi sigiba molasi, ilihe e kuliba abia gamanemo duguba dafiyofia belaguso. Auluso, gamanehe eda dufa olasi, inolo sunia e sulu solu sigiba dubulu, ili amoda fisaba dedaleba yaaso. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Aulugulu, agamo na gilifea selesu, Gili koleba kegele uleno inolo ili ogofea molosiale, ili aso waagi melalemale. Enebamo, dabalu ili moloba labemo inolone asigifeasufia holobagasenaga, amo bidiba dafiyobafe. <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />Auluso, dabalu ewe Godefeafia holobagasenaga, amo gilihe inolo ili ogo kaeyodoluale koleba. Aubale, ausenaga, gilihe Godefea belagufebuba babiyobafe.” Gamalile auba selesi, galisolo ilihe ene sulu eesia kuliba daalu.<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.40 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 4:18">HD 4.18</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolomo</char> haiba saabia suga milibaimafia, ili amo efolo fegofia, Yesune wi saabia no auba samabiyoba elo ofasia, ili waagi malalu.<verse eid="ACT 5:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5.41 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:10-12">Mad 5.10-12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:13">1Fid 4.13</ref></char>
    </note>Auba ausi, hilibailu inolo ilimo, galisolone molo gadefia baea daalu. Godehe ili Yesune wi saabia alefasia naga diyodoluguba, liliba difebuba hilisesia, ili nokene henelu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Aufia, hilia sunia ili <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usuda, idele inolone molo suniada, ili sulu mana nafulu amo waleyoda, saaba meyoda, afoluale. Auba ausi, ilihe fadaba saaba dafelagoba selesia, “Yesu E-mo <char style="w">Keliso</char> labe, Godehe molobebelefia iminiba ufulu inolo amo E-ba” solu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Ilihe inolo domobamo hilibailu inolo sagoba homesi molobebelelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 4:35">HD 4.35</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Hilia fogo amoyamo, sigidubulu idele inolo alegalumo buleba adesia, ili aleba ami, Giligi sulu sodo Yuda inolo noolo ilihe, <char style="w">Hibulu</char> sulu sodo inolofea agegeba selesia, “Hilia sunia gilihe naiyo osolasiamo, nine idele ilisulumo bisigiale, noolofeasu naiyo melo.” <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Auba selesi, hilibailu inolo ilihe sigidubulu idele inolo sunia gagaiyomafia selesia, “Ninihe Godene sulu mana waleyo afasia, nini digonone dabalu amosu moloba ligia, naiyo osolaba adesenaga, amo isoluale. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Aulugulu, nelewodali, gilihe gili aleba ugi, inolo domoba isasiamo, ili Asubane Noekenemo wasigafia, dawaloloda ufulumone isamale. Aufia, ninihe inolo ili amo dabalu ewe yasimesi gadefaeyoba. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Auluso, nine dabalumo, nini afelesiale helegeba moloyo dobu amo, ewe. <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu saeyoda</char>, Ene sulu mana walesia, idele inolo sagoba ufiyoda. Dabalu aida amo, ninihe nine fogo meyoba.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Auba selesi, idele inolo gagaiyolu suniahe, hilibailu inolo ilihe auba moloyoba selefemo dofasia henelu. Aufia, ilihe Sidifene molobebelelu. E-mo inolo <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> efea wasigaalu. Aufia, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Filibi[[2]], digono inolo uleno">Filibida</char>, Folokolusuda, Nikanoada, Dimonoda, Famenaseda, aufia, Nikolaseda ili amo molobebelelu. Nikolasemo, Adiogo inologulu, e Yuda inoloaleso, ehe ine gulugululomo kuliba ano. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Molobebelefasia, ilihe inolo domoba amo <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolo</char> si saabia yoba melasi, hilibailu ilihe Godedai sulu selesia, ine sone ili domoba amone guni saabia ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:41">HD 2.41</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 16:5">16.5</ref></char></note>Auba aufasia, Godene sulu mana hele sunia dedaleba yaasihe, Yelusalame ami sigidubulu idele inolo amone alegalumo ogoba sisiba wedinale holobagalu. Auba ausi, <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> wedinale noolo ilida, sigiba dobelesia, asigi ule ufulu.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda inolo ilihe Sidifene godolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Godehe Sidifene sagoba ofelesia, kiwi efea mesihe, e alefasia <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> bule nokene nokeneba idele inolo aleba ami mololu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Auluso, inolo noolo degefia, ilihe Sidifenedai sulu hegelu. Hegelu inolo ili amo hele wi Salinifiada, Alegesadiliafiada, disiligi aida Silisia amifiada, Asia amifiada milibaifia alolu. Ilihe Yudane gulugululo mosomu uleno amo ene wi Sububa Dafogolu Inolone Gulugululoba soda ami ili guluguluba ado. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:15">Lug 21.15</ref></char></note>Ili ami Sidifenedai hegeba selesi, Asubane Noekenemohe asigilo nafulu koleba Sidifenefea mesihe, amo alefasia ilihe ene sulu suniaeyodoluale alolu.<verse eid="ACT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ausi, ilihe masega si abulu inolo noolo wafe difasia, masega olofa sulu saamesiba mole melu. Inolo ili amo selesia, “Sidifenehe sulu woba <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesefeada</char>, Godefeada, soaneba selesi, nini dubuluba” solu. <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Auba selesi, idele inolone liboda, guni inoloda, <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli manane asigilu inoloda</char>, ine libo degeba ufulu. Aufia, ili Sidifene labea daafia, e sefia, galisolo labea lubia daalu. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Aufia, ilihe inolo noolo sulu masega efea olofa samesi gadefalu. Inolo ili amo selesia, “Hilia sunia inolo ogohe sebele molo amofeada, <char style="w">muguli</char> mana amofeada, sulu woba saeyomo afolale. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Ninihe sulu e selesi eweguba dubulu. ‘Nasalede inolo Yesumohe sebele molo ewe bidiba dafelesia, muguli mana Mosesehe samini ninifea melumoda dedegeyobafeba,’ Sidifene ogohe auba selesoba” solu.<verse eid="ACT 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Sulu auba selesi dobelesia, inolo galisolo moloa ami kakainalumo suniahe, Sidifene si galiba koleba sidasia, ilihe ene olegimo <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Godene sulu dia anone</char> olegigulu abulu.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Sidifenehe galisolo inolo ilifea sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Auba ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone yasilo</char> inolo ehe Sidifenefea doba bisigia, “Sulu ilihe fadaasia gafea oloba koweba selefe ogo amo sealela, me masegala?” <verse eid="ACT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 11:31">Stt 11.31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 12:1">12.1</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Sidifene selesia, “Nelewodali, naodali, gili doma. Amakelemo, nine nauwa <char style="w">Abalahama</char> Halana dauno ami aso daabale, hele Mesofodemia ligia, Gode <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elaleludamo</char> e labea holobagalu. <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />Godehe efea selesia, ‘Ga ge heleda, ge mosomuda, gadefia abia, hele Na gafea waleyobasu ami maiyo malale.’<verse eid="ACT 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Auba selesi, Abalahamahe hele Kalodia gadefasia, e Halana ami miliyo daalu. Aufia, ene enao olafia labimo, Godehe e hele iwi miliyo malalu. Hele amo, aga gilida kakainabu ogo. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:7">Stt 12.7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 15:18">15.18</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:8">17.8</ref></char></note>Godehe Abalahamafea hele ewe ene melesiba efea haisi uleno daalo meluale. Haisi wedino ulenoda efea meluale. Aubale. Auluso, Abalahama aso faibeda male labi, Godehe efea oloba huliale sulu saaba ofelesia selesia, ‘Dufiamo, hele ewe ge-da, ge sebedalineda, gine hele koleba miliyobafe.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:13-14">Stt 15.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:40">Kis 12.40</ref></char></note>Aufia, Godehe Abalahamafea selesia, ‘Ge gauwadalimo, egesialo mosomu none hele dedalefia, ilimo hele ami haiba mulu mosomu miliyobafe. Ami ligia, balu dabalu moloba ofolo alebaibi, mosomu no amohe ilimo woba ofolaba ligia, hamu fula biniba (400) ami dibolo inologulu miliyobafe. <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:12">Kis 3.12</ref></char></note>Auluso, dufiamo, mosomu abene balu dabalu ili mololu amo, Nahe fadaasia osolaeyobasu. Ausi, ge gauwadalimo hele amo afasia inigia, hele iwi Ne wi digiba saeyobafe.’ Gode auba solu. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:9-14">Stt 17.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 21:4">21.4</ref></char></note>Auba safasia, Godehe Abalahamafea <char style="w">oloba huliale dabalu</char> mololu amone eloba babiyone selesia, inolo faibe <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelemaleyone</char> mana ufulu. Aulune, Abalahama e Aisegene enao alefasia, hilia aaiyo adesi, ehe Aisegene bado amaleba gelelu. Aisege e-mo <char style="w" lemma="Yekobo">Yekobone</char> enao alefasia, Yekobo e-mo nine nauwadali mosomu hugulubamone enao alolu.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:11">Stt 37.11</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 37:26-28">26-28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 39:1-3">39.1-3</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 39:21-23">21-23</ref></char>
    </note>Nine nauwadalihe ine elewo <char style="w" lemma="Yosebe[[1]], Yekobone faibe hugulubamone ulenomo, e">Yosebefea</char> haboba hilisefia, ilihe e inolo noolone balu dabalu moloba ofolo melesi, Isibi inolofea elegelu. Ausi, inolo ili amohe e Isibi ulubia daaluso, Gode E aso edai alolu. <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:37-44">Stt 41.37-44</ref></char></note>Higinilu efea holobagaluiya amifia, Godehe e-mo gasiba dafelagolu. Ausi, Yosebehe Isibine Felaudai sulu selesimo, Godehe asigilo nafulu efea mesihe, Felaumo e hamemesi mololu. Ausi, ehe Yosebemo e sisa ligia, Isibi mosomuda, ene moloada, yasimesi gadefalu.<verse eid="ACT 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 41:54">Stt 41.54</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 42:1-2">42.1-2</ref></char>
    </note>Dufiamo, Isibi hele sunia amida, Kainani hele sunia amida, mamia gi bule holobagasi, idele inolo sunia higinilu bule abulu. Ausihe, nine nauwadalimo naiyo male alolu. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Auluso, Yekobohe Isibi helea ami, widi dobuba solu dofasia, ehe nine nauwadalimo Isibi helea fogo agele malalu. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:1-4">Stt 45.1-4</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 45:16">16</ref></char></note>Aufia, ili fogo aganebo aasimo, Yosebehe ene elewodalifea selesia, ‘Na Yosebeba’ solu. Auba selesi, dufia ami Isibine Felauhe eda Yosebene mosomumo fadaba asigilu. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 45:9-11">Stt 45.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 46:27">46.27</ref></char></note>Ausi, Yosebehe sulu sabaisia selesia, ene enao Yekoboda, ene mosomu idele inoloda, e labea milibaimesi welu. Idele inolo welu ili amone alegalumo daabuluba domobafia bia (75). <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 46:1-7">Stt 46.1-7</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 49:33">49.33</ref></char></note>Auba wesihe, Yekobomo Isibi helea suga daalu. Dufiamo, e Isibi hele ami olalu. Nine nauwadali ilida ami danelu. <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 23:2-20">Stt 23.2-20</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 33:19">33.19</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 24:32">Jos 24.32</ref></char></note>Ausi, ilihe ine domalamo obegeba dibia abia, Segeme dauno ami, inolo balila helea ami baliba ufulu. Saminimo, Abalahama ene mole noolomohe Hamoane faibilifea balilu hele amo elegeba dulu.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 1:7-8">Kis 1.7-8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sulu Godehe aiiba selesia, Abalahamafea oloba huliale saaba ufulu amo, wakaliba sugaeyone fogo hagoale adesi, Isolaele idele inolomo Isibi helea ami mosomu bule koleba holobagalu. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Aufia, inolo no, Yosebe aubada hiliseluale amohe, Isibine kini alolu. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:11-22">Kis 1.11-22</ref></char></note>Kini amo, ehe nine mosomu gegefia mana wolu ilifea mololu. Ehe nine nauwadalimone faibe subobo hilimo olamesisia, saidafalimaba egedidiba solu. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:2">Kis 2.2</ref></char></note>Amo fogomohe, <char style="w">Mosese</char> e-mo ene enaehe e seba dulu. Godene si saabia e faibe yogolelu alolu. Ilihe e-mo enao moloa aube osoloa uluba alolu. <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:3-10">Kis 2.3-10</ref></char></note>Aube osoloa alefasia, e baea ofasia labi, Felaune elewelihe e uluba difasia fofosihe, e ene faibegulu alolu. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Mosesehe Isibine dawalolo nafulumo sugulufia, e-mo inolo sulu koleba sododa, dabalu nokene nokeneba kiwigaaba mololo alolu.<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Mosese e hamu daabuluba biniba (40) adesi, ehe ene <char style="w">Isolaele</char> elewodali sobele babiyone maiyo asigilu. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:11-15">Kis 2.11-15</ref></char></note>Aufia, e bisigia, Isibi inolo ulenohe Isolaele inolo ulenofea mana isoluale molosi baafia, e Isolaele inolo amo sagoba ofelesia, Isibi inolo amo mololumone moloba sabe obegesia, dufa olalu. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Mosese hilisesia, ene elewodalimo Godehe efea alefasia ili sububa dafelagoyobafebuba eloba babiyobafeba hiliseluso, ili eloba abuluale. <verse eid="ACT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />Adigi nomohe, Mosese e Isolaele inolo aidamo aine meleba belaguba labea ami goalu. Ehe aalu seloaba ufiyo hamesia, aalufea selesia, ‘Aa, aali gelewo labe. Mau enene, aine meleba wose?’<verse eid="ACT 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Mosese auba selesi, inolo belaguyoda maugalu amo ehe, efea kaniba dafogofia selesia, ‘Abehe ga iminilune, ga guni inolo adesia, ani osolase? <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:14">Kis 2.14</ref></char></note>Gahe aide Isibi inolo dufa olaluguba, nada auba dufiyo molosela?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:21-22">Kis 2.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 18:3-4">18.3-4</ref></char></note>Mosesehe sulu amo dofasia, e fisaba daalu. E Midiene helea miliyo daafasia, haiba mulu inologulu ligia, ido dulumohe ene inolo faibe aida alolu.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.30 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 3:1-10">Kis 3.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:30-34">HD 7.30-34</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, hamu daabuluba binibamo (40) daafia labi, Mosese e <char style="w">Sainai</char> galea aniba isale hele falaiya ami labi, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> inolo uleno e labea holobagalu. I abobo, didigane efologulu, de waiya dagiba labea aleba ami, sulu dia ano e ami holobagalu. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Kegele amo holobagafemo bafasia, Mosese e wedinale keleba asigifia, e amo nafuluba babiyofia, hagoaleba aasi, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> efea selesia, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Ge gauwadali Abalahamada, Aisegeda, Yekoboda, ine Gode koleba amo, Na lolu.’ Auba selesi, Mosese e bibilifia amo babiyo sagililu. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Auba ausi, Saminilohe efea selesia, ‘Ga koleba, ge samaga ogo huba dama! Mau ene, hele ga-da yoba labe ogo Nahe maleelu <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekeneba</char> eloba ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Ne mosomu ilimo, Isibi hele ami woba dulu alebaibumo, Na seale Ne si koleba abulu. Aufia, ili naga sogoosia hame heefemo, Ne koneni dubulu. Ausi, Nahe ili sububa dafalibagoyone suga mulu. Aulugulu, ga degema, Na ga Isibi hilibaiyo hamefe.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 2:14">Kis 2.14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Samini Isolaelehe Mosese waaselaba bisigia, efea selesia, ‘Ga abehe guni inolo gadefafia, nine osolalo inolo gadefaso?’ Auluso, inolo Mosese hamaganemo, Godehe e-mo ine guni inologulu gadefafasia, ili sububa dafogoyone hilibailu. Godehe Ene sulu dia ano inolo i abobo aleba ami holobagalumo alefasia, e kiwigaaba ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:3">Kis 7.3</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:21">14.21</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 14:33">Nam 14.33</ref></char></note>Mosese ewehe Isibi hele ami <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> nokene nokeneba molosia, ili Isibi afasia luba dulu. Aufia, ehe Salu Hano Genelufealo amida, isale hele falaiya amida, eloba babiyone momolelu kegele wedinale mololumo, hamu daabuluba biniba (40) amoguba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 7:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 18:15">Lo 18.15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Mosese hamagane ehe Isolaele mosomu ilifea selesia, ‘Godehe gine gelewodali ugifia ulenomo iminiba ofelesia, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> nene na-gulu melesi gadefaeyobafeba’ solu. <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:3">Kis 19.3</ref></char></note>Dufiamo, nine nauwadalimo isale hele falaiya ami gagaiyosiamo, Mosese hamagane e ilidai alolu. Aufia, e-mo Sainai galea fela daafia, Godene sulu dia ano amohe, sulu efea saaba melu. Ehe Godene sulu miliyoludamo difasia, ehe sulu amo ninifea melu.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />Auluso, nine nauwadalimo Mosesehe sulu selefemo dubiyo hamesiale, e kaniba dafogofia, ine asigi nolofia, Isibifealo obegeba daafia alolu. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:1">Kis 32.1</ref></char></note>Auba ligia, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Alono">Alonofea</char> selesia, ‘Mosese ogo, e nini Isibi afasia uluba dibia mulumo, efea mololu ogo nini hilisebuale. Aulugulu, gahe nini eno saminiba uluba dibia fela malesi, nine gode noolo sone molomaleba’ solu. <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 32:2-6">Kis 32.2-6</ref></char></note>Fogo amo, ilihe dofene keao edo uleno sone molofasia, ilihe <char style="w">masega gode</char> amofea guluguluba ligiamo, ine sone mololu amofea henelu. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 5:25-27">Amo 5.25-27</ref></char></note>Auba ausi, Godehe ilifea faiso mefasia, ili anakiwine kegelefeada waagi gulugulumesi gadefalu. Amomo iminisia, saaba ofolo inolo bugo sulu eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 7:42" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">
    <char style="qt">‘Isolaele mosomu gilimo, hamu daabuluba biniba (40) isale hele falaiya alebaibia ami, gilihe dofene keaoda, dofene sibida, soba melu amo ulenoda Nafea ulu melubile? Aubale koleba.</char><verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />
    <char style="qt">
      <char style="w">Seele molo</char> gili digifia daalumo, amo Ne-ale. Aubale, amo masega gode Mologe amone.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, gilihe sigabi mimisililu molofasia digilumo, masega gode Lefane amone balai molo gili digifia daalubiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">
    <char style="qt">Gilihe masega godemone mimisililu moloba alolumo, gili ilifea wi digiba saeyofia mololubiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">
    <char style="qt">Aulugulu, Nahe gilimo hele gilida alebaibu ogo afasia, hele nolobalo <char style="w">Babilono</char> faisalo miliyo malaeyobasu.’</char></para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 7:43" />
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 7:43">Saaba ofolo bugo amo auba selelu dobu.<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />Nine nauwadali isale hele falaiya alolu fogo amo, Godene Seele Molo ilifea alolu. Moloa ami Godehe seale sulusu sodo. Ilihe balai molo amo disiamo, Godehe Mosesefea saaba mesi, e mimisililu abulu amogubasu dulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 3:14-17">Jos 3.14-17</ref></char></note>Balai molo amo difasia, nine nauwadali ili amo <char style="w">Yosua</char> sisa alebaisia, hele iwi inigia agifia milibailu. Aufia, Godehe nine nauwadaline si saabia, mosomu noolo amo hele iwifia asigaba dafalifia labi, ilihe balai molo amo helea iwi diba ufulu. Auba ofasia ligia, balai molo amo <char style="w">Deibidi</char> alolu fogo amida ufiasu aso alolu. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:1-16">2Sml 7.1-16</ref></char></note>Deibidi amo, Godehe efea nafuluba ufulu. E Godedai sulu selesiamo, molo uleno Yekobone mosomu ami daafia Godefea gulugulumesi na diyobileba doba abulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1-38">1Kin 6.1-38</ref></char></note>Auluso, ene e molo amo duluale, dufia <char style="w" lemma="Solomono">Solomonohe</char> molo amo dulu.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />Auluso, Gode Ana labe lago, E molo inolo sone dulu amo adale. Amo iminisia, saaba ofolo Aisaiahe eweguba selefe.<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.49 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 66:1-2">Ais 66.1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">Saminilo selesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">
    <char style="qt">‘<char style="w" lemma="Hebene">Hebenemo</char> Nada yoba misiyone asefalu ailalu dobu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">
    <char style="qt">Aufia helefealumo, Ne emo isoba ofolomo amo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">
    <char style="qt">Aulugulu, gilihe Ne molo halagulu diba ufiyobafebi?</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">
    <char style="qt">Aufia, Na halemane miliyone fogo, gilihe hala ufiyobi?</char><verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />
    <char style="qt">Kegele amo sunia, Nene Na sone mololumo, gili hilisebualela?’ ”</char><verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7.51 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 63:10">Ais 63.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sidifenehe saaba ofolo Aisaiane sulu auba safasia, ehe galisolo ili amofea gegoaba selesia, “Elelilo inolo, gili koleba. Gine asigine badoda, gine konenine badoda, amaleba geleluale alebaibu. Hilia sunia, gilihe gine gauwadali samini molologubasu moloba ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemone</char> sulu saidafalibasu alebailo. <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:31">Mad 23.31</ref></char></note>Saaba ofolo samini alolu halamohe, gine gauwadali mana wolu efea mololuale? Uleno male koleba. Mana Isolu Mololo Inolo miyobafeba saaba ofa selaba yaalu ili amo sunia, gine gauwadalihe dufa olaba yaalu. Aga, Isolu Mololo Inolo amo mulugulu, gilihe E-mo holonofia, E dufa olalu. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Godene sulu dia anone sone alefasia, gili Ene sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> dulu alebaibuso, gili koleba sulu amo kuliba anale.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Sidifene abane odesi, e olalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Galisolo inolo ilihe Sidifene sulu auba selefe amo dofasia, ine bese hegelefia, efea bule gadilu. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.55 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Sng 110.1</ref></char></note>Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> Sidifenefea wasigaasi, e <char style="w">Hebene</char> ana lago bisigia, ehe Godene <char style="w" lemma="Elalelu">elalelumoda</char> bisigiamo, Yesumo Gode ene sone lilibefealo yoba labi abulu. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 3:1">Kol 3.1</ref></char></note>E selesia, “Bama, Hebene eno sogoba dobi na bosolu. Aufia, na bisigia, <char style="w" lemma="Inololene Faibe">Inololene Faibemo</char>, Gode Ene sone lilibefealo yoba labi bosoluba” solu.<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />E auba selesi, ili koleba galagilisia, ine koneni kakalu. Aufia, ili ua degefia, dedalesia, Sidifene selu. <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />Ilihe e sidi amone fafa faisalo sigiba dibia daafia, e abane odesi olalu. Si abulu inolo ili amohe abane uliyosia, ine fagulo selalemo hufasia, inolo fisamili uleno amo yasimesi, e labea ami diba waalelu. Inolo fisamili amone wimo, <char style="w">Solo</char>.<verse eid="ACT 7:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Ilihe Sidifene abane odaba labi, e Godedai sulu selesia, “Saminilo Yesu-ooo! Ga koleba, ne asubane dima!” <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.60 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:34">Lug 23.34</ref></char></note>Aufia, e emo hugulumo sagaba sigia, koleba wuaasia, “Saminilo-ooo, Gahe ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> amo ilifea sabe obegemabiyo.” Sidifene auba saafia, e olalu.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Inolo Solo amone si saabia, mana ili Sidifenefea mololu amo isolu.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Solohe sese woba ofelesihe ili budiba dedalelu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Hilia ilihe Sidifeneda dufelefeyamo, ilihe <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo Yelusalame kakainalumo woba ufiyo maugalu. Auba ausihe, sese idele inolo sunia Yudiafealoda, Samaliafealoda, fisaba dedaleba yaalu. Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolo</char> ili aso Yelusalame hamagi alolu. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Inolo noolo mana nafulu Gode hamefeguba kuliba ano amo ilihe Sidifene kuanoba bule yegilifia, baliba ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1">HD 9.1</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 9:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:4">22.4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26.9-11</ref></char></note>Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Solo">Solohe</char> sese idele inolo woba ofelesia, ehe ine moloa moloaba sugafia, inolodalida, ideleda, sigi dia abia dibolo dafalibagolu.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe awalu sulu nafulu Samalia ami walelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Idele inolo budiba dedalelu ili amohe, ilida dedaleleiya ami awalu sulu nafulu walelu. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" /><char style="w" lemma="Filibi[[2]], digono inolo uleno">Filibi</char> e Samalia ami dauno uleno daafia, <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> awalu sulu nafulu ilifea walelu. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Idele inolo wedinale koleba noolohe Filibi sulu selefemo dobelesiada, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> e molofemo bisigiada, e selefemo nafuluba dubulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Filibihe idele inolo wedinalefea <char style="w">asubane wolu</char> adaaba yaalumo asigaba dafalisi, asubane wolu amo ilihe wobasubale sogaafia, ili gadefia dedalelu. Aufia, inolo wedinale ine emo maualuda, emo woluda, amo sunia waiba waalelu. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Auba ausihe, idele inolo dauno ami kakainalu ili amo henelu bule alolu.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Inolo uleno dauno ami alolumo, ene wi Saimono. Fogo noolo ami e gone moloba dedeba labi, Samalia idele inolo ili amo baafia, momoleba abulu. Ehe inolo bule lolusia, na bamabamaba sodo. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Auba ausi, inolo widada, widaleda, ili suniahe Saimono amone sulu selefemo kiwigaaba dobelesia, ili selesia, “Godene kiwigagalu bulemo inolo ewefea labebuba” sodo. <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Ehe gone auba moloba ligia, fogo selale aleba ami, idele inolo ilihe e molofe amo hidigifia momoleba bamesi moloba ufulugulu, ili ene sulu kuliba ano. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Auluso, Filibi ami milifasia, ehe Gode Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamone awalu sulu nafuluda, Yesu Kelisone wida, selesimo, ideleda, inolodalida ili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesimo</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geba</char> ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Ausi, Saimono ogo eda asigi ule ofelesi, hano gefasia, e Filibidai siba ligia, Filibihe <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> bule nokene nokeneba molofe baafia, e momoleba abulu.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">Hilibailu inolo</char> Yelusalame kakainalumo, ilihe Samalia ilimo Godene sulu mana dobelefeba solu dofasia, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidadai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonedaimo</char>, ili labea malalu. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Aalu ami goasia, Godedai sulu selesiamo, Ehe Ene <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> Samalia ilifea memesiba solu. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Mau enebamo, Asubane Noekenemo ilifea aso muluale. Ili Yesune wi saabiasu hano gelu alolu. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:6">HD 19.6</ref></char></note>Aaluhe Godedai sulu saaba samodofia, aufia aine sone ili saabia ofelesihe, ili Asubane Noekenemo dulu.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Saimono ogohe hilibailu inolo aidahe sone idele inolo saabia ofelesihe ili <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane</char> dife baafia, ehe mole aalufea dibia inigia selesia, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />“Aali kiwi ogo nafeada mema. Aufia, na soneda inolo uleno saabia ofelesenaga, eda Asubane Noekenemo dimesi.” <verse eid="ACT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Auluso, Fidahe Saimono ogofea selesia, “Ge mole ogo genedai woyobafe. Kegele Gode alefasia ulu melo amo, ga mole elegeyodolububa asigifela? Auba mololale koleba. <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Ge asigine libo ogo Godene si saabia isoluale. Aulugulu, nini Godene dabalu moloba lolu usu ewe, ga miliyodoluale kolebabu. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Ga <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besima</char>. Aufia, ge wolu mana ogofea faiso mefia, gahe <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> ge libone asigi wolu dobu ogo diba damaleyobileba saamale. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Na selesumo mau enebamo, na bisigia, ge libo kabilu wasigafia labi, ga-mo mana wolu amofea alefasia kolofolo ufulugulu labe.” <verse eid="ACT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Fida auba selesi, Saimono ogohe aalufea obegeba selesia, “Aalihe na hilisesia, Saminilodai sulu saaba homale. E alefasia, kegele uleno aali nafea seleso amo holobagamesiale.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Aufia, hilibailu inolo ilihe Saminilone sulu mana selesiamo, kegele Saminilohe ilifea mololu amone idele inolofea sulu saaba dafelagolu. Aufia dufia, ili Yelusalame obegeba abia, ilihe Samalia mosomu wedinale dobia ami sulu nafulu walelabia daalu.<figure style="fig" alt="Filibi e siba alolu" file="Philip_Journey.jpg" size="span" loc="8.25" ref="8.4-40">Filibi e siba alolu (8.4–40)</figure><verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filibihe Idiobia inolofea awalu sulu nafulu walelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Saminilone sulu dia ano</char> inolo ulenohe <char style="w" lemma="Filibi[[2]], digono inolo uleno">Filibifea</char> selesia, “Ga degefia, Yelusalame afasia, nolobalo ilogolo abia, mosomu Gasa goayo aafe eno amo malale.” Eno amo hele falaiya inoloda male hele dobu. <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Auba selesi, Filibi e degefia daalu. Eno kia ami, ehe Idiobia<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Idiobia</char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo Afilika hele uleno.</char></note> inolo uleno wakalilu. Inolo amo Idiobiane gamane inolo bule alolu. E hele amone kuwini Kanadasi ido amone dabalu mololo ligia, ene mole sunia e yasilo. E magoloba dugulu inolo alolu.<note caller="†" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fogo amo, ilihe kinine dabalu mololo inolo amo magoloba dugulo. Maumo, dabalu mololo ili amo kinine eamonodai, elewelidalida hanelosifia auba mololo. Aulugulu, Idiobia inolo ewe eda magoloba dugulu alolu. </char></note> E Yelusalame guluguluyo mulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Gulugulufasia, e ene moloa haiba obegeba abiamo, ene <char style="w">kalisi</char> saabia asefasia, bugo <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaia</char> selelumone alegalabia daalu. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char> Filibifea selesia, “Ga kalisi amo daaba labea ami, e aniba daaba melale.”<verse eid="ACT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Auba selesi, Filibihe e naguba daafia, kalisi aniba goafia ligia, inolo amo saaba ofolo Aisaia bugo selelumo alegaba labi, dubulu. Filibihe efea selesia, “Sulu ga alegafe ogone sisamo, ga asigiba difela?” <verse eid="ACT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Auba selesi, inolo amo obegeba selesia, “Sulu ewene maumo sawayone inolo uleno malenaga, amo sulu ewene maumo, na eneba diyobi?” Aufia, e Filibifea selesia, “Ga kalisi saabia aleba lagofia, nadai misiyo milaleyobile?” <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7-8">Ais 53.7-8</ref></char></note>Bugo haisi sulu e alegaba alolumo, eweguba selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 8:32" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">
    <char style="qt">“E <char style="w">dofene sibi</char> dufiyone ulubia anogulu alolu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">
    <char style="qt">E dofene sibi edo alu geleyone ulubia anoguba aasi, saufia alolu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">
    <char style="qt">E sulu ulenoda soluale.</char><verse eid="ACT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />
    <char style="qt">Ilihe e seale koleba dufa dafogosia, ilihe e isoba fadaaluale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">
    <char style="qt">Ene miliyolu helefealu iwi alolumo diba dafulu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">
    <char style="qt">Aulune, ene saladegelu sebe amone sulu saaba, uleno abehe saeyodolubi?”</char><verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Magoloba dugulu inolo amohe sulu amo alegaba samodofia, e Filibifea doba bisigia, “Na gafea doba bosolu, saaba ofolo inolohe halane sulu saaba auba solu? Ehe enemone solula? Me inolo nomone solula?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Auba selesi, Filibihe sulu haisi inolo amo alegalumone mau sisa sawaba waleyo maugasia, ehe Yesune awalu sulu nafulu amone walelu.<verse eid="ACT 8:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36-37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36-37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8.36-37 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 10:47">HD 10.47</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aalu eno aiba daaba ligia, hano ule dobia goasi, inolo amo selesia, “Hano dobu bama. Kegele uleno na kaafegulu, na <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geyalebile</char>?” <verse eid="ACT 8:36-37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Inolo amo auba selesi, kalisida selo inolo amohe hosomo kalugamafia, Filibidai inolo amodai hano suga daafia, Filibihe e hano geba ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Aalu hano afasia aleba lagosi, alebale Saminilone Asubanehe Filibi dia daalu. Dia aasi, inolo amohe e haiba saabia no abuluale. Auluso, e henelabia eno ene maiyoguba daalu. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:8">HD 21.8</ref></char></note>Ausi, Filibihe e mosomu Asododo holobagafia, mosomu suniada ami Yesune awalu sulu nafulu walelabia abia, dufia e Sisalia dauno goalu. <figure style="fig" alt="Phillip baptizes the Ethiopian eunuch" file="IB04184.TIF" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="8.26-38">Filibihe Idiobia inolo hano geba ofelefe.</figure><verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Solo e asigi besilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:4-16">Hilibaisi Daalu 22.4-16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-18">26.9-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">HD 8.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Amo fogomo, <char style="w" lemma="Solo">Solohe</char> <char style="w">Saminilo</char> kuliba silo ili dufa dafiyone sulu kiwigaaba selaba alolugulu, e <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> labea daalu. <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />Ami goafia, soba melone guni inolofea sowi seleba memaleyobileba solu. Solo ehe sowi amo Damasegese sidi ami sefia abia, Yudane guni inolo ami alebaibu ili amofea meyo maiyo hiliselu. Ausi, soba melone guni inolo sowi seleba ofasia, Solofea melu. Sowi amo eweguba selesia seleba ufulu. “Solohe bisigia, idele noolo me inolo noolo Yesuda kuliba sife amo besenaga, ili amo sefia, dofafia, Yelusalame iwi uluba dibia milibaiyo dobu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Solo e sowi amo sefia, Yelusalame afasia, Damasegese maiyo daalu. E ama Damasegese ami goayo hagoalesi, bosolufalumo <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">Hebenene</char> yane ule e labea suga milifasia, neeba amalelu. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Solo e helea gelebaisia, e inolo ulenone mofe sulu eweguba selesi dubulu. “Solo-ooo, Solo-ooo, gahe Na woba ofelesego, enesi ause?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Auba selesi, Solo selesia, “Saminilo, ga abe?” Auba selesi, E selesia, “Na Yesu. Inolo, gahe woba moloyosia asigafe, amo Na. <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />Ga degefia, sidi usu suga mala. Dufiamo inolo ulenohe kegele ga molomesi gafea sulu saaba meyobafe.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Auba moloba holobagafia labi, inolo noolo Solodai dedalelumo wobasubale hidigifia, ili sulu sausagalu. Ilihe inolo ulenone mofehe sulu selesi dubuluso, ilihe inolo uleno abuluale. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Ausi, Solo e degefia, si fisigaluso, kegele babiyodoluale alolu. Auba ausi, ilihe ene sone gasiba sefia, e-mo Damasegese ami ulubia daalu. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />E hilia osoloamo, kegele babiyodoluale ligia, naiyoda hanoda nabale doloma alolu.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Damasegese ami, Yesune <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> uleno alolumo, ene wimo Ananiase. Ananiase e halaga bisigia, Saminilohe e eweguba wesi dubulu. “Ananiase-ooo!” Ausi, e obegeba selesia, “Saminilo, na lolu ewe.” <verse eid="ACT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Ausi, Saminilohe efea selesia, “Ga degefia abia, eno Isoluba sodo ami, Yudasane moloa malale. Dasusu dauno inolo uleno, ene wi Solo, moloa ami yoba sigia, Godedai sulu selaba labe. Gahe molo biso amofea, inolo Solo amo babiyone waneyo malale. <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Inolo Solo amone si kalalu labeso, e halaga bisigiamo, inolo uleno ene wi Ananiase huga milifasia, ene sone e saabia ofelesia, ene simo haiba saabia bebelemesifia molosi abulu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Saminilo efea auba selesi dofasia, Ananiase obegeba selesia, “Saminilo, inolo ewe moloba yaalumo saludiale awaba selesi, na dubulu. Ehe ge <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">muuba kalilu idele inolo</char> Yelusalame labemofea woba ofolaba yaalumone na dubulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />E soba melone guni inolofea kiwi difasia, iwi mulumo idele inolo ge wi selaba labe amone seyone mulu.” <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:2">HD 26.2</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:24">27.24</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:5">Lom 1.5</ref></char></note>Ananiase auba soluso, Saminilo efea selesia, “Ga mala! Enebamo, Nahe inolo ewe ne dabalu molomesi molobebelelu. Na alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> noolo labeada, kini noolo labeada, <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu ilifeada, Ne wi ilifea saaba memesi e gadefalu. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:23-28">2Kld 11.23-28</ref></char></note>Ehe Ne wi alefasia, nagada, higinilu nooloda, diyobafemone, Nahe efea waleyobasu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Auba selesi, Ananiase e abia, molo amo suga daafia, ene sone Solo saabia ofelesia selesia, “Nelewo Solo, Saminilo Yesu ga labea eno kia holobagalu amo Ehe, aga na ga labea malaso. Ehe na malasiamo, ga haiba nafuluba bebelemesineda, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> gafea wasigamesineda, auba auso.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Ananiasehe auba saafia labi, alebale hamagi bebegulu ene si ufulumo, hogoba sugasihe, e haiba nafuluba saabia bebelelu. Aufia, e degefia <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gelu</char>. <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />Aufia, Solo e naiyo naasi, e haiba kiwigaalu. Aufia, e hilia noolo Damasegesene walelu faibili galiba ami alolu.<verse eid="ACT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solohe awalu sulu nafulu Damasegese ami waleba alolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Aufia ami, e alebale <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">Yudane gulugululo moloa</char> ami suga daafia, e selesia, Yesu e Godene faibe labeba maugaba saaba melu. <verse eid="ACT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">HD 8.3</ref></char></note>Inolo sunia Solo sulu selefemo dofasia, ili wobasubale hidigifia selesia, “Inolo ogohe Yelusalame ami, idele inolo Yesufea gulugulufe ili amo woba ofolo, amo e-bula? E iwi mulumo, idele inolo amo dofafia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> labea ulubia maiyone mulualebile?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:28">HD 18.28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Solo">Solone</char> kiwigagalumo bule alefasia, ehe <char style="w">Yuda</char> ili Damasegese kakainalu amofea nafuluba fadaba saaba mesia, Godehe inolo Yesumo ene idele inolo obegeba diyone iminiba ufulu. Yesu E Mesaea labe. Solohe sulu auba koleba gadugaduba selesi, Yuda inolo ami kakainalumohe efea sulu obegeba saeyodoluale alolu.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda ilihe Solofea gisa adesi, e fisaba daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Hilia wedinale daafia labi, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo noolo guni gagaba gagaiyofia, ili Solo dufa olaeyone sulu ule ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />Aufia, ilihe yaidada, nigilibada, sidi amone eno saliba sunia e dufiyone gele ufia yasiba adaaba yaalu. Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Solo">Solohe</char> ili auba daiyalu dobuba solumo sulu gi dubulu.<verse eid="ACT 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:32-33">2Kld 11.32-33</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ausi, Solone <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilihe, e nigiliba ami sidi amone yala duluiya saabia ana lago ulubia fela daalu. Aufia, ilihe e selege alu bule uleno usu ami mesafia, ilihe selegemo efolo godaifia, sidi amone yala faisalo esebalo esebaloba helea iligi dafogosi, Solo fisaba daalu. <figure style="fig" alt="Saul escapes over the wall in a basket" file="44_Ac_09_17_RG_gr.tif" size="col" copy="© Sweet Publishing http://sweetpublishing.com, licensed under a CC: BY-SA 3.0 Unported licence." ref="9.22-25">Solo selege alu asefasia, fisaba aafe.</figure><verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Solo e Yelusalame ami alolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 1:17-19">Gal 1.17-19</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, abia, Solo e Yelusalame goafia, ehe <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibilidali</char> gegoayo hameluso, ili sunia e seale walelu faibe labebuba <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesiale</char>, ilihe e baaba sagililu alolu. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:1">1Kld 9.1</ref></char></note>Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Banabasa">Banabasahe</char> Solo ulubia abia, <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolo</char> labea daalu. Aufia, Banabasa ilifea selesia, Solo ewehe eno aiba abia, Saminilo abulumoda, Saminilo efea sulu solumoda, sadalu amo awaba melu. Aufia, Banabasahe ilifea saabia selesia, Solo ewe Damasegese ami Yesune wi saabia kiwigaaba Godene sulu mana walelu amoda awaba melu. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Auba ausi, Solo e ilidai sigia, Yelusalame sidi usu ami siba ligia, sagilisiale, ehe Saminilone wi saabia kiwigaaba selaba alolu. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Ehe Giligi sulu sodo Yuda inolo noolodai sulu hegeba selaba labi, ilihe e dufa olaeyone eno isalu. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Aufia, elewodali noolohe ili daiyafe amo baafia, ilihe Solomo lubia, Sisalia sidi huga daafia, e-mo Dasusu dauno ami maiyo malalelu.<verse eid="ACT 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Aufia, Yudia hele amida, Galili amida, Samalia amida, <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo sunia <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> adesi, inolo noolohe ili woba ufulualegulu, sese kiwigaalu. Ili Saminilo sisa ligia kuliba adesi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char> ine libo kiwigaaba ofelesi, idele inolo wedinale ilifea gegoaba adesi, sese ami bulelu.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidahe Ainiase waiba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e hele amo sunia siba ligia, Lida dauno ami sugafia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Godene muuba kalilu</char> idele inolo kakainabia ami sobele daalu. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Dauno ami inolo uleno asulumo, ene wimo Ainiase. Ene kiwimo sunia kakaloba olalu ufia alolune, e molobiasu hanefia ligia, hamu aaiyoba daalu. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Ausi, Fidahe efea selesia, “Ainiase, aga Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisohe</char> ga waiba ofelefe. Ga degefia, ge molobu isoma.” Auba selesi, e alebale degelu. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Auba ausi, idele inolo Salono amida, Lida amida, kakainalumo, ili sunia Ainiase waiba ufulumo baafia, Saminilofea asigi ule ufulu.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidahe ido Dabidamo haiba degeba ifolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Yoba dauno ami Yesuda kuliba silo ido uleno asulumo, ene wi Dabida. Sulu Dabidamo, Giligi sulubamo, Dogaseba sodo. Hilia sunia, ido amo mana nafulu moloba ligia, weagulu idele inolo amone sagoba ofolabasu adobiyo. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Fogo amo e walefafia olasi, ili ene domalamo hano heefia, hogolilu uleno ana ami ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Yoba dauno amo, Lida aniba ufulugulu, <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fidamo</char> Lida ami labeba solu dofasia, ilihe inolo aida e labea malasia selesia, “Ga nini labea alebale koleba milale. Ga yasimabiyoba” solu.<verse eid="ACT 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Auba selesi, Fida degefia aaludai daalu. E ami goasi, ilihe e lubia, hogolilu ana dobia ami felalu. E ami labi, idele ilisulu wedinale ili milibailu. Ilihe Fida aniba degeba alebaifia yegiliba ligia, fagulomo Dogasehe e aso ili galiba ligia asogolumo, Fidafea waleba alolu. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Auba labi, Fidahe idele inolo sunia ami alebailumo baea dedalemafia, e emo hugulumo sagafia, Godedai sulu saafia, e ido amone domala dobufealo nolofia, selesia, “Dabida, ga degemaba” solu. Auba selesi, ido amo si fisigafia, Fida sidafia degeba asulu. <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Auba ausi, Fidahe ene sone gasiba sefia, e degeba melalu. Aufia, ehe sigidubulu ilida, ilisulu ilida, milibaimafia, Dabida e haiba degeba ifoluba ilifea walelu. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Fidahe mololu sulu amo, Yoba dauno sunia doba sigisi, idele inolo wedinale Saminilofea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char>. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Aufia, Fida e Yoba ami, inolo uleno ene wi Saimono, edai hilia wedinale alolu. Inolo amo e dofene keaone bado molafasia, dabalu kegele noolo moloyone madeneba ofolo.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Godene sulu dia ano inolo uleno Koniliusu labea holobagafia, efea sulu saaba melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Sisalia sidi ami, inolo uleno asulumo, ene wi Koniliusu. E Lomene aamine yasilo uleno alolu. Inolo daabulubasu daabuluba (100) e sisa ado. Idaline Yobolo Mosomuba sodomone uleno, e alolu.<verse eid="ACT 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Inolo Koniliusu amo, Gode hamefegubasu kuliba abia, ene damene ene moloa kakainalomoda, ili sunia Gode sisa ado. Ehe mole kegele wedinale Yudane weagulu inolo sagoba waalemesi mesia, aufia hilia sunia e <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selaba</char> ado. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Hilia uleno, halosi osolo geidesi, ehe halaga bologuba ulufaba bisigia, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> uleno molo usu suga saabi abulu. Sulu dia ano amo efea selesia, “Koniliusuba” solu.<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Auba selesi, Koniliusu e baafia sagilisia selesia, “<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, amo enebuba” solu. Sulu dia ano Koniliusufea selesia, “Godehe ga <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Edai sulu sodomo</char> dofasia, aufia gahe mole kegele weagulu inolofea melomone hilisesia, Ehe ge mana amo hamebu. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Aga gahe inolo noolo Yoba dauno ami, inolo uleno iwi milesi saeyone mebaimale. Inolo amo ene wimo <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char>, ene wi nomo <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char>. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Inolo amo ene enesaiyone moloa saabe. Enesaiyomo e dofene keao bado dabalu mololo. Ene molomo salu hano galubu aniba labe.”<verse eid="ACT 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Saminilone sulu dia ano">Sulu dia anomohe</char> Koniliusufea sulu saaba mefasia, daafia labi, Koniliusu ene dabalu mololo aleba ami inolo aida wesia, aami inolo ulenodai milalu. Aami inolo amomo, eda mana Gode hamefeguba kuliba abia, hilia sunia Koniliusudai adomo, no e. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Aufia, Koniliusuhe kegele efea mololumo sunia nafuluba inolo osoloa amofea saaba mefia, ehe ilimo Yoba dauno maiyone malalu.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidahe halaga bologuba abulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Adigi keafa amone haloa, ili Yoba dauno hagoaleba ami goaba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e Godedai sulu saeyone molo fagia ana felalu. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Fogo amo, e mamiasi, e naiyo naiyo hiliselu. Ausi, ili ilogo naiyo aso madeneba adesi, Fidahe halaga bologuba abulu. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Ehe anakiwi sogoba ofelesi baafia, kegele uleno fagulo bulegulu hau binibamo sefia, helea dia huga saabi abulu. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Fagulo amone saabiamo, kelebulu noolo suniada, koanoda, haga nooloda amo saabia yoba alebaibi abulu. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Aufia, Fidahe mofe uleno eweguba selesi dubulu. “Fida, ga degefia, kelebulu ogo yasofia namena.”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 11:1-47">Wkp 11.1-47</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 4:14">Ese 4.14</ref></char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Fida selesia, “Saminilo, na koleba naiyale. Nugumalu kegeleda, aiyalu kegeleda, hilia uleno na mololualene, agada na naiyale.” <verse eid="ACT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:15">Mag 7.15</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 7:19">19</ref></char></note>Ausi, mofebu saabia aganebo efea selesia, “Kegele Gode alefasia aiyalale gadefalumo, gahe aiyayoba samabu.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Kegele amo osoloaba holobagafia, fagulo amo alebale anakiwifealo haiba sigiba diba lagolu.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17-18" />Ausi, Fidahe wedinale keleba hilisefia selesia, “Na halaga abulumone, maumo enebi?” E auba aso hilisefia labi, inolo Koniliusu malaba solumo, ili molo isalabia abia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimonone</char> molo baafia, eno saliba ami kalugaafia ligia, doba bisigia, “Saimono, ene wi no Fida amo, iwi saabela me malela?” <verse eid="ACT 10:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Fidahe halaga abulu amo aso hiliseba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char> efea selesia, “Saimono, inolo osoloahe ga isafe. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Aulugulu, ga degefia suga mala. Nahe ili hilibailugulu, ga ili galiba maiyone sesaimabiyo.”<verse eid="ACT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Fida suga daafia ilifea selesia, “Inolo gili isafe ogomo, na. Gili enesi mulu?” <verse eid="ACT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Ausi, ilihe selesia, “Koniliusu e-mo, aami inolo daabulubasu daabuluba amone yasilomo, ehe nini malaso. E isolu inologulu, e Gode baaba sagililo. <char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomu ili sunia selesia, e inolo nafuluba sodo. <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekene</char> uleno efea saaba mesia, inolo Fida amo ge moloa lubia milafia, sulu e selefemo, ga domaleba soluso.” Inolo osoloa Fidafea auba solu. <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Ili selefemo dofasia, Fidahe ilimo ene moloa suga milafia, ehe ili heneba luba alolu. Aufia, adigi keafa e degefia, ilidai ua daalu. Ausi, sigidubulu elewodali noolo Yoba ami alolumo ilida e galiba dedalelu.<verse eid="ACT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fida e Koniliusune moloa daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Fidada, inolo ili amoda, abia, hilia uleno eno kia hanefasia, ili abia, Sisalia sidi goalu. Koniliusuhe ili ami obegeba miyobafeba yasifia ligia, ene mosomuda, ene samadalimoda, weba sigilu. Ili milibaifia, ene moloa gagaiyofia kakainalu. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" /><char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e molo usu sugasi, Koniliusu e wakaliyosia inigia, Fidane emo sisa emo hugulumo sagaba sigia, efea gulugululu. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:13-15">HD 14.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:10">MUU 19.10</ref></char></note>Auluso, Fidahe e degemesi selesia, “Ga degema! Nada, na inolo balu loluba” solu.<verse eid="ACT 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Edai sulu selabia molo usu sugasia, bosolufalumo, idele inolo wedinale gagaiyofia kakainabi abulu. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Aufia, Fidahe ilifea selesia, “Nini Yudamo, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolodai</char> gagaiyosia wakalimabiyoba elo ufulumo, amo gili asigibu. Auluso, Godehe nafea walelumofea alefasia, nahe inolo ulenofea nugumaluba aiyaba saeyale. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Aulugulu, na gine welu dofasia, gine sulu saidafelesiale mulugulu, aga na asigiyo hamefe. Gili na welumo, eneyone welu?”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30-31" />Auba selesi, Koniliusu selesia, “Hilia biniba hanefia, halosi osolo eweguba geide adesi, na <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu selaba</char> ligia, bosolufalumo, inolo uleno fagulo elalelu kaafia, na mia kalugaasia selesia, ‘Koniliusu, Godehe ga Edai sulu sodomo dofasia, mole kegele ga weagulu inolofea melomo amone hiliselu. <verse eid="ACT 10:30-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Gahe inolo noolo Yoba dauno ami malalesiamo, inolo <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char>, ene wi no Fida, amo milalemale. Inolo amo ene enesaiyone moloa saabe. Enesaiyo amo e dofene keao bado dabalu mololo. Ene molomo salu hano galubu amone aniba labe.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Inolo amo auba selesi, na ga alebale milalemalelugulu, ga mulumo, nafulu koleba. Aulugulu, nini sunia Godene si saabia gagaiyofia lolu ewemo, Saminilo sulu gafea saaba melu amo ninifea saaba memesi hamefe.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fidahe Koniliusu ene moloa ami Godene sulu mana walelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 10:17">Lo 10.17</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:11">Lom 2.11</ref></char>
    </note>Koniliusu auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> selesia, “Seale koleba, aga na hilisefe, Godehe idele inolo suniafeamo mana imini ulusesu mololo. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Mosomu sunia E sisa ligia, mana isoluda molofe ili amo, E hamelo. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Nini <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomufea Gode sulu nafulu saaba melu. Sulu nafulu amomo, ewe. Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> E alefasia nini Godedai <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> melesi seloaba ufulu. Yesu E suniane Saminilo labe. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mad 4.12-17</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonehe</char> idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gemaleba</char> saaba mefasia, kegele Galili ami maugafia, Yudia hele sunia moloba samodolu amo, gili asigibu. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mad 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:17-21">Lug 4.17-21</ref></char></note>Godehe Nasalede inolo Yesu iminiba ofelesia, Ene <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> kiwigagalu buleda Efea mesihe, E siba ligia, idele inolo noolo sagoba ufulu amo, gili hilisebu. Gode Edai ligiane, Ehe inolo sunia <char style="w" lemma="Henane">henanene</char> kiwigagalu sisa alolumo nafulu molosia, waiba waalelumo, gili asigibu.<verse eid="ACT 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Kegele sunia Yesuhe Isolaele helea amida, Yelusalame sidi amida, mololu amo, nine si abulu. Aulugulu, nini abulumone sulu saaba dafelagoba lolu. Ilihe E imolane baaba dofasi, E olaso. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Auluso, hilia osoloa alefasia, Godehe e <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifofasia</char>, idele inolo noolo E bamesi gadefaso. <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:8">HD 1.8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:42-43">Lug 24.42-43</ref></char></note>Idele inolo ili sunia E abuluale. Auluso, Godehe samini ene sulu saamesi molobebelelu nini amosu, E si abulu. E haiba degeba ifofasia labi, ninimo naiyoda hanoda Edai ua mololu. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.42 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:31">HD 17.31</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:5">1Fid 4.5</ref></char></note>Ehe ninifea idele inolofea saamesi, eweguba sawaba saaba dafelagomalu. ‘Idele inolo aso bebea kakainabu ili amoda, daneba yaalu ili amoda, Osolaeyone Iminilu Inolo amo, E-su labe. Godehe E amo moloyone iminifia gadefalu.’ Ehe ninifea auba saamalelu. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5-6">Ais 53.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:34">Jer 31.34</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 2:38">HD 2.38</ref></char></note><char style="w">Saaba ofolo</char> ili suniahe koleba saaba ofa selesia, idele inolo sunia Inolo ewefea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesi</char>, Godehe ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> hamasia heeba dafelesia galiyobafeba solu.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yau mosomu ilida Godene Asubane Noekenemo dulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10.44 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 11:15">HD 11.15</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:8">15.8</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e aso sulu amo selaba labi, bosolufalumo, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> sulu amoda dobelefe ili amo suniafea suga mulu. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45-46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45-46" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.45-46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:4">HD 2.4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:6">19.6</ref></char></note>Yuda mosomune sigidubulu inolo noolo Fidadai milibailumohe, idele inolo ili amohe <char style="w" lemma="Asubanene sulu nonoba sodo">Asubanene sulu nonoba</char> selesia, Godene wi digife amo dobelesia, ili hidigifia selesia, “Bama. Godehe Ene Asubane Noekenemo <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> ilifeada, ulu kegele meloguba, guguba dafogolububa” solu. <verse eid="ACT 10:45-46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />Aufia, Fida selesia, “Mosomu ewe Asubane Noekenemo nini duluguba difegulu, abehe ili <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geyaleba</char> eloba kaeyo?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:5">HD 19.5</ref></char></note>Aufia, Fidahe idele inolo amofea selesia, “Gili Yesu Kelisone wifea alefasia, hano gemaleba” solu. Hano geba yaafasia, ilihe e-mo hilia noolo ilidai melaleyobileba doba bebelelu.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Fida e Yelusalame daafia, kegele noolo holobagalu amone awaba melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">Hilibailu inolo</char> ilida, elewodali hele Yudia ami kakainaba yaalu ili amoda, ilihe dobelesia, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> ilida Godene sulu mana duluba solumo dubulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e Yelusalame obegeba goasi, <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelelo</char> amone sigidubulu ili amohe efea gadisia, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:28">HD 10.28</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:12">Gal 2.12</ref></char></note>selesia, “Gahe inolo bado amaleba gelelale moloa daafia, ilidai naiyo ua mololugo, enebane ause?”<verse eid="ACT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Ausi, Fidahe kegele sunia efea holobagalu amonesu ilifea fadaba awaba mesia, selesia, <verse eid="ACT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:9-48">HD 10.9-48</ref></char></note>“Na Yoba dauno ami ligia, hilia uleno na Godedai sulu selaba ligia, na halaga bologuba abulu. Kegele uleno fagulo bulegulu, anakiwifia hau binibamo sefia, helea dia huga saabi abulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Na fagulo amone usu nafuluba bisigia, bosolufalumo, kelebulu nooloda, ilaluba siloda, koano kegeleda, aufia hagada, amo saabia yoba alebaibi abulu. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Aufia, na mofebu uleno eweguba selesi dubulu. ‘Fida, ga degefia, kelebulu ogo yasofia namena.’<verse eid="ACT 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Ausi, na obegeba selesia, ‘<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, na koleba naiyale. Nugumalu kegeleda, aiyalu kegeleda, hilia uleno ne mofe sugalualene, na naiyale.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Auluso, <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">Hebenefia</char> sulu mofebu haiba saabia aganebo selesia, ‘Kegele Gode alefasia, aiyalale gadefalumo, gahe aiyayoba samabu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Kegele amo osoloaba holobagafasia, amo sunia haiba anakiwifealo sigiba diba lagoso.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />Auba molosi, hamagi inolo osoloamo molo na-da asuluiya ami goaso. Inolo uleno Sisalia sidi labe amo ehe ili na labea malalesi, saabeo. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char> nafea selesia, ‘Ga ilidai maiyone sesaimabiyoba’ seleso. Aufia, nelewo kaabeba aga nadai iwi mulu labe ewe, ilida nadai abia, inolo amone molosu suga daalu. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Aufia, inolo amo ehe awaba mesia, <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> uleno ene molosu suga saabi, abulumeba awaba meso. Sulu dia ano inolo amohe efea selesia, ‘Ga inolo noolo Yoba malalesia, inolo ene wi <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Saimono</char>, ene wi no Fida, amo isafia, ga labea milaleba saamale. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:31">HD 16.31</ref></char></note>Ehe sulu gafea dia miyobafe. Sulu amo alefasia, ga-da, ge molosu kakainabu ili amoda, gasiba dafelagoyobafe.’ Godene sulu dia ano efea auba selesomeba seleso.<verse eid="ACT 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 2:4">HD 2.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo amo auba awaba samodosi, na sulu saeyone maugasi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> ilifea suga inigiamo, ninifea maugaba suga mulu amoguba, ilifeada auba suga saabeo. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:5">HD 1.5</ref></char></note>Auba ausi, Saminilo sulu samini solumo na asigiba obegeso. E selesia, ‘<char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonehe</char> idele inolomo hano balu geluso, gilimo Asubane Noekenemo geyobafeba’ seleso. <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Saminimo, ninihe Saminilo Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisofea</char> <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesi</char>, Godehe ninifea Ene Asubane Noekenemo melu amoguba, agada Godehe ulu kegele ule hamagulu ilifeada meso. Aulugulu, nahe na abegulu adesia, Gode ilifea molofemo kaeyobu?” Fidahe auba awaba melu.<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 13:48">HD 13.48</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:27">14.27</ref></char>
    </note>Inolo ili amohe Fida sulu solumo dobelesia, kanoba hiliseyomo afelesia, ilihe Godene wi digiba selesia, “Aga nini hilisefe, Godehe yau mosomu ilida <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besifia</char> miliyolu miliyo diaba yaamesi gadefabu.”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Adiogo idele inolo Kelisone mosomu alolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:1-4">HD 8.1-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Ili Sidifene dufa olafia fogo amo, ilihe sigidubulu ilimo naga meba yaalu. Ausi, ili wedinalemo budiba dedaleba yaasia, noolomo hele Fonisia ami, noolomo saidudu Saibulusu ami dedalelu. Aufia, noolomo Adiogo sidi ami dedalefia, ilihe Yesune awalu sulu nafulu waleba alolu. Auluso, ili auba ausiamo, yau idele inolofea selesiale, <char style="w">Yuda</char> ilifeasu selaba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Auluso, ili aleba ami, Saibulusu inolo noolomoda, mosomu Salini inolo noolomoda, ili amo Adiogo sidi ami dedalefia, Saminilo Yesune awalu sulumo Giligi inolo ami kakainalu ili amofeada saeyone maugalu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Saminilone kiwigagalu ilidai adesihe, idele inolo wedinale <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesia</char>, ine libo Saminilofealo besiba yaalu. <verse eid="ACT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 4:36">HD 4.36</ref></char></note>Yelusalame <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo ilihe auba holobagafeba sulu gi amo dofasia, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Banabasa">Banabasamo</char> Adiogo ami malalelu.<verse eid="ACT 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />E ami daafia, goasia bisigia, Godehe ili nafulu koleba moloba ufulu baafia, e henelu. Aufia, ehe idele inolo sunia ine asigi sunia Saminilo kuliba malesine kiwigaaba walelu. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" /><char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char> Banabasafea wasigafia labi, e inolo nafulu ligia, e <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> kolelu alolu. Aulune, idele inolo alegalu bulemo ili Saminilone mosomu gegoaba miliyone suga milibailu.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11.25 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 9:30">HD 9.30</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Banabasa e <char style="w">Solo</char> isaeyone Dasusu dauno ami daalu. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />E Solo bafasia, ehe e lubia Adiogo mulu. Hamu ule sunia aleba ami, aalu sese idele inolo amo galiba sigia, aaluhe idele inolo saludialefea Godene sulu mana waleba alolu. Adiogo sidi ami, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili</char> ine wimo <char style="w" lemma="Kelisone idele inolo">Kelisone Mosomuba</char> wi ufiyone maugalu.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Fogo amo, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> noolo Yelusalame afasia, suga milifasia, Adiogo ami goalu. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:10">HD 21.10</ref></char></note>Saaba ofolo inolo uleno ene wi Agabusu. E degefia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char> kiwigaafia, selesia, “Mamia gi bule helefealu sunia holobagaeyobafeba” saaba ufulu. (Dufia, Sisa Kolodiusu saminilo labi, mamia gi amo holobagaso.) <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Sigidubulu idele inolo ilihe Agabusu selefe dofasia, ilihe elewodali noolo Yudia alebaibumo sagoba ofelesia, mole kegele mebaiyoba sulu ule ufulu. Ausi, idele inolo sunia ilifea ufuluguba, iminiba melu. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:25">HD 12.25</ref></char></note>Aufia, ilihe Banabasadai Solodaimo malasia, aaluhe mole amo dibia abia, sesene guni inolofea melu.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Helodohe Yemese dufa olafia, Fida dibolo dafogolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Fogo amo adesi, kini <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[3]], Agiliba 1">Helodohe</char> <char style="w">sese</char> inolo noolo naga meyofia seba yaalu. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Ehe inolo noolofea <char style="w" lemma="Yone">Yonene</char> elewo <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[1]], Sebedine faibe">Yemesemo</char> helebesi dufa olamalesi, e dufa olalu. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Helodo e bisigia, <char style="w">Yuda</char> ilihe e mololumo hamefebuba baafia, ehe <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> amoda sefasia dofalu. Amo mololumo, <char style="w">Boledi Yisida Ofale Subulumo Naiyone Sigilo Hilia</char> adesi mololu. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Ausi, Helodo ehe Fidamo idele inolo si saabia godosia fadaayoba hiliselu. Auluso, e Isolaelene Sigilo Hilia amo samodomesi yasiba alolu. Auba yasifia ligia, ehe Fida dibolo molo usu yasiyone, ibolo selu inolo biniba binibaba gadefalu. Ili amo fogo ulenomo, ili amo alibiaba yasiba melesi gadefalu. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Aulune, Fidamo dibolo moloa labihe, ibolo selu inolo ilihe e yasiba alolu. Auluso, hilia sunia sese idele inolo ilihe Godedai sulu kiwigaaba selesia, e sagoba homesi selaba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godene sulu dia ano ulenohe Fida dibolo moloa alolumo sububa dafogolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Godoyo hiliamo adigi no labi, nigiliba amoyamo, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> e ibolo selu inolo aida amo aleba dofafasia, hanefia alolu. Aufia labi, ibolo selu inolo aida nomo enogele adaaba alolu. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Fida auba hanefia ligia, hamagi bosolufalumo, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Saminilone sulu dia ano</char> uleno holobagasi, yane dibolo molosu neeba dowelu. Sulu dia anohe Fidane afafa dowesia, gilafia selesia, “Ga ogoba degemaba” selesi, seini aida ene sone dofalumo hodobailu.<verse eid="ACT 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Auba ausi, sulu dia ano efea selesia, “Digiasalo dofafia, samaga saligamaba” selesi, Fidahe auba mololu. Aufia, sulu dia ano selesia, “Ge fagulo selale ogo saligafia, na kuliba milalu.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Aufia, Fida e sulu dia ano kuliba abia, molo hogolilu amo gadifia daalu. Auluso, ehe kegele sulu dia ano efea molofe amo sealebuba hilisebale, udiabileba hiliselu. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:19">HD 5.19</ref></char></note>Aalu abia, ibolo selu aida eno kia yasiba alolumo suniafia abia, dibolo eno aeyene kaalumo sogofia, sidifealo maiyo daalu. Eno kaalu amo ene asiba sogosihe, aalumo baea aleba lagofia, eno ulenomo daaba ligia, hamagi bosolufalumo, sulu dia ano Fida afasia daalu. <figure style="fig" alt="Angel frees imprisoned Peter" file="C097.JPG" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="12.6-10">Godene sulu dia ano ulenohe Fida dibolo moloa alolumo sububa dafogofe.</figure><verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Ausi, Fidane asigi sawasi, e ene meleba selesia, “Aga na koleba hilisefe, Saminilohe ene sulu dia ano na labea mebailuba hilisesu. <char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomu ili suniahe kegele nafea moloyo daiyalumoda, <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[3]], Agiliba 1">Helodone</char> sone saabia ufulumoda, Ehe amifia na obegeba gasiba dafelagoba dulubu.” <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Ausi, e abia, Yone enae <char style="w" lemma="Malia[[4]], nooloda alolu">Malia</char> amone moloa daalu. Yone amo ene wi nomo, <char style="w" lemma="Maga">Maga</char>. Idele inolo wedinalemo moloa ami gagaiyofia, Godedai sulu selaba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Fidahe molo amone eno fafa faisa godogodosi, dabalu mololo ido uleno, ene wi Loda, ehe eno sogoyo mulu. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Auluso, ehe Fidane sulu eloba dobelesiamo, ene asigine libo henelu bule adesi, eno sogoluale. Aubale. E molo usu haiba naguba sugafia, idele inolo ili ami kakainabu amofea selesia, “Fida eno saliba yoba labeme!” <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Auba selesi, ili efea selesia, “Ga kagoafela?” Auluso, e koleba selesia, “Aubale, seale e labe.” Aufia, ili selesia, “Gahe ene gesami abulu dagulo.”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Auluso, Fida eno aso godogodobasu labi, ili abia, eno sogosia, e labe baafia, ili wobasubale hidigilu koleba. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Ausi, Fidahe ili saumesi sone gaso olaboba melu. Aufia, e ilifea awasia, Saminilohe e dibolo moloafia baea sububa dafelagolu amone sadalu awalu. E ilifea selesia, “Gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[3]], Yemese Bugoda selelumo, amo e">Yemesefeada</char>, nelewodalifeada, kegele ewe nafea mololumo saaba memale.” Auba safasia, e ili afasia, nolobalo daalu.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:22-24">HD 5.22-24</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Adigi keafa hiliasi ami, ibolo selu inolo ilihe Fida male baafia, ili wobasubale koleba hidigifia, ine geleba doba bebelesia, “Fida wagi daalubi?” <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Aufia, Fida male baafia, Helodo ehe inolo noolofea Fida isaeyo malaluso, ili e abuluale. Ausi, ehe ibolo selu Fidada yasilu amo godofia, ili amo dufa olamesiba solu. Aufia, Helodo e hele Yudia afasia sugafia, Sisalia sidi ami goafia alolu.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helodo olalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Kini Helodohe idele inolo Daila sididai, Saidono sididai, ami kakainabu ili amofea gadilu bule ufulu. Aulugulu, sidi aidane inolo ili gagaiyofia, Helodo babiyofia milibailu. Ilihe hele Helodo yasibia ami naiyo dilo. Amone ilihe edai sulu saeyo hamelu. Aufia, ilihe Balasadusu edaidale sulu solu. E-mo kini amone hanelo hogolilu amone yasilo alolugulu ili edaidale hilise ule ufiyo hiliselu. Aufia dufia, ili Helodo labea daafia, doba bisigia, ehe ili kanulufia gadilu dobumo <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aeaba</char> homesi doba abulu.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Ausi, aeaba ufiyone iminilu hilia amo adesi, <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[3]], Agiliba 1">Helodohe</char> kinine momadamo difasia, ene osolaeyone ailaiya yoba sigia, ami ilifea sulu bule solu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />E selaba labi, idele inolo ilihe koleba wuaaba selesia, “E selefemo, gode ulene mofebu, inolone mofealebuba” solu. <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 5:20">Dan 5.20</ref></char></note>Helodohe ili selefe amo dobelesia, ehe Godene wi digiyo hamelualene, alebale hamagi, Saminilone sulu dia ano ulenohe e dufelesi, walefa wolu efea holobagasi, wafele deseinehe e naasi, e olalu.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:11">Ais 55.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auluso, Godene sulumo kiwigaaba sobosia, hele sunia dedaleba samodolu. <verse eid="ACT 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 11:29-30">HD 11.29-30</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37">15.37</ref></char></note>Ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Banabasa">Banabasadai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Solo">Solodai</char>, aaluhe aine dabalu Yelusalame ami moloba samodofia, Adiogo obegeba abia, Yone <char style="w" lemma="Maga">Magamo</char> aaluhe ulubia daalu.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Ilihe Banabasadai Solodai misini dabalu molomesiba iminilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Adiogo <char style="w">sese</char> aleba ami inolo noolomo, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo labi, inolo noolomo walelo inolo alebailu. Ine wimo, <char style="w" lemma="Banabasa">Banabasada</char>, Saimiono, ene wi nomo Niga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Niga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">wi ewemo, amone sisa “yabuluba” selesia sodo. Aulune, inolo noolo hilisesia, Saimiono ewe Afilika inolo ulenomobuba hiliselu.</char></note> eda, Salini mosomune Lusiusu eda, aufia, Manaini, kini <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[3]], Agiliba 1">Helodone</char> enae bu kulilu elewomo eda, aufia <char style="w">Solo</char> eda. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">HD 9.15</ref></char></note>Hilia uleno, sese idele inolohe <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> gulugulusia, Godedai sulu saeyosia <char style="w" lemma="Naiyo aiyalo">naiyo aiyaba</char> labi, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char> ilifea saaba mesia, “Gilihe Banabasadai, Solodai, aalu dabalu nahe aalu welu amone molomesi, gili aalu koleba iminifia gadefamale.” <verse eid="ACT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:6">HD 6.6</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, naiyo aiyaba ligia Godedai sulu safasia, ilihe ine sone aalufea ofelesia, aalu malalelu.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banabasadai, Solodai, aaluhe awalu sulu nafulu saidudu Saibulusu ami solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char> aalu malasi abia, Selusia daunofealo suga daalu. Selusia amifia, aalu hano sibi aleba lagosi, hano sibi amohe aalu sefia, saidudu Saibulusu ami daalu. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">HD 12.12</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:39">15.39</ref></char></note>Aalu saidudu amone mosomu Salamisi ami goafia, aaluhe <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molosu</char> suga daafia, Godene sulu mana walelu. Yone Maga eda aaludai daafia, ehe aalu sagoba ofolaba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Aufia, ili abia, saidudu amo afogaifasia, Fafoso dauno ami goalu. Fafoso ami, ilihe inolo uleno labi abulumo, ene wi Ba-Yesu. Inolo amohe gone nokene nokeneba molosia, kegele wedinale mololo. Yuda mosomune masega saaba ofolo inolo ulenomo, e. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Inolo amomo, saidudu amone gamanene saminilodai ado. Gamanene saminilo amone wimo, Segiusu Folo. Segiusu Folo amo e asigi nafuludai, hilise nafuludai ufulu alolu. Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Banabasa">Banabasadai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Solo">Solodai</char>, welu, maumo, e Godene sulu mana dubiyo hamelu. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Inolo gone kegeleda mololo amo, Giligi ine sulubamo ene wimo, Elimasaba sodo. Elimasa ewehe Banabasadai, Solodaine daabulu dufa dafogoyone hamelu, maumo, gamanene saminilo amo Yesufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homesialeba</char> hiliselu. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Auluso, Asubane Noekenemo Solofea wasigaalumo, (ene wi nomo, <char style="w">Folo</char>) ehe Elimasa si galiba sidasia selesia, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />“<char style="w" lemma="Henane">Henanene</char> faibe, ga koleba. Ga mana isolu sunia amodai gisa ado. Masega mana suniada, gegelo manada gafea wasigaabu. Gahe Saminilone eno isolumo woba ufiyone afolalebu. <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:8">HD 9.8</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, doma. Aga Saminilone sonehe ga dufelesihe, ge si ogo kaasihe, ga halo bisigiale, hilia fogo noolo miliyobafe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Folo auba selesi, alebale hamagi, nigiligagalu amohe Elimasa ene si kaalu. Auba ausi, e siba ligia, inolo ene sone gasiba semafia, eno waleyomone geba keleba isaba alolu. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Gamanene saminilo amohe, kegele molofe amone bisigia, e Saminilone sulu mana walelu amone momoleba dobelesia, <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char>. <figure style="fig" alt="Board ship for missionary journey" file="C099.jpg" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="13.4">Banabasadai, Solodai, maiyone hano sibi aleba lagofe.</figure><verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banabasadai, Folodai, aaluhe Fisidia helea Adiogo ami awalu sulu nafulu walelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:38">HD 15.38</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Foloda</char>, inolo ili edai dedalelumoda, ili amo Fafoso dauno afasia, hano sibi difasia, segefia abia, Famifilia hele bule Fega dauno ami goalu. Ami goafasia, Yone Magamo e aalu gadefia abia, Yelusalame obegeba maiyo daalu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Aalu amo, Fega dauno afasia, abia, Fisidia disiligine Adiogo ami goalu. Ami goafia ligia, <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> adesi, aalu <char style="w">Yudane gulugululo molo</char> usu amo suga daafia, yoba asulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Gulugululo molo amone guni inolo ilihe, <char style="w">muguli</char> sulumoda, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> ine sulumoda, alegafasia ami, inolo uleno aalu yoba saabea saeyo malasia, selesia, “Nelewodali, aalihe idele inolone libo kiwigaaba ufiyone sulu sebunaga, amo koleba saeyo milaba” saamalelu.<verse eid="ACT 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Aufasia, Folo degefasia, ili saumesi sone gaso olaboba mesia selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaele inolo</char> gilida, aufia yau inolo noolo Gode sisa ado gilida, doma. <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 1:7">Kis 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 6:6">6.6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 12:51">12.51</ref></char></note><char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomune Gode Ehe, nine nauwadalimo Ene idele inolo melesine molobebelelu. Aufia, ili ine hele afasia abia, Isibi hele ami kakainabimo, Ehe ine mosomu buleba ufulu. Aufia dufia, Ene kiwigagalumo alefasia, ili Isibi afasia luba dibia milibailu. <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 14:34">Nam 14.34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 1:31-32">Lo 1.31-32</ref></char></note>Aufia, ili isale hele falaiya ami sibaisaba adesimo, hamu daabuluba biniba (40) aleba ami, Ehe ine mololo mana waagimasia, ili luba adabasu alolu. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 7:1">Lo 7.1</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 14:1">Jos 14.1</ref></char></note>Aufia, Gode Ehe hele Kainani ami mosomu domobamo woba ofasia, ili amone helemo Isolaelefea ine daalo hele melesi melu. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:16">Het 2.16</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:20">1Sml 3.20</ref></char></note>Kegele amo sunia mololumo, hamu fula binibafia haiba daabuluba biafalu (450) amogulu alefasia, dufiamo, Godehe guni inolo iminiba walelabia inigia, saaba ofolo inolo Samuele alolu fogo ami elolu. <figure style="fig" alt="Folo e siba alolu agelemo ewe" file="Paul's First Journey.tif" size="span" loc="13.14" ref="13.1-14.28">Folo e siba alolu agelemo ewe (HD 13.1–14.28)</figure><verse eid="ACT 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 8:5">1Sml 8.5</ref>, <ref loc="1SA 8:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 10:20-24">10.20-24</ref></char>
    </note>Aufasia, fogo amo Isolaele ilihe kini uleno nini yasimesine haalisi, Godehe inolo Solo amo ili yasimesi iminilu. E kini alefasia ligia, hamu daabuluba biniba (40) alolu. Solo amo, e Kisine faibe Benisamenene mosomu inolo alolu. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:14">1Sml 13.14</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 16:12">16.12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:20">Sng 89.20</ref></char></note>Auluso, Godehe e afelesia, <char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidimo</char> ine kini melesi gadefalu. Ehe Deibidi amone saaba sulu selesia, ‘Nahe <char style="w" lemma="Yesi">Yesine</char> faibe Deibidi bisigiamo, e Ne hame kuliba anobuba abulu. Ehe kegele Na hamefe amogulu moloyobafe.’<verse eid="ACT 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 7:12-16">2Sml 7.12-16</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Godehe samini E moloyoba saaba ufuluguba molosia, inolo Deibidi amone sebe amofeafia Ehe inolo uleno nini gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyone mebailu. Inolo amo Isolaele labea mulu amo, Yesu amo E koleba. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:1-2">Mad 3.1-2</ref></char></note>Yesu aso Ene dabalu maugabale labi, <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonehe</char> Isolaele idele inolo suniafea Godene sulu mana walesia, ili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besisi</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gemalelu</char>. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:20">Yon 1.20</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 1:27">27</ref></char></note>Yone dabalu moloba samodoyo hagoalesi, e selesia, ‘Gili asigisia, na abe? Inolo gili yasife ogo, amo naale. Auluso, gili doma. Dufia inolo uleno miyobafemo, Ene samaga husia efolo fisigaeyone, na-mo lililuale lolu.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />Nelewodali, <char style="w" lemma="Abalahama">Abalahamane</char> mosomu faibili gilida, aufia yau inolo Gode sisa ado gilida, doma. Godehe idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> obegeba difeba sulu solu amo, ninifea mebailu. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Yelusalame idele inoloda, ine yasilone guni inoloda, ilihe Yesu amobuba eloba abuluale. Aufia, ilihe sulu saaba ofolo inolo solumo amoda nafuluba hiliseluale. Ilihe Sabada hilia sunia saaba ofolone sulu seleba ufulu amo alegaba aloluso, ilihe inolo Yesu amo fadaasia, dufa olamalu. Mana amo mololumohe, amakele saaba ofolo inolo ili solumo wakaliba sugalu. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:22-23">Mad 27.22-23</ref></char></note>Ilihe Efea heleba daalu uleno baabale ligiaso, ilihe E godofasia, gamanene yasilo <char style="w">Filadusu</char> amofea E dufa olamesi doba abulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:59-60">Mad 27.59-60</ref></char></note>Ausi, samini saaba ofolo inolohe Efea moloyobafeba seleluguba moloba samodofasia, ilihe E imolane uluba ufulumo dibia sugafasia, E abane nageleiya ami baliba ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Auluso, Godehe E-mo daneiya amifia <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifolu</char>. <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:3">HD 1.3</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 1:8">8</ref></char></note>Aufia, hilia wedinale aleba ami, idele inolo E galiba Galili amifia Yelusalame ami maiyo dedalelu ilimohe, E abulu. Aga ili amone awaeyone olofa inolo alebaibu.<verse eid="ACT 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32-33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32-33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.32-33 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 2:7">Sng 2.7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Awalu sulu nafulu ninihe gilifea selesu amo ewe. Kegele Godehe nine nauwadalifea saaba ufulu oloba huliale amo, aga Ehe ine sebedali ninifea melu. Seale, amo nini aleba ami ililiba ofelesi, sulu samini saaba ufulu amo aga wakaliba hugalu. Yesu olalumo haiba degeba ifolu amofea alefasia, Ehe auba mololu. Gasa bugo lalolu aganebo amone iminisia, eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 13:32-33" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:32-33">
    <char style="qt">‘Ga Ne Naalo koleba,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:32-33">
    <char style="qt">aga Na Ge Gao adesu.’</char><verse eid="ACT 13:32-33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.34 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 55:3">Ais 55.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Godehe Yesu olalumo sesenemesialefia, degeba ifolu amomo iminisia, saaba ofolo Aisaia bugo eweguba selelu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 13:34" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">
    <char style="qt">‘Kegele nafulu Na amakele Deibidifea meyoba saaba ufuluguba,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">
    <char style="qt">Nahe gilifea meyobasu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">Oloba huliale sulu amo <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char>, saaba ofalu dobu.’<verse eid="ACT 13:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 16:10">Sng 16.10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, sulu noda, Godene gasa bugo eweguba solu dobu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 13:35" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">
    <char style="qt">‘Gahe Ge Muuba Kalilumo dana usu waagi sesenemesi gadefaeyobafale.’</char><verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Deibidi helefealu iwi ligia, ene saladegelu idele inolo amone sagoba ofelesia, Godehe molomesi hamefeguba kuliba abia, e olasimo, ene enauwadali galiba baliba ufulubiyo. Ene domalamoda sesenelubiyo. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Auluso, inolo Godehe haiba degeba ifolu amo, Ene domala amo sesenelu abuluale.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38-39" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.38-39 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ROM 10:4">Lom 10.4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aulugulu, ne nelewodali, nahe gili ewe asigimesi hamefe. Inolo Yesu amofea alefasia, sulu nafulu ninifea saaba dafelagofe. Sulu nafulu amo, ewe koleba. <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">Wolu</char> nini mololu amo, Yesu amofea alefasia, galisia hamasia heelu dobu. <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> sulu mugulimohe, nini suniane wolu galisia hamasia heefia, nini isolu inolo loluba saeyodoluale. Auluso, Yesu Ehe idele inolo Efea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelefe</char> ili amofea, isolu inoloba saeyodolu labe. <verse eid="ACT 13:38-39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Aulugulu, gili nafuluba, kegele saaba ofolo inolo ilihe moloyobafeba saaba ufulugulu, gili labea holobagalosi hagugumale. <verse eid="ACT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 1:5">Hab 1.5</ref></char></note>Saaba ofolo inolo ili eweguba haguguba selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 13:41" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">
    <char style="qt">‘Gaidabolo inolo, gili doma.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">
    <char style="qt">Hidigiba baafia, woba dafelesia asigileba yaamale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">
    <char style="qt">Maumo, kegele Nahe gine hilia ogo moloyobasu amomo,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">
    <char style="qt">inolo ulenohe gilifea auba selesenagada, gilihe amo sealeba asigiyobafale.’</char>”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Folodai, Banabasadai, Godene sulu mana amo saaba samodofia, gulugululo molo amo afasia aasi, idele inolohe aalufea selesia, “Sabada no anogoda, sulu noolo amoneda aso saabia haiba saeyone milaleyobileba” solu. <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Aufia, ili gulugululo molo afasia, egeisa dedalesi, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo wedinale nooloda, yau idele inolo Yudane gulugululo mana kuliba ano ili wedinale nooloda, ili amo Folodai, <char style="w" lemma="Banabasa">Banabasadai</char>, kuliba dedalelu. Ausi, aaluhe Godene sulu mana ilifea ine asigi degeba ofelesia, selesia, gili Godene hame kuliba abia, <char style="w">kanululo</char> sisa kiwigaafia melesi solu.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Sabada hilia no adesimo, idele inolo sidi ami kakainalumo sunia Saminilone sulu mana selefemo dubiyone, gagaiyolu. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Auba molosi, Yuda idele inolo noolo ilihe, idele inolo wamili wasigaafe amo baafia, babiyo habosia, ilihe Folone sulu lasiasia, efea gaidaboba solu.<verse eid="ACT 13:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13.46 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 3:26">HD 3.26</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:6">18.6</ref></char>
    </note>Auba ausi, Folodai, Banabasadai, aaluhe ilifea koleba selesia, “Seale koleba, anihe Godene sulu mana Yuda gilifeadale saeyo ufulu. Auluso, gilihe Godene sulu amo saidafasia, gili <char style="w">miliyolu miliyo</char> amo diyo habobuba selefegulu, aga ani <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomufealo</char> baaba gosu. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.47 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 49:6">Ais 49.6</ref></char></note>Mau enebamo, Saminilohe anifea auba molomaleba iminisia, saaba ofolo inolo Aisaiahe eweguba solu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 13:47" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">
    <char style="qt">‘Nahe ga iminisia, hele kulia sunia ami</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">
    <char style="qt">idele inolo gasiba dafelagoyone sulu dibia malesine,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">
    <char style="qt">ga-mo yau mosomune yane melesi gadefalu.</char>’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Yau idele inolo ilihe sulu amo dofasia, ine libo koleba Saminilone sulu dubiyo henelu. Ausi, idele inolo sunia Godehe ili miliyolu miliyo diyobafeba iminiba ufulu ili amo, asigi ule ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Auba ausimo, Saminilone sulu manamo hele aniba amo sunia doba sigilu. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Auluso, Yuda ilihe idele wida solumo Yuda guluguluba ado ilida, sidi amone guni inoloda, ine libo degeba ifolu. Ausi, ilihe Folodai, Banabasadai, aalufea naga mesia, sidi ami melabiyosia aisalu. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.51 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mad 10.14</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:6">HD 18.6</ref></char></note>Auba ausi, aaluhe aine emofea hele sao baalumo fifiba dafogofia daalumo, idele inolo ilihe ine manamo heleba mololuba hilisemesi aulu. Aufia, aalu Adiogo sidi amo afasia, abia Aikoniama ami maiyo daalu. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> Adiogo idele inolo Yesufea asigi ule ufulumofea wasigaasi, ili henelu bule koleba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Folodai Banabasadai aalu Aikoniama dauno ami Godene sulu mana walelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Aufia, Aikoniama dauno ami, Folodai, Banabasadai, aalu anoguba, <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu huga daafia, aaluhe Godene sulu mana walelu. Aaluhe sulu amo nafuluba sigiba domesiba solumone, Yuda idele inoloda, Giligi idele inoloda, ili wedinale <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char>. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Auluso, sigidubuluale Yuda inolo noolo ili amohe, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> noolone asigi degeba ofelesi, ilihe sigidubulu ili amofea haboba abulu. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:20">Mag 16.20</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:4">Hib 2.4</ref></char></note>Ausi, Folodai, Banabasadai, Aikoniama ami fogo selale ligia, aaluhe <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> anifia ligia, sagilibale koleba selaba alolu. Auba ausi, Saminilohe aalufea kiwi mefemo alefasia, aaluhe <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> nokene nokeneba mololu. Mana amo mololumo alefasia, Saminilohe idele inolofea walesia, sulu aalu solu amo seale koleba. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Auluso, idele inolo dauno ami kakainalu ili amo, aidaba osolaba dafulu. Noolohe Yuda inolo amo ilidai hilise ule adesi, ausi noolomo <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolo</char> aaludai hilise ule alolu. <verse eid="ACT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:19">HD 14.19</ref></char></note>Aufia, Yuda inolo amo ilida, yau inolo nooloda, ine guni inolo galibafia, nenesia, ilihe Folodai Banabasadai woba ofelesia, aalumo abane odesia dufa olaeyoba daiyalu.<verse eid="ACT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banabasadai, Solodai, aaluhe disiligi Likonia ami Godene sulu mana walelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Folodai, Banabasadai, aaluhe inolo ili amo moloyo daiyaluba selefe sulu gi dofasia, aalu fisaba abia, disiligi Likonia ami, Lisidola daunodai, Debi daunodai, ami daafia ligia, dauno aida amone anibamo siba alolu. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Aalu ami siba ligia, Awalu Sulu Nafulu amo selabiasu, siba alolu. <verse eid="ACT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Lisidola dauno ami, inolo uleno asulu amo, ene emo kiwida male asulu. Enae seba duluiya hamagifia, e emo wofia ligia, aubada wedinoda silale alolu. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Inolo amohe <char style="w">Folo</char> sulu selefemo dobolaba labi, Folohe inolo amo si galiba bisigia, e-mo waiba homesine <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule dobi</char> abulu. <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />Auba dobi baafia, Folohe koleba wuaasia selesia, “Ga koleba, ge emo isofia, kalugamaba” selesi, e suba aleba lagofia, maugaba degefia siba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 28:6">HD 28.6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Idele inolo wamili amohe, Folo mololumo bafasia, ine Likonia suluba wuaaba selesia, “Wae, gode aidamo inolo dofelefasia, nini labea suga mulubu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Auba hilisesia, ilihe <char style="w">Banabasa</char>, e-mo gode Susi labebuba solu. Ausi, Folomo sulu dibia ano labe baafia, ilihe e-mo gode Hemese labebuba solu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giligi idele inolo ilihe hilisesia, gode aso wedinale alebaibuba asigi ule ufulu. Susi e-mo, ine godemone saminiloba hiliselo. Aufia Hemesemo, gode sulu dibia ano dabalu mololoba hiliselo.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />Ili auba saafia, gode Susi amone <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> amohe, maamo efolo sogofasia, dofene keao dofolomo lubia inigia, aalufea soba meyone hilisesia, dauno amone eno saliba ami lubia mulu.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Auluso, Banabasadai, Folodai, kegele aalufea moloyoba sulu selefe amo dofasia, aaluhe wobasubale hidigifia, aine fagulo gagalafia, idele inolo wamili labefealo naguba abia, wuaaba selesia, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:26">HD 10.26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 146:6">Sng 146.6</ref></char></note>“Idele inolo, doma! Gili mana auba molofe ogo, enebane molose? Anida balu inolo ligia, gili waagulu lolu. Anihe gilifea awalu sulu nafulu eweguba selesu. Gilihe kegele masega gulugululo mana ogo afasia, besifia, Gode miliyoluda labefealo nolofia milale. Gode amohe anakiwida, helefealuda, salu hanoda, aufia kegele ami waalebumoda, sunia E moloba yaalu. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:30">HD 17.30</ref></char></note>Seale, amakele Ehe yau idele inolo suniane enauwadalimo mana ine hamefeguba waagi mololabia malesi gadefalu. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:24">Jer 5.24</ref></char></note>Auluso, Ehe yau idele inolo E bamesifia, ilifea mana nafulu walelubiyo. Enebamo, Ehe ana lagifia hele hugaba molosia, geiya ami edo sobomesi moloba ofolo. Aubasu, Ehe gilifea naiyoda wedinale madeneba ofelesia, gine libo henelo wasigaaba ofolo.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Folodai Banabasadai idele inolofea auba solu. Auluso, ilihe aalufea soba meyo molofe amo, aalu ili kaeyo kolelu koleba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:13">HD 17.13</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 11:25">2Kld 11.25</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia ami, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo noolo Adiogofiada, Aikoniamafiada, milibaifia, ili Lisidola dauno ami goasia, idele inolo noolone asigi sigiba molafasia, Folodai gisa melesi moloba ufulu. Ausi, ilihe Folo abane ololu. Aufasia, e olalubufasia, ene domala sigiba dibia daafia, dauno amone yala faisalo saidafulu. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Auba molosi, Yesufea asigi ule ufulu ili amo milibaifia, e aniba amaleba galisi, Folo e degelu. Degefia, e yala usu ami obegeba suga daalu. Adigi keafa, edai, Banabasadai, aalu Debi dauno ami maiyone daalu.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banabasadai, Folodai, aaluhe idele inolo Yesufea asigi ule ufulumone asigimo kiwigaaba ufulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Aufia, aaluhe awalu sulu nafulu Debi ami walesihe, idele inolo wedinalemo <char style="w" lemma="Walelu faibe">walelu faibili holobagagalu</char>. Aufasia, aalu Debi afasia, Lisidola ami inigia, Aikoniama amida goafia, inigia Adiogo obegeba mulu. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:32">HD 15.32</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 3:3">1Des 3.3</ref></char></note>Dauno osoloa ami selabia sisia, aaluhe sigidubulu ami alebaibumofea kiwigaaba ofa selesia, “Gili seale <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> mau ogofea kiwigaafia melale. Nini Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada ami aso sugaeyo ligiamo, nini higinilu eno wedinale dobia amidale maiyobasuba” solu. <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Folodai, Banabasadai, aaluhe <char style="w">sese</char> ule uleba guni inolo molobebeleba yaafia, aalu <char style="w" lemma="Naiyo aiyalo">naiyo aiyaba</char> ligia, Godedai sulu selesia, guni inolo ili amo Saminilone sone saabia ufulu. Saminilo amofea ili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char>, Ene sone saabia ufulu.<verse eid="ACT 14:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banabasadai, Solodai, aalumo disiligi Siliane Adiogo ami obegeba daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Aufia, Banabasadai, Solodai, aalumo disiligi Fisidia auba selabia siba labeofia inigia, disiligi Famifilia ami goalu. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Aufia, aalu Godene sulu mana Fega dauno ami safasia inigia, aalumo Adalia dauno ami suga mulu. <verse eid="ACT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:1-2">HD 13.1-2</ref></char></note>Adalia amifia, aalu hano sibihe sefia inigia, Adiogo ami obegeba mulu. Saminimo, sidi amimo, kelisone inolo ilihe aalumo Godene sone saabia ofelesia, Godehe aalu sagoba homesi, Godedai sulu solu. Agamo aalu, dabalu amo molomaleba soiya hamagi obegeba mulu. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:4">HD 15.4</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:12">12</ref></char></note>Aalu ami goasia, <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo sunia gagaiyomafia, Godehe aalufea alefasia mololumoneda, Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolofea</char> eno sogoba ofelesi, ili asigi besilu amoneda, ilifea awaba melu. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Aufasia, aalumo sigidubulu idele inolo Adiogo ami alebailumo galiba fogo selale alolu.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Yelusalame ami sese idele inolo bule gagaiyolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 5:2">Gal 5.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Inolo noolo Yudiafia Adiogo ami suga milibaifasia, elewodalifea walesia selesia, “Gilihe <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> mana amo kuliba abiale gine <char style="w" lemma="Bado amaleba gelelo mana">bado amaleba gelesalenaga</char>, amo Godehe gili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba obegeba diyobafale</char>.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:1">Gal 2.1</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folodai</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Banabasa">Banabasadai</char>, aaluhe, sulu inolo ili amo selefemo dobelesia, ili galiba sulu bule hegelu. Ili kegele amone sulu aso saaba samodoyodolualene, ilihe Folodai, Banabasadaimo, sigidubulu noolo galiba, Yelusalame fela malalelu. Sulu amo Yelusalame lagi, <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolo</char> ilida, sesene guni inolo ilida, ili galiba isomesi malalu.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />
    <char style="w">Sese</char> idele inolohe ili auba malaba selesi, ili inigia, disiligi Fonisia sunialabia inigia, disiligi Samalia amoda sunialabia mulu. Ilihe sigidubulu damenedali disiligi aida ami kakainalumofea awasia, Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> asigi besiba walelumone awaba melu. Damenedali ili suniamohe sulu amo dobelesia, asigi heneba yaalu. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:27">HD 14.27</ref></char></note>Aufia inigia, ili Yelusalame ami goasihe, sese idele inolo suniada, hilibailu inolo ilida, guni inolo ilida, ili uluba disia henelu. Ausi, Folodai Banabasadai aaluhe ilifea awasia, kegele sunia Godehe aine sonefea alefasia, mololumo awaba melu.<verse eid="ACT 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Auba awaba labi, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi uleda ufulu</char> <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo noolo degeba lagofia, selesia, “Yau inolo nini aleba suga miyo hilisesenaga, amo gilihe ilifea ine bado amaleba gelemaleba saamale. Aufia, gilihe ilifea Mosesene sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> kuliba malaleba saamale.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Falisi inolo ili auba selesi, hilibailu inolo ilida, guni inolo ilida, sulu amone isoyone gagaiyolu. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:1-43">HD 10.1-43</ref></char></note>Ili sulu amo wedinale neneba labeofia, <char style="w" lemma="Fida - Saimono">Fida</char> degefia selesia, “Nelewodali, gili asigibu, samini Gode Ehe gili aleba na-mo molobebelesia, yau inolo ilihe awalu sulu nafulumo ne mofeofeafia selefemo domesisia, E na gadefalu. Ilihe asigi ule homesisia aulu. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:44">HD 10.44</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 11:15">11.15</ref></char></note>Godehe idele inolo suniane asigida bolomo, Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> ilifea melumo, ninifea melu hamaguba melu. Mana amohe ninifea walesiamo, Godehe yau ilida diyone heafuba henelu. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Ehe ninifea mana no walesia, ilifeamo mana no waleluale. Aubale. <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">Asigi ule ufulumone</char> mana amonesu alefasia, Ehe ine libomo galagoloba ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 11:30">Mad 11.30</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 3:10">Gal 3.10</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, Gode Ene Ehe auba mololumone, gilihe E kaeyo hamesego, mau enene gili ause? Enebamo, aga gilihe yau idele inolofea alu higinilu agiba ufiyo hilisefe. Auba ausenaga, gilihe Gode kaafebuba hilisesu. Asigima. Alu higinilu ogo, nine nauwadalida, ninida agiyodoluale ufulubu. <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 2:16">Gal 2.16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:5-8">Efe 2.5-8</ref></char></note>Auluso, ninihe eweguba asigi ule ufulu. Mosesene muguli sulu kuliba abia, nini siba dafelagolale. Aubale. <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesune <char style="w">kanululo</char> amofea alefasia, Godehe nini obegeba dulu. Ehe ili yau ogoda hamagubasu obegeba dulu.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Fida auba solumo dofasia, ili gagaiyolu amo sunia sausagasia, Banabasadai, Folodai, aalu awafe amone dubulu. Ili auba dobolaba labi, aaluhe <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> noolo Godehe aine sonefea alefasia, idele inolo yau mosomu aleba mololumone awaba meba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15.13 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GAL 2:9">Gal 2.9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aalu sulu saaba samodosi, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[3]], Yemese Bugoda selelumo, amo e">Yemese</char> selesia, “Nelewodali, gili na selefe ewe doma. <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Saimonohe aga ninifea fadaba selesomo, maugaiya amifia, Godehe yau mosomu sunia aleba amifia idele inolo Ene mosomu melesi gadefaeyo daiyalu alolu. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Aulune, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> ilihe sulu amodai eesia, eweguba selelu dobu. <verse eid="ACT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 9:11-12">Amo 9.11-12</ref></char></note>Saminilohe selesia,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 15:16" />
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">
    <char style="qt">‘<char style="w" lemma="Deibidi">Deibidine</char> mosomumo balai molo ule bidiba sugalu amogulu alolu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">
    <char style="qt">Auluso, dufiamo Na obegeba milifasia, amo haiba diba ufiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">
    <char style="qt">Molo amone kegele ufulumo woba dafuluso,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">
    <char style="qt">Na saabia momoloba ofelesia, molo amo haiba hili diba ufiyo.</char><verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />
    <char style="qt">Ausi, idele inolo aso saabemo, ilihe Saminilo isasi,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">
    <char style="qt">yau mosomu idele inolo amo Ne-ba iminiba ufulumo sunia, ilida Na isaeyobafe.’</char><verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />
    <char style="qt">Kegeleda auba mololo Saminilo Ehe auba solu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:18">
    <char style="qt">Kegele amomo, maugaiya amifia inigia, asigiba ufiasu alefalu dobu.”</char><verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Yemesehe saaba ofolo amone sulu selelu auba safasia, gegoaba selesia, “Aulugulu, na eweguba asigife, ninihe, yau mosomu Godefea asigi besife ili amofea, higinilu meyobale koleba. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 34:15-17">Kis 34.15-17</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 17:10-16">Wkp 17.10-16</ref></char></note>Aulune, ninihe ilifea sowi seleba dafogosia eweguba seleyoba. ‘Naiyo kegele <char style="w" lemma="Masega gode">masega godefea</char> soba mefe amo namenabiyo. Aufia, susugu mana nokene nokeneba molomabiyo. Aufia, kelebulu kolofolo sefia dufa olalu amo namenabiyo. Aufia, ibida namenabiyo.’ <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Nini asigife, saminifia inigia, aga labe eweda, yau mosomune hele sunia ami, inolo noolo ilihe Mosesene sulu selelumo waleba ado labe. Aulugulu, <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> sunia ili <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu ami, Mosesene sulu amo alegabasu ado.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe yau mosomu sigidubulu idele inolofea sowi seleba melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Yemese auba safasia labi, <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolo</char> ilida, guni inolo ilida, <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo ili suniada, ilihe ine aleba ami, <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folodai</char> <char style="w" lemma="Banabasa">Banabasadai</char> galiba Adiogo ami obegeba malesisia, inolo aida no iminiyoba sulu daiyalu. Uleno amo <char style="w" lemma="Yudasa[[4]], ene wi nomo, Basabasa">Yudasa</char>, ene wi nomo Basabasa. Aufia, inolo nomo, ene wi Saelese. Aalumo, sese idele inolo aleba amone yasilo alolu. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Ili biniba malasia, sowi selelu dibia malalelu. Sowi amo sulu eweguba selelu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 15:23" />
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Nini hilibailu inoloda, guni inoloda, ninimo gine gelewodali ganodali lolu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 15:23" />
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Ninihe sowi ewe <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau</char> sigidubulu inolo Adiogo sidi ami kakainabumoda, hele bule Siliada, Silisiada kakainabumoda, gilifea seleba mesu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 15:23" />
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 15:23">Nelewodali, nanodali, gilifea geide nafuluba selesu.<verse eid="ACT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Ninihe eweguba selesi dubulu. Nini aleba ami inolo noolo holobagafia, daafia, gili labea milibaifasia, ili sulu solumo gine asigi osolaba ufulubiyo. Sulu ili solumo, gine asigi dabagalaba ufulubiyo. Auluso, ninihe ilifea auba molomaleba soluale. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Ninihe kegele amo holobagaluba sulu solu dubulune, nini hilise ule alefasia, nine nelewo aida ewemo molobebelefasia, aalumo Banabasadai, Folodai, aalu galiba gili alebaibia ami malasugo. Banabasadai, Folodai, aalumo nine yaguso koleba labe. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Aalu ogomo, nine Saminilo Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> wi saeyo sagilisiale, aine miliyolumo waagi afiyodolu koleba labe. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Aulugulu, ninihe Yudasadai, Saelesedai, gili labea malalumo, aalu ogohe sulu nini seleba mesu amo, aine mofehe gilifea sealeba saaba meyobafe. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:4">Mad 23.4</ref></char></note><char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane Noekenemo</char> Eda, ninida, eweguba hilise ule ufulu. Nini higinilu wedinale gilifea agiba ufiyo hamebualegulu, gilihe mana ewegubasu kuliba malale.<verse eid="ACT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Gilihe naiyo kegele masega godefea soba mefe amo namenabiyo. Aufia, ibida namenabiyo. Aufia kelebulu kolofolo sefia dufa olalu amoda namemabiyo. Aufia susugu mana nokene nokeneba molomabiyo. Aulugulu, gilihe nafuluba yasisia, kegele amo suniasenaga, amo nafulu. Nine sulu hamaga,</para>
  <para style="pmc" vid="ACT 15:29">Gili nafuluba melale.<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Sowi auba seleba ofasia, sese idele inolo ilihe inolo biniba amo Adiogo sidi ami malesi hilibailu. Aufia, ili abia, Adiogo ami goafia, sese idele inolo gagaiyomafasia, ilifea sowi seleba ufulumo melu. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Idele inolo ilihe sowimo alegaba samodofia, sulu nafulu ili kiwigaaba ofelesia solu amone ili henelu. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Yudasadai, Saelesedai, aalumo <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo alolune, aaluhe sulu nafulu wedinale elewodalifea saaba meba alolumohe, ine libo kiwigaaba ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Aalu Adiogo ami hilia wedinale alefasia, dufiamo elewodali ili amohe aalufea hawiyoba saafia, inolo aaluda malaba soiya ami obegeba malalu. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Auluso, Saelese e waagi yasiba miliyo hiliselu. <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Ausi, Folodai, Banabasadai, aalumo Adiogo ami waagi asulu. Aaluhe inolo wedinale noolodai dabalu moloba ligia, idele inolofea Godene sulu mana waleba ligia, Saminilone awalu sulu nafulu selaba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folodai Banabasadai aalu hilise ule aloluale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Hilia noolo alefasia ami, <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folohe</char> <char style="w" lemma="Banabasa">Banabasafea</char> selesia, “Ani obegeba abia, ani saminimo Saminilone suluda saaba meiya ami, maiyoba. Amimo, anihe anine nelewodali nanodali labea sobele maiyoba. Ili nafuluba alebaibulaba babiyone maiyoba.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:12">HD 12.12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref></char></note>Folo auba selesi, Banabasahe inolo Yone, ene wi no <char style="w" lemma="Maga">Magamo</char>, aaludai lubia maiyoba asigilu. <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:13">HD 13.13</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4.10</ref></char></note>Auluso, Folo selesia, “Inolo ogohe Famifilia disiligi ami ani gadefia, ehe ani galiba dabalu moloyone daalualegulu, aga anihe e lubia anidai maiyale.” <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Aaluhe kegele amone wedinale gadiba hegelu. Ausi, aalu osolaba dafalilu. Banabasahe Maga e lubia abia, hano sibi uleno aleba lagofia saidudu Saibulusu ami maiyo daalu. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Ausi, Folohe Saelese uluba dulu. Aalu maiyo adesi, elewodali ili amohe eweguba solu, “Saminilone <char style="w" lemma="Kanululo">kanululomo</char> aalidai miliyobafe.” <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Auba selesi, aalumo hele bule Siliada, hele bule Silisiada, ami siba ligia, Folohe <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo ami alebailumofea kiwigaaba ofolaba yaalu.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Dimodi e Folo galiba daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.1 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 14:6">HD 14.6</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:5">2Dim 1.5</ref></char>
    </note>Folo e Debi ami dafasia, e Lisidola amida daalu. Dauno ami, <char style="w">walelu faibe</char> uleno asulu amo, ene wimo <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodi</char>. Ene enaemo Yuda ido ligia, Yesufea asigi ule ufulu alolu. Ausi, ene enaomo Giligi mosomu inolo alolu. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 2:19-22">Fil 2.19-22</ref></char></note>Lisidola daunoda, Aikoniama daunoda, sigidubulu damene ami alebailu ili amohe Dimodi amo, inolo nafuluba sodo. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" /><char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folohe</char> Dimodi e-mo e galiba maiyoba hilisesia, ene bado amaleba gelelu. Maumo, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo ili ami asulumo ili sunia asigisia, ene enaomo Giligi inoloba asigifia alolu. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:23-29">HD 15.23-29</ref></char></note>Foloda ili dauno nonoba goalabia siba ligia, ilihe idele inolo ami kakainalumofea sowi, <char style="w" lemma="Hilibaisi daalu inolo">hilibailu inolo</char> ilida, guni inolo ilida, Yelusalame ami ligia nenefasia seleba ufulu amone, saaba melabia siba alolu. Aufia, ilihe idele inolo ilifea selesia, sulu amo, kuliba malaleba solu. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Auba ausi, <char style="w" lemma="Sese">sesene</char> <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumone</char> mana kiwigaasi, sigidubulu ili amone alegalumo, hilia sunia buleba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe udia bologuba bisigia Masedonia inolo abulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:23">HD 18.23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char>, ilimo Asia helea ami Godene sulu mana waleyone kaasi, Foloda ili, Filigia disiligidai, Galasia disiligidai, aleba ami siba alolu. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Ausi, ili inigia, hele Misia elo ufuluiya ami goafia, ili hele bule Bidinia ami, suga maiyo hameluso, Yesune Asubanemohe ili kaalu. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Auba kaasi, ili hele Misia amo suniafia, Dolase ami suga daalu. <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Aufia, ami goafia ligia, nigiliba <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folohe</char> udia bologuba bisigia, Masedonia inolo uleno yoba labi abulu. Inolo amo efea eweguba susiba solu. “Ga salu hano galubu segefia, hele <char style="w">Masedonia</char> inigia, nini sagoba ufiyo milaba” solu. <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Folohe udia amo bafasia, nini alebale Masedonia ami maiyone eno isalu. Nini hilisesia, awalu sulu nafulu ilifea walemesine, Godehe nini welububa hiliselu.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ido Lidia e asigi besilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Ausi, nini Dolase dauno amifia hano sibi aleba lagofia abia, saidudu Samodolase hanefia, adigi keafa hano sibi ninida sefia, Niafolisi maiyone daalu. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Nini ami goafia, hano sibi afasia, hele aiba abia, Filibai sidi ami goalu. Sidi ami Lomene gamane inigia, samini asuluiyamo, Masedonia disiligi amone sidi bule ufulu. Nini sidi ami hilia noolo alolu.<verse eid="ACT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Ami auba ligia, <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> amohe nini sidi amone eno saliba gadefia, baea abia, hano saiya daalu. Nini hilisesia, hano amo saiya ami Yudane gulugulula hele dobububa hiliselu. Hano saiya ami, idele noolo ami gagaiyofia labihe, nini ilidai sulu sugaba asulu. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Suluda ami doba kakainalumone ido ulenomo, ene wi Lidia. Ehe Godefea gulugululo. Ido amo e Dailadaila dauno amone idogulu, ehe fagulo ogaea amone bisinesi dabalu mololo. <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilohe</char> ene libo sogoba ofelesihe, e <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folone</char> sulu sigiba dobeleso. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Aufia eda, ene damene molo ule asulu ili amoda, <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano geso</char>. Ido amo hano gefasia, ehe ninifea selesia, “Gili asigisia na Saminilofea seale asigi ule ufulu dobuba asigisenaga, amo gili na moloa misiyo milaleba” seleso. Ehe ninifea auba susiba selesi, ninihe ene sulu kuliba daalu.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folodai, Saelesedai, Filibai ami dibolo dafogolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Hilia uleno, nini <char style="w" lemma="Godedai sulu selefe">Godedai sulu soda</char> helea daaba labi, dabalu moloba ofolo ido uleno eno kia nini wakaliso. Ido amohe asubane wolu uleno efea alolu ligia, ehe kegele dufia moloyobafemone saaba ofolobiyo. Aulune, ido amone biso ili amohe, ido amo saaba ofa selefe amofea mole wedinale dilo. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 1:24">Mag 1.24</ref></char></note>Ido amo <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Foloda</char> nini kuliba inigia, wuaaba selesia, “Inolo ili ewe, Gode ana labe lagone koleba dabalu mololo labe-eee! Ilihe Gode gili <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba</char> obegeba dimesine eno amone gilifea walefe-eeeba” wuaaba selabia saabeo. <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Hilia wedinale ido amohe aubasu moloba labeo. Aufia dufia, Folohe amo aubasu wuaaba selaba labi dubiyo habosia koleba, e nolofia, asubane amofea selesia, “Saminilo Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisone</char> wi saabia na gafea selesu, ga ido ogo gadefia mala!” E auba selesi hamagi, asubane wolumohe e gadefia aaso.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Ido amone biso ili amohe eloba bisigia, ido amofea mole dilo enomo kaalu dobi abulu. Aulugulu, ilihe Folodai, Saelesedaimo, sigiba dibia abia, guni inolo labea gagaiyola helea ami aaso. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 13:9">Mag 13.9</ref></char></note>Ilihe aalumo osolalo inolo labea lubia daafia, ilihe osolalo inolo ili amofea selesia, “Inolo aida ewe <char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomu inolo. Aaluhe nine sidi ewe woba dafelesia, <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />mana nini Lome mosomu inolo molomabiyoba elo ufulumo, aalu kuliba malesi molofe.” Ili auba seleso.<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 11:25">2Kld 11.25</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 2:2">1Des 2.2</ref></char>
    </note>Idele inolo noolo wamilimo ilida aalufea egedidiba oloba koweba seleso. Ausi, osolalo inolo ilihe inolo noolofea selesia, “Aine fagulo huba dafalifia, aalu buluso fegomaba” seleso. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Ilihe aalumo wobasubale fegofasia labi, osolalo inolo ilihe aalu dibolo dafogoso. Auba ausiamo, ilihe dibolo yasilo inolomofea sulu kolelu selesia, “Inolo aida ogo nafuluba yasimaleba” solu. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Dibolo yasilo inolohe osolalo inolo ili amo sulu selefe amo dofasia, ehe inolo aidamo dibolo molo amone lalolu usu koleba dafogoso. Aufia, ehe aine emomo i salilu aida amo aleba dafogofia, gaduba ufulu.<verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Nigili dogolea koleba Folodai, Saelesedai, aaluhe Godedai sulu saafia, Godene gasa selaba labi, dibolo inolo noolomo ili dobolaba alolu. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Auba labi, bosolufalumo, alebale heleli bule koleba sigisia, dibolo molo waminilu. Ausi, dibolo molo eno sunia sogoba yaasia, dibolo inolone seinimo hodobaisaba yaalu. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:18-19">HD 12.18-19</ref></char></note>Auba ausi, dibolo yasilo inolomo degesia, bosolufalumo, dibolo molo amone enomo, sunia sogoba yaalu dobi baafia, e hilisesia, dibolo inolo sunia fisaba dedaleba yaalububa hiliselu. Ausia, ehe ene helebesi sigifasia, ene meleba dufa olaeyo weiyaalu. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Auluso, Folohe koleba wuaaba selesia, “Ga gene meleba womabu. Nini sunia aso iwi lolu.”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Auba selesi, dibolo yasilo inolo amohe inolo noolofea selesia, “Gele yaaba dibia milaba” solu. Aufia, e Folodai, Saelesedai, aalu saabea lalolu ami naguba suga milifasia, aine emo aniba ami bibilifia gelebailu. <verse eid="ACT 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 2:37">HD 2.37</ref></char></note>Aufia ami, dibolo yasilo amohe aalumo baea lubia daafia, aalufea doba bisigia, selesia, “Inolo bule aali, na amene molosi, Godehe na <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba diyobafebi</char>?”<verse eid="ACT 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Auba selesi, aaluhe efea selesia, “Ga koleba, Saminilo Yesufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homale</char>. Ausi, Godehe gada, ge mosomuda gasiba dafelagoba disi, ami gili Ene koleba miliyobafe.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Aufia, aaluhe Saminilone sulu manamo efeada, ene moloa noolo kakainalu amofeada, solu. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Ausi, nigili dogolea hamagi, dibolo yasilo amohe aalu fegolu amone aiiye nuguma heelu. Aufia hamagi, eda, ene damenedali suniada, <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gelu</char>. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Aufia, dibolo yasilo inolo amohe aalu lubia, ene moloa suga daafia, aalufea naiyo melu. Aufia, eda, ene damenedalidai, henelu bule koleba alolumo, maumo aga e Godefea asigi ule ofelesia aulu. <figure style="fig" alt="Jailer with Paul and Silas" file="C102.tif" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="16.27-29">Diboloda yasilomo, Folodai Saelesedai aalu saabea ami, emo hugulumo sagaba asulu.</figure><verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Keafa hiliasi, osolalo inolo ilihe ibolo selu inolo mebaisia, dibolo yasilo inolofea eweguba saamalesia dedalemalu. Ibolo selu inolo dedalesia, dibolo moloa goafia, yasilo amofea selesia, “Osolalo inolo ilihe selesia, ‘Gahe inolo aida ogo sububa dafogomaleba’ selesomeba” solu. <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Auba selesi, dibolo yasilohe Folofea selesia, “Osolalo inolo ilihe nafea selesia, aali sububa dafogosia, aali malalemeba solubiyo. Aulugulu, aali dibolo gadefia abia, aali <char style="w" lemma="Aealo - Aeaba Ofolo">aealodai</char> malale.”<verse eid="ACT 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Auluso, Folohe ibolo selu inolofea selesia, “Ani Lome sidi amone wida solu inolo loluso, osolalo inolo ilihe ani nafuluba godosiale, animo idele inolone si saabia balu fegofasia, dibolo dafogoso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Eweguba besabe, Folo ene enaomoda, Saelese ene enaomoda, aalu Yuda inolo ligiaso, Lome sidi amone wida solu alolubiyo. Fogo amoyamo, Lome sidi amohe, hele sunia Medidelenia Salu Hano Galubu aniba kakainalu amone yasiba alolu. Idele inolo hele ami kakainabu aleba ami, Lome sidi amone wida solu inolo ili wi bule dulu alolu. Inolo ulenohe Lome wida solu inolo godoyo hilisesenaga, amo ili balu godoyobafale. Aubale. Nafuluba fadaba dofasiasu, godolo. Aufia, ibolo selu ilihe, ilimo balu waagi fegoyodoluale.</char></note> Aufia, agamo ilihe muguba ani afa malesi hamefia selefebu. Auyale koleba, ine ili iwi inigia, ani baea ifomesi hamefe.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Auba selesi, ibolo selu inolo ilihe Folone sulu amo osolalo inolo kakainabia dibia daalu. Osolalo inolo ilihe Folodai, Saelesedaimo, Lome inoloba selefe dobelesia, ili hidigifia sagililu. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Ausi, osolalo inolo ilimo molo aalu saabea milibaifia, aalufea yagunagabuba saafia, ilihe aalu ifoyo daafia selesia, “Aali sidi ewe gadefia malaleyobileba” solu. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Auba selesi, Folodai, Saelesedai, aalu dibolo molo afasia, inigia, ido Lidiane moloa ami daalu. Aaluhe sigidubulu damenedali noolo ami kakainabu bisigia, sulu noolo ine libo kiwigaaba ofa saaba meso. Aufia ami, aalu sidi amo gadefia daalu.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Desalonaika inolo ilihe Folodai, Saelesedaimo, dufiyo hamelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Foloda ili abia, Afibolisi daunoda, Afolonia daunoda, suniafia abia, Desalonaika dauno ami goalu. <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> uleno dauno ami alolu. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folohe</char> ene mana moloba adoguba molosia, e gulugululo molo ami gulugululu. <char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> osoloa amohe, e Godene bugohe sulu selelu dobu amone, Yuda inolodai nenelu. <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />E ilifea gadugaduba selesia, Godene bugo selelumohe eweguba ama saaba ufulu dobu. Godehe iminilu inolo, <char style="w">Keliso</char> amo, E milifasia, naga nafasia, olaeyobafeba saaba ufulu dobu. Aufia, E haiba olaiyafia, degeba ifoyobafeba saaba ufulu dobu. Folohe ilifea saaba ofa sulu amo gadugaduba saafia, ilifea selesia, “Yesu, amone saaba nahe sulu gilifea selesu amo E koleba, Gode iminilumo, Keliso labe.”<figure style="fig" alt="Folo e siba alolu aganebomo ewe" file="Paul's Second Journey.tif" size="span" loc="17.7" ref="15.36–18.22">Folo e siba alolu aganebomo ewe (15.36–18.22)</figure> <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Folo auba selesi, idele inolo noolo ili aleba ami sigiba dofasia, ili Folodai Saelesedai galiba gegoaba miliyone dedalelu. Giligi inolo Godefea gulugululo inolo alegalu wedinale noolo ilida, idele noolo wedinale wida solu ili amoda, aaluda gegoaba dedalelu.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Auluso, Yuda inolo noolohe, idele inolo ili amo aaludai gegoaba dedalefemone bisigia, ine asigi habolu. Ausi, ilihe wolu inolo noolo hele gagaiyoba ada ami alebailumo wafe diaba yaalu. Aufia, ilihe inolo wedinale nooloda molaba yaafia, dedeleba abia, dauno idele inolo amone asigi degeba waalelu. Ausi, ilihe Folodai, Saelesedai, isaeyosia naguba dedalesia, Yesonone moloa goalu. Ami goafia, aalu baea sigiba dafelagoyofia, idele inolone sone saabia ufiyoba hiliselu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Auluso, ilihe aalumo besabale baafia, Yesonoda, elewodali nooloda, sigiba dibia dedalesia, dauno amone guni inolo labea daalu. Aufia, ilihe wuaaba selesia, “Inolo mana woluda mololabia helefealu sunia siba adomo, aga iwi mulu labe! <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:2">Lug 23.2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:12">Yon 19.12</ref></char></note>Yesono ewe, ehe ilimo ene moloa milasia, heneba uluba difasia labeo. Inolo ili ogo suniahe <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisane</char> sulu muguli saidafolo. Ili selesia, kini no labeba sodomo, ene wimo Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Ili auba wuaaba selesi, idele inolo wamilida, dauno amone guni inoloda, ilihe sulu amo dofasia, keleba hilisefia, asigi woba yaalu. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Auluso, guni inolo ilihe Yesonoda, inolo noolomoda, ili amofea godo elegemafasia, ili moloa malalu.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folodai Saelesedai aalumo Belia dauno ami dabalu moloyo daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Aufia nigilisi, elewodali ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folodai</char> Saelesedai aalumo Belia dauno ami mebaisia malalu. Belia ami goafia, aalumo <char style="w">Yuda</char> ine <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu amo sugalu. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Idele inolo Belia ami alebailumo, ine manamo nafulune, idele inolo Desalonaika ami alebailumone manamo, ili amo wasolu koleba. Maumo, ilihe Folone sulu selefe amo dobelesia, ili hamelo koleba. Aufia, hilia sunia Godene sulu selelu dobumo ilihe alegafia, Folo sulu selefe amo sealela me masega selefelaba babiyone osolaba ado. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Ausimo, Yuda idele inolo wedinalemo <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char>. Aufia, Giligi wida idele inolo wedinale noolo ilida, asigi ule ufulu.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Dufia ami, Yuda inolo Desalonaika alebailumohe Folo Godene sulu mana Belia ami waleba labeba solu dubulu. Ausi, ili Belia ami inigia, idele inolo ili amone asigi elawaneba ofelesi, ili wobasubale hidigiba ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Ausi, alebale koleba, elewodali ilihe Folo e-mo salu hano galubumone egewi ami malalu. Auluso, Saelesedai, <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodidaimo</char>, Belia ami aso waagi alolu. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Aufia, inolo Foloda lubia daalu amo, ilihe e-mo lubia abia, Adenese sidi ami gadefalu. Aufia dufia ili obegeba maiyo adesi, Folohe selesia, “Saelesedai Dimodidaifea sulu sabaisia, aalu na labea alebale milalemalemeba” solu.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Godene sulu mana Adenese sidi ami walelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />
    <char style="w">Folo</char> e Adenese sidi ami, Saelesedai, Dimodidai, milesi yasiba ligia, bosolufalumo, masega gode mololu mimisililu wedinale ami waalebi abulu. Amone bisigiamo, ene asigi koleba wolu. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19">HD 18.19</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, e <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu sugafia, ehe Yuda inolo noolodaida, Giligi noolo Godefea gulugululo ilidaida, sulu neneba alolu. Aufia, hilia sunia e inolo gagaiyola helea ami daafia, idele inolo ami mulu alebaibu amodai nenelu. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Auba neneba labi, Efikuline dawalolu inolo nooloda,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Efikuline dawalolo inolo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ili amo hilisesia, helefealu iwi henelo dife amosu seale henelo diloba hiliselo.</char></note> Sodigine dawalolu inolo nooloda,<note caller="†" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sodigine dawalolo inolo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ili amo hilisesia, naga dife amoda, yagunagalo amoda, henelo amoda, ili amo woluba hiliselo. Yagu nagalone kegeleda, henelone kegeleda, holobagasi, ilihe amogulu ine libo gelualesia walelo.</char></note> ili edai sulu hegelu. Noolo selesia, “Badebadeba sodo inolo ogo, e ene selefe?” Ausi, noolohe selesia, “E hele nolobalone gode amone selefebu.” Ili auba solu, maumo Folohe Yesu olafia <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degelu</char> amone selesi aulu. <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Aufia, ilihe Folomo uluba difasia, lubia abia, galisolone gagaiyoba ado, hele gale Aleofagusuba soda ami daalu. Aufia, ilihe efea selesia, “Sulu hagaea ga idele inolofea walefe ogone maumo, ninihe asigiyo hamefe. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Ninihe ga solumo dobelesia, nini dobolaleguba, nokene koleba hidigiba dobelesu. Aulune, ninihe sulu ga ninifea solu amone maumo asigiyo hamefe.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Adenese moloada inolo ili suniada, yau inolo Adenese ami asulu amo ilida, ilihe kegele no molobale ligia, hilia sunia ilihe ami balu kakainafia sigia, sulu ili sedalele dubulu amonesu selabasu ligia, asigi hagaea no selefe amoda, dobolaba ado.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Ausi, galisolo inolo Aleofagusu galea sulu nenefea ami, Folo e ili aleba degeba lagofia, e selesia, “Adenese inolo gili doma. Gilihe gulugululo mana nokene nokeneba sunia kiwigagaba kuliba aafe amo, na bosolu. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Na gine sidi iwi siba ligiamo, nahe kegele gili gulugululomo nafuluba fadaba bebeleba alolu. Auba ligia, nahe <char style="w">soba meyone defene olabolu</char> uleno abulu. Defene olaboiya ami, sulu eweguba selelu dobibiyo. <char style="sc">Iwimo, gode ninihe asigibuale amofea ulu kegele soba memale.</char> Bama, gode gilihe asigibuale amo, gilihe efea balu guluguluba adobu. Gode amone saaba nahe gilifea sulu saeyone mulu.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.24 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 8:27">1Kin 8.27</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:48">HD 7.48</ref></char>
    </note>Helefealuda, kegele helefealu waalebumoda mololu Gode amo, E-mo anakiwineda, helefealuneda <char style="w">Saminilo</char> labe. Aulugulu, amo E <char style="w">sebele molo</char> inolo sone dulu amohe aselale. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 50:12">Sng 50.12</ref></char></note>Ehe kegele uleno abobobualene, inolone sonehe kegele uleno molofasia, e sagoba homesi babealu koleba. Maumo, miliyoluda, hame dilomoda, kegele suniada, Ene Ehe idele inolo suniafea melo. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Inolo ule mololumofea alefasia, Ehe helefealune mosomu sunia hele sunia mesesi mololu. Aufia, Ene Ehe ili melesine hilia fogo mesia, aufia Ehe ili ine mosomu hele eloba dobia ami, koleba mesesi gadefalu. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 145:18">Sng 145.18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:23">Jer 23.23</ref></char></note>Idele inolo ili E isasia, geba keleba abia, E bamesisia, Godehe auba aulu. Auluso, E-mo nini sunia elebi elebiba labea hagoale labe. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Enebamo, nini aselomoda, waminiba silomoda, adomoda, Ene Efeasu dobu. Gine sadalu sodo noolomohe auba iminiba selesia, ‘Ninida Ene sebe loluba’ solubiyo.<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17.29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:18-20">Ais 40.18-20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:10-17">44.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:26">HD 19.26</ref></char>
    </note>Aulune, nini koleba Godene sebe lolugulu, Gode E-mo <char style="w" lemma="Golo">gologulu</char> labebu, me silifagulu labebu, me abanegulu labebuba hilisemabiyo. Aufia, E-mo inolo nini asigi asigisia, nine sone mololu amogulu labebuba hilisemabiyo. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Amakelemo, inolo ili amo asigibale labihe, fogo amo ilihe kegele molosimo, Godehe baaba heelu. Auluso, agamo, Ehe idele inolo hele sunia kakainabufea selesia, ‘<char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">Asigi besimaba</char>’ selefe. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 96:13">Sng 96.13</ref></char></note>Ehe idele inolo fadaasia osolaeyomone hilia ule iminiba dobu. Aufia, Ene isolu mana amohe, helefealu idele inolo suniane manamo osolaeyobafe. Amone Ehe inolo uleno godo amo osolamesine iminifia labe. Iminilu inolo amo, E olaluso, Godehe E daneiya amifia degeba ifolu. Amofea alefasia, Godehe idele inolo suniafea gaduba selesia, inolo amo idele inolo auba osolaeyone gadefalu labeba walefe.”<verse eid="ACT 17:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Ilihe inolo haiba degeluba sulu selefe amo dofasia, inolo noolohe Folofea gaidabolu. Auluso, noolo selesia, “Ninihe kegele ga selefe ogo, hilia no saabia dubiyo hamefe.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Ausi, Folohe galisolo ili amo gadefia daalu. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Inolo bilale e galiba gegoaba dedalesia, asigi ule walelu. Ulenomo Diyoniusu, Aleofagusune galisolo inolo nomo e. Aufia, ido uleno ene wi Damalisi, eda <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char>. Aufia, idele inolo nooloda, ili asigi ule ufulu.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Folohe Kolidi sidi ami Awalu Sulu Nafulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Aufia ami, Folo e Adenese afasia, abia Kolidi sidi ami goalu. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:3">Lom 16.3</ref></char></note>E ami goafia, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo uleno ene wi Akiwila wakalilu. Akiwila e Lomene hele bule Fodusu ami seba dulu alolu. Samini waagi eda, ene ido Fulisilada, aalu hele Idali afasia mulumone maumo, Sisa Kolodiusu ehe Yuda mosomu inolo sunia ili koleba Lome sidi gadefia, hele nolobalo koleba maiyone malalelu. Aulugulu, aalu Kolidi sidi ami asulu. Wakalifasia, Folohe aalu amo galiba miliyo daalu. <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:34">HD 20.34</ref></char></note>Eda aalu dabalu mololo amoguba mololone, eda aaludai ua ligia, aalu galiba balai molo asogoba alolu. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" /><char style="w">Sabada hilia</char> sunia, Folo e <char style="w">Yudane gulugululo molo</char> usu suga daafia ligia, e Yuda mosomudai sulu nenebasu ado. Ehe Yuda mosomuda, Giligi mosomuda, ili sigiba domesine sodo.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 17:14-15">HD 17.14-15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Saelesedai, <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodidai,</char> aalumo hele <char style="w">Masedonia</char> afasia, huga saabi, <char style="w">Folo</char> e-mo Godene awalu sulu hilia sunia saeyone migagaba daabasu alolu. Ehe Yuda ilifea gaduba waleba selesia, “Yesu E <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisomo</char>. Gode alefasia Ene idele inolo gasiba dafelagoyone iminiba ufulu amomo, E.” <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:46">HD 13.46</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 13:51">51</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:26">20.26</ref></char></note>Auluso, Yuda ilihe ene sulu kuliba maiyo hamesialene, ilihe e lasiaba solu. Ausi, ehe ene fagulofea sao baabumo fifiba dafasia, ilifea selesia, “Gine heleba daalu ogomo, ginefea miliyobafe. Amone heleba daalumo nafea malene, aga na <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomu</char> inolofea waleyo aasu.”<verse eid="ACT 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Auba saafia, Folo e gulugululo molo amo afasia, e inolo ulenone moloa daalu. Inolo amone wimo Didiyusu Yasudusu. E Godefea gulugululo. Ene molomo, gulugululo molo aniba ami alolu. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Yudane gulugululo molone guni inolomo, ene wi Kisifusu. Eda, ene damenedali suniada, <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilofea</char> <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char>. Ausi, Kolidi idele inolo wedinale noolo ilida, Folo sulu selefemo dofasia, asigi ule ofelesi, ili <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gelu</char>.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Nigili ulenohe, Saminilo E-mo Folo labea udia bologuba goasia, efea selesia, “Ga sagilimabu. Saubale ligia, selabasu mela. <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 1:9">Jos 1.9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:10">Ais 41.10</ref></char></note>Na gadai lolugulu, inolo uleno milifasia ga woba ufiyobafale. Mau enebamo, Ne idele inolo wedinalemo sidi iwi kakainabu.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Folo e Kolidi sidi ami hamu ulene aube kaabeba ligia, e Godene sulu mana ilifea walebasu alolu.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Auluso, yasilo inolo uleno, ene wi Galio, hele bule <char style="w" lemma="Akaea">Akaeane</char> yasilo labi, fogo ami, Yuda mosomu gagaiyofia ili Folodai gisa alolu. Ilihe e godo dobola lubia daafia, egedidiba oloba koweba selesia, <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />“Inolo ogohe idele inolofea walesiamo, ili Godefea heleba gulugulumaleba walefe. Guluguluyone mana e ilifea molomaleba walefe amohe, Mosesene <char style="w">muguli</char> sulu gelesia afelefe.” <verse eid="ACT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Folo sulu obegeba saeyone mofe sogabagosi hamagi, yasilo inolo Galio amohe Yuda ilifea selesia, “Gili Yuda doma. Inolo ogohe Lomene sulu muguli gelefia, wolu uleno mololubiaga, amo na gine sulu dobaiye. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Auluso, aga gili na labea inigia, gilihe gine sulu sodo manada, gine muguli manada, gine wi sodo manada, keleba hilisefia, na isosia fadaamesi milibailubu. Hama, sulu ogo gine isomale. Na sulu amogulu amone isosia fadaayale.” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Auba safasia, ehe godosiale, ili afa malaba solu. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Ausi, ilihe Yudane gulugululo molomone guni inolo Sosodenese sefia, e godo dobola hamagi dufulu. Ausi, Galio ehe ili auba mololumo golaba abulu.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e Silia disiligine Adiogo ami obegeba daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18.18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="NUM 6:18">Nam 6.18</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 21:24">HD 21.24</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="w">Folo</char> e hilia wedinale Kolidi ami alefasia, dufia sigidubulu damenedalifea hawiyoba solu. Aufia, e Senikilia dauno ami daafia, Silia disiligi maiyofia, hano sibi uleno aseba lagolu. Fulisiladai Akiwiladai aaluda, e galiba daalu. Folo e aso daabale, Senikilia ami ligia, ene guni alu gelelumo, maumo e Godefea aiiba sulu saaba ufulumo geleyalesia auba mololubiyo. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Ili abia, Efesa dauno ami goafia, Folohe Fulisilada, Akiwilada, gadefia, e elebi <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu suga daafia, Yuda inolodai ami sulu nenelu. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Ilihe e-mo fogo selale melaleyobileba selesi, e miliyalelu. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Auluso, ehe ilifea hawiyoba selaba ligia, e ilifea selesia, “Godehe na obegeba milesi hamesenaga, amo na obegeba miyo.” Auba saafia, e hano sibi asefasia abia, Efesa gadefia daalu.<verse eid="ACT 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Sisalia sidi ami goafia, hano sibi afasia, e Yelusalame fela daafia, <char style="w">sese</char> idele inolo ami alebailumofea henelu sulu safasia, e ili afasia, Adiogo ami suga daalu. <verse eid="ACT 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Folo e Adiogo ami, fogo wedino labeofia, saabia maiyo daalu. E hele Galasia amida, hele Filigia amida, siba ligia, sigidubulu damenedali suniafea kiwigaaba waalelu. <figure style="fig" alt="Folo e siba alolu osolomo ewe" file="Paul's Third Journey.tif" size="span" loc="18.23" ref="18.23-21.17">Folo e siba alolu osolomo ewe (18.23–21.17)</figure><verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aboloso e Efesa ami Godene sulu mana solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Folo e ami auba sigidubulu kiwigaaba waaleyone siba labi, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo ulenomo Alegesadilia sidi amifia milifasia, Efesa dauno ami goalu. Ene wimo Aboloso. E inolo asigida dulu alefasia, Godene bugo sulu selelu dobumo fadaba dawalolu alolu. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Ehe Kelisofea asigi ule ofolo mana amone asigiba difasia, e helegeba ligia, idele inolofea kegele Yesuhe mololu amone gedeba waleba alolu. E auba idele inolofea waleluso, ehe <char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yone</char> <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gelu</char> amonesu asigilu. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />E Efesa dauno ami, <char style="w">Yudane gulugululo molo</char> usu suga daafia, ehe idele inolo ili amo baaba sagilisiale sulu saeyo maugalu. Ausi, Fulisiladai, Akiwiladai, aalumo ene sulumo dofasia, aaluhe e luba difasia, aine moloa daalu. Aufia, aaluhe efea Gode mololo eno amone mana isoba fadaba asigimesi walelu.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Dufia, Aboloso e hele bule Akaea ami maiyo asigi gagaba labi, sigidubulu damenedali ilihe ene asigi kiwigaaba ofelesia malalelu. Ilihe sese idele inolo hele bule Akaea ami alebailumofea, sowi seleba mesia selesia, “Gilihe inolo ewe heafuba luba dimaleba” solu. Aufia, Aboloso e Akaea goasia ami, ehe Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> alefasia, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi uleda waalelu</char> ili amofea bule koleba sagoba ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:22">HD 9.22</ref></char></note>Enebamo, ehe kiwigaaba ligia, idele inolone si saabia Yuda inolodai hegeba selaba ligia, ine heleba solu amone dufa dafogoba solu. Ehe Godene bugo selelu dobu amone ulufaba walesia, inolo Yesu amo E-su Keliso, Gode iminilumo, E-ba gaduba solu.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Folohe Efesa ami Godene sulu mana walelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1-2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.1-2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:16">HD 8.16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:23">18.23</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 3:6">1Kld 3.6</ref></char>
    </note>Aboloso e Kolidi sidi ami labi, <char style="w">Folo</char> e hele galefealo lagolo siba labeofia, e Efesa dauno ami goalu. Efesa ami sigidubulu idele inolo noolo wakalisia, ehe ilifea eweguba doba abulu. “Gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofelesimo</char>, gili <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Godene Asubane Noekenemo</char> dulula?” Ili obegeba selesia, “Duluale. Ninihe Asubane Noekenemo labeba solumo aubada uleno dubuluale.” <verse eid="ACT 19:1-2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Auba selesi, Folohe ilifea selesia, “Gili <char style="w">hano gelo</char> halagulumone gelu?” Ausi, ili obegeba selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Hano Gelo Yone">Yonehe</char> hano gelomone gelu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.4 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mad 3.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Auba selesi, Folo selesia, “Yonehe idele inolo hano geba waalelumo, <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besiluba</char> samesine hano geba waalelu. Ehe inolo e-da faisa miyobafemofea asigi ule homaleba solu. Inolo Yonehe iminiba solu amomo, Yesu.” <verse eid="ACT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Folo auba selefe dofasia, ilimo <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesune wi saabia hano gelu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:17">HD 8.17</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 10:44">10.44</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 10:46">46</ref></char></note>Ausi, Folohe ene sone ine gunia ofelesi, Asubane Noekenemo ilifea huga saabi, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Asubanene sulu nonoba sodo">Asubanene sulu nonoba</char> selesia, ilihe saaba ofa selaba yaalu. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Inolo ili ami kakainalu amone alegalumo, huguluba alolu.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Aufia, Folo e <char style="w">Yudane gulugululo molo</char> usu ami suga daafia, ehe awalu sulu nafulu amone kiwigaaba solu. Ehe ilidai nenesiamo, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Ada kegele amone ine asigi degeba ofa selaba ligia, aube osoloa daalu. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Auluso, noolohe ine asigi kolesia, sigidubuluale. Ilihe idele inolone si saabia Saminilone Enomo elasiaba solu. Ausi, Folo ine gulugululo molo afasia, sigidubulu faibili noolo luba difasia, Dilanusene sugululo molosu ami suga daafia, hilia sunia ami sulu nenebasu ado. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />E auba moloba ligia, hamu aida daalu. Ausi, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inoloda, Giligi inoloda, hele bule Asia ami kakainalumo, ili sunia Saminilone sulu manamo dobolaba yaalu.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inolo Sekefane faibilihe asubane wolu asigaba dafiyo hamelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11-12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11-12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.11-12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:15">HD 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:3">14.3</ref></char>
    </note>Godehe <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folone</char> sonefea alefasia, <char style="w">momolelu kegele</char> kiwigaaba nokene nokeneba mololu. Idele inolo noolo ilihe Folone fifilima heeloda, ene fagulo geleluda, difasia abia, walefalu inolofea gesihe, ine walefa waisia, asubane wolu ilifea alolumo ili gadefia dedaleba yaalu.<verse eid="ACT 19:11-12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13-14" />Fogo ami, Yuda inolo noolo ili mole elegeba diyosia, idele inolofea asubane wolu asigaeyone siba alolu. Inolo auba moloba alolu amo, Sekefane faibili domoba, amo ili. Sekefa amo Yudane <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ulenomo, e. Hilia uleno ilihe Yesune wi alefasia asubane wolu asigaeyo weiyaalu. Auba ausimo, ili asubane wolu amofea selesia, “Inolo Yesu, Folo E amone saaba sulu selefe amo, Ene wifea alefasia, inolo gada felalu amo, afa mala!” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.13-14 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sekefane faibili </char><char style="ft" closed="false">domoba amo, Yesufea asigi ule ofale ligia, asubane wolufea Yesune wi balu malaba solu.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 19:13-14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Ilihe auba selesi, asubane wolu amohe obegeba selesia, “Yesumo, na asigibu. Folone wida, na dubulu. Auluso, gili abe koleba?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Auba safasia, inolo asubane woluda alolu amohe, ilifea suba adesia, ili naga sodoba yaalu. Ehe ine domala woba dafalifia, ine fagulo bibidiba dafalilu. Ausi, ili molo amo gadefia, abagudoa, ibi helelelabia fisaba dedaleba yaalu.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 5:11">HD 5.11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Yuda idele inolo ili suniada, Giligi idele inolo ili suniada, Efesa ami alebailu amo, ilihe mololu amone dobelesia, sagili bule adesia, Saminilo Yesune wi digilu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Idele inolo wedinale <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ofolaba</char> yaalumo milibaifasia, idele inolo noolone si saabia wolu ili samini mololumo sunia fogaba selaba yaalu. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Ausi, idele inolo goneda mololo ilihe, mana amone dawaloyone selelu bugo amo molafia, idele inolo suniane si saabia de subulu. Bugo amo suniane elebe diyo alegalumo, 50,000 silifa mole amogulu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Silifa mole </char><char style="ft" closed="false">iso ule amo, hilia ule dabalu molosi dilo. Aulugulu, 50,000 silifa mole amo, inolo 140 amogulumohe hamu ule dabalu molosi ililiyobafe.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Ausi, Saminilone sulumo idele inolo kiwigaaba dobelesia, ine miliyoluda kiwigaaba sobolabia aasi, ilihe hele nolobaloda sunia Godene sulu mana saaba sigilu. <figure style="fig" alt="Burning magic scrolls" file="C104.tif" size="col" copy="© 1997 New Tribes Mission/Foreign Mission Board, Southern Baptist Convention. Used with permission." ref="19.19">Ilihe gone moloyone dawalolo beba de sobolefe.</figure><verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efesa idele inolo ilihe Folofea koleba hegeba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:11">HD 23.11</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:13">Lom 1.13</ref></char>
    </note>Auba molofasia labi, Asubane Noekenemohe <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folone</char> asigifea hiliseba ofelesi, Folo e hele <char style="w" lemma="Masedonia">Masedoniada</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Akaea">Akaeada</char>, suniafia Yelusalame maiyo asigilu. E selesia, “Na ami daafia, dufiamo Lomeda babiyo maiyoba.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Auba saafia, ehe ene sagoba ofolo aida <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodidai</char>, Elasadusudai, aaludale Masedonia maiyone malalu. Aufia, Folo e-mo hele bule Asia ami aso fogo abobo waagi alolu.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19.23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CO 1:8">2Kld 1.8</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Fogo amo inolo noolohe Saminilone Enomo kakaba hegeba bule koleba solu. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Inolo uleno ami asulumo, ene wimo Demidilusu. Inolo amone dabalumo, abane silifa kegele amone mololo. Ehe masega ido gode Ademisi amone sebele molo mimisililu wedino silifahe molofasia, elegesia mole dilo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Efesa idele inolo ilihe </char><char style="fq" closed="false">masega ido gode Ademisi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amofea gulugulusiamo, ido gode amohe ilifea faibe wedinale seba memesisiada, edo gelu nafulu homesisiada, ili efea gulugululo. </char></note> Auba molosiamo, ehe dabalu mololo wedinalefea dabalu mesi, ilida mole bule dilo. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Ausi, Demidilusu ehe ene dabalu mololoda, inolo mimisililu mololo nooloda, wafe difasia, ilifea selesia, “Dabalu ua mololo nini koleba, doma. Ninihe dabalu molosia, mole huliane disia, nafulu kakainalomo, gili asigibu. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Auluso, inolo Folo ogo inigia, ehe idele inolo wedinalemo ine asigi sigiba molafia, heleba uluba dibia ano. Ehe mana amo Efesa iwisu mololale. Aubale. Ehe auba mololabia abia, Asia hele sunia ililiba doba sigifia, baaba samodobu. Ehe selesia, inolo sone mololu godemo, gode sealealeba sodo. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Folo ogone sulu amohe, mole dilo dabalu nini mololo amone wi woiyo weiyaafe. Amosuale, kegele no amo ewe, ene sulu selefe amofea alefasia, idele inolo ilihe ido gode bule Ademisine gulugululo molo amo bisigia, kegele balubusia waaselaeyobafe. Amakelemo, Asia idele inolo suniada, helefealu idele inolo suniada, ilihe ido gode ewefea gulugululo. Auluso, aga Folo ogone sulu amohe Ademesine wi woiyo weiyaafe.” Demidilusu auba solu.<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Idele inolo ilihe Demidilusu sulu solumo dofasia, ili gadilu bule koleba alefasia, wuaaba koleba selaba yaasia, “Nini Efesane Ademisi e saminilo bule koleba-aaa!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">HD 20.4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27.2</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4.10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Flm 1.24</ref></char></note>Ausihe, dauno ami kakainalu ili amo sulu gala bule dafelesi, idele inolo sunia gagaiyola helea naguba inigia, koleba wuaalabia milibailu. Ilihe milibaifasia, Gaiyusudai, Alisidakusudaimo, sefasia, sigiba dibia daalu. Inolo aida amo Masedonia inolo alolu. Aalu Folodai siba ado mulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Ausi, Folo e idele inolo gagaiyofia labea ami maiyo asigiluso, sigidubulu inolo ilihe e kaalu. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Aufia, Asiane gamanene yasilo inolo noolomo, Folone damene alolune, ilihe efea sulu sabaisia, e gagaiyola helea ami malesiale haguguba koleba solu.<verse eid="ACT 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Idele inolo wedinale gagaiyolu ili amohe, asigimo elawaneba yaalu. Ili amo wuaaba sulu selaba yaasia, sulu nonoba selaba yaalu. Aufia, idele inolo wedinale ili noolomo gagaiyolu amone mau nafuluba fadaba hiliseluale. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" /><char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo ilihe Alegesadamo ulufa melafia gadefasia, idele inolofea sulu sausagamaba wuaaba solu. Ausi, Alegesadamo ulufa miliyo daafia, ehe idele inolo saumesi sone gaso olabo mesia, nini Yudahe amo mololualeba subuyo sulu saeyo weiyaalu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Auluso, ilihe e-mo Yuda inoloba eloba bisigia, idele inolo wamili suniahe koleba wuaaba selesia, “Nini Efesane Ademisimo, e saminilo bule koleba-ooo!” Ili auba wuaaba selabasu ligia, halosi aoa aida daalu.<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Auba labi, dauno amone bebada selelo inolo amohe, idele inolo wamili amofea saumesi selesia, “Efesa inolo gili doma! Efesa dauno ewehe ido gode Ademisi amone sebele moloda, ene mimisililu anakiwifia hodobailu amoneda, luba ado. Helefealu idele inolo sunia auba asigifia alebaibu koleba. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Aulugulu, inolo ulenohe sulu amo saidafiyodoluale labegulu, gili esebalo gadaeyafia mela. Kegele uleno ogoba sisiba molomabiyo. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Gilihe inolo aida ogo iwi sigiba dibia lubia muluso, aaluhe sebele molo woba ufuluale. Aufia, aaluhe nine ido godemoda lasiaba soluale. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />Aulugulu, Demidilusuda, ene dabalu mololoda, ilihe inolo ulenofea sulu saeyo dobunaga, amo godosia domesi saeyo dobu. Gamanene yasilo saminilo labegulu, ilihe sulu amo isosia fadaayobafe. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Aulune, gilihe sulu noolo saeyo aso dobunaga, amo godoyone gagaiyosia, ami mana isoba dobuguba isomesi saeyo malale. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Aufia, doma. Gamanene yasilo noolo ilihe aga nini mololumo dobelesenaga, amo ilihe nini wolu bule molofeba selesia, nini godoyobafe. Nini aga mololu amone mau koleba male. Aulune, ilihe ninifea enesi nini gagaiyofia koleba wuaaba yaaluba doba besenaga, amo nini ilifea sulu uleno saaba obegeyobale.” <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Bebada selelo inolo amohe sulu auba safasia, idele inolo dedalemalelu.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Folo e Masedonia suniafia, Giligi helea ami maiyone hele aiba daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Idele inolo koleba wuaaba selaba alolu amoda gadaeyasi, <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folohe</char> sigidubulu idele inolo gagaiyoba milibaimafia, ehe ine libo kiwigaaba ofa solu. Aufia, ehe ilifea hawiyoba safasia, <char style="w">Masedonia</char> helea maiyone daalu. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />E hele ami siba ligia, idele inolo ami kakainalumofea ine libo kiwigaaba ofa selabia siba alolu. Aulabia abia, e Giligi helea goalu. <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />Aufia, e aube osoloa Giligi hele ami alefasia, dufia disiligi Silia maiyo asigisia, e hano sibi aleba lagoyo ligia, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo ilihe e dufiyo daiyaluba solu dubulu. Aulune, ene asigi nolofia, e Masedoniafealo sunialabia haiba obegeba maiyo daiyalu.<verse eid="ACT 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Inolo noolo e galiba siba miliyone maiyo alolumo, ine wi ewe, Filusune faibe Sofade, Belia dauno inolo uleno amo e. Aufia, Alisidakusudai, Sekudusudai, aalumo Desalonaika inolo alolu. Aufia, Gaiyusu, e-mo Debi dauno inolo alolu. Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Dimodi">Dimodi</char> eda. Aufia, Digikusudai, Dolofimusudai, aalumo hele bule Asiafia mulu alolu. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Inolo ili amo ilidale saminiba daafia, Dolase dauno ami, nini dufia milesi yasiba alolubiyo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bama, ga iwimo </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nini</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ba seleba ufulumo alegasiamo, ga asigisia, Lugu bugo eweda selelu amo, eda Foloda galiba daaluba asigiyobafe.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Auluso, nini Filibai sidi ami ligiasu, <char style="w">Boledi Yisida Ofale Subulumo Naiyone Sigilo Hilia</char> alolu amo samodosi, nini hano sibi aleba lagofasia, Filibai afasia daalu. Hano sibi asefasia abia, hilia bia alefasia, nini Dolase dauno ami inolo ilidale daafia, nini yasiba asuluiya ami goalu. Aufia, nini hilia domoba ami asulu.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dolase dauno ami, Folohe Yudikusu degeba ifolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Domo hilia adesi, nini sigidubulu idele inolo ili galiba naiyo ua naiyone gagaiyolu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Baibolo dawalolo inolo noolo hilisesia, boledi amo naiyonemo, Yesune badoda ene ibida nabia auluba hilisefe.</char></note> Auba gagaiyofia ligia, <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folohe</char> idele inolofea sulu selaba adeso. E adigi keafa maiyo asigilugulu, ehe sulu selabasu ligia, nigili dogolea adeso. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Lalolu ninida gagaiyofia asuluiya ami, naafa yaaba walelubiyo.<verse eid="ACT 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Molo salu sagalu lalolu osolo ninida asulu ami, faibe fisamili ulenomo, ene wi Yudikusu, galuano enone i saabia aseleso. Folo e sulu selale selabasu labi, faibe amone si higinisia, e hanemiafia labeo. Aufia, e haneba kalolune, molo salu sagalu lalolu osolo ana amifia, hele saabia gelebaiso. Ausi, ilihe e dia huga daaluso, e olalu dobi besabeo. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Folo eda huga daafia, ene e faibe saabia waaba ofolagofia, faibe amo fafuso. Aufia, ehe ili noolofea selesia, “Gili asigimabiyo. Miliyolu aso efea labe.” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Aufia, Folo e haiba lalolu ana lago fela daafia, <char style="w">boledi</char> olabofia, nini ua mololu. Aufia, ehe ilifea fogo selale sulu selabasu yoba ligia, hiliaso. Hilialu dobi, Folo e aaso. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Faibe fisamili amo aso saabi baafia, idele inolo ilihe e moloa ulubia daafia, ine libo bule koleba heneso.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e Dolase afasia, e Miledusu ami maiyo daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />
    <char style="w">Folo</char> daafia labi, nini abia hano sibi aleba lagofia abia, Asoso dauno ami goafia, ninihe Folomo ami milesi yasiba alolu. Enebamo, Folo elebi hele aiba maiyone asigifia, ehe nini hano sibi Dolase ami daafia e ami yasimaleba seleso. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Aufia, Folo e nini Asoso ami wakalisi, nini ua hano sibi ule aleba lagofia abia, Midilini dauno ami maiyone daalu. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Adigi keafa, nini Midilini afasia, nini abia saidudu Kioso goalu. Aufia, hilia amone faisa, nini abia, saidudu Samoso ami goalu. Aufia, hilia no amone faisamo, nini abia, Miledusu dauno ami goalu. <verse eid="ACT 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Folo e Efesa sunialabia maiyone asigilumo, mau enebamo, e hele Asia ami fogo weaseba adesiale, ogoba sisiba maiyo hiliseso. Maumo, fogo adesenaga, e Yelusalame goafia labi, <char style="w">Fedikoso Sigilo Hilia</char> amo milesifia auso.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Efesa sesene guni inolofea hawiyoba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20.17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:21">HD 18.21</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nini Miledusu dauno goafia, Folohe Efesa <char style="w" lemma="Sese">sesene</char> guni inolo ilifea sulu sabaisia, ili e babiyo milaleso.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Miledusu dauno </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo Efesa dauno amodaimo 50 kilomida amoguba labe. Hele aiba abiamo, hilia ule me hilia aida ano.</char></note> <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:19-19:10">HD 18.19–19.10</ref></char></note>Ili ami goasi, ehe ilifea selesia, “Na hele Asia maugaba goafia, na gilidai adabia inigia, mana na moloba ligia asulu amo, gili asigibu. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Na <char style="w" lemma="Saminilo">Saminilone</char> dabalu mololabia inigiamo, na hamedofa ligia, si hanodai mololabia miliba labi, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo noolohe na dufa dafogoyofia dedeba besabeo. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Nahe sulu nafulu noolo gili sagoba ofa saeyomo sesailuale. Idele inolo gagaiyola helea amida, aufia gine moloa moloaba amida, nahe gilifea waleba alolumo gine asigibu. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Nahe Yuda inolo noolofeada, Giligi inolo noolofeada, kiwigaaba ofa selesia, ilihe Godefea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besifia</char>, nine Saminilo Yesufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule homesine</char> sodo.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />Aulugulu, gili doma. Aga Godene Asubanehe na sigisi, na Yelusalame maiyobasu. Nafea Yelusalame iligi holobagaeyobafe amo na asigibuale. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:16">HD 9.16</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 21:11">21.11</ref></char></note>Ewesu na hilisebu, sidi sunia nada daaiya ami, <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char> nafea saaba mesia, dibolo dafogoyomoda, higinilu wedinale diyomoda, nafea mi gagiyone yasifia labeba sodo. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:13">HD 21.13</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:7">2Dim 4.7</ref></char></note>Auluso, nahe ne miliyolumo bule kegeleba asigisuale. Nahe ne miliyolumo fedoba sebuale. Aubale. Eno na kuliba aasu ewene abiamo, dabalu Saminilo Yesuhe nafea melumone samodoyo amonesu na asigibu. Ne dabalu amo, Godene <char style="w">kanululo</char> awalu sulu nafulu saeyo amone mololo.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />Aulugulu, ne nelewodali nanodali, doma. Na gili aleba ugi samini selabia siba ligiamo, na Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamone saaba meba alolu. Auluso, aga na asigife, dufiamo gili suniahe ne misi saabia no babiyobafale. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Aulugulu, nahe aga gilifea eweguba sawaba ulufaba selesu. Inolo uleno gili aleba ugi daba dafelesenaga, amo ene heleba daalumo nafea baeyale. <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Enebamo, nahe Godene asigilo sunia gilifea saaba meyomo sesailuale. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 4:16">1Dim 4.16</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:2-4">1Fid 5.2-4</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, gili gine meleba nafuluba yasimale. Aufia, sese idele inolo sogolugaba labe ili amo suniada, nafuluba yasimale. Asubane Noekenemohe Godene dofene sibi sogolu gaabu ili amone uluba ado melesi, gili gadefaba yaalu. Aulugulu, gilihe Godene sesemo Ehe Ene Faibene ibihe elegelu amo uluba melale. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:15">Mad 7.15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:12">Yon 10.12</ref></char></note>Na asigife, dufia nahe gili gadefia daafia labimo, selibo geso wolu koleba noolo gili aleba ugi milibaifasia, dofene sibimo woba dafaliyobafe. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Aufia, inolo noolo gili aleba ugida degeba yaafia, Godene idele inolo noolo ili kuliba milesi sigisia, seale sulu amo meleba gagaba dafaliyobafe. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TH 2:11">1Des 2.11</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, gili hilia sunia nafuluba yasimale. Gili mana na mololumo galimabiyo. Hamu osoloa aleba ami, nigilibada, yaidada, na gili sunia elebi elebibafea asigi nafulu meyonemo, na kiwi saneluale. Na gilifea haguguba selabia inigiamo, si hano sugalabia naga diabia mulu.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />Aga nahe gili Godene sone saabia ofelesumo, gilihe Gode Ene kanululo sulu solumo asigimale. Kanululo amohe gili kiwigaaba ofelesia, gili Gode Ene <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> melesi iminiba waaleyobafe. Gili auba Godedai muuba kalilu mololu alebaisi, Ene kanululo amofea alefasia daalo diyobafe. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 9:11-12">1Kld 9.11-12</ref></char></note>Na gilidai aso asulu fogo amimo, inolo ulenone mole silifada, <char style="w" lemma="Golo">goloda</char>, fagulo kegeleda, mesegebale alolu. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:3">HD 18.3</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 2:9">1Des 2.9</ref></char></note>Gili asigibu, nahe nene sonehe alefasia, dabalu mololumohe na diyoluba hilisefemo difasia, inolo noolo nadai labemoda sagoba waalelo. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Hogololu dabalu na mololu amohe, gilifea eweguba walefe. Ninihe bibiogolu inolo sagoba ufiyo dobu. Aufia, hilia sunia ninihe sulu Saminilo Yesu solu amone hilisebasu miliyo dobu. Ehe eweguba solu. ‘Kegele meyomone henelomo waselesia, kegele diyomone henelomo abobolu dobu.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Folohe sulu auba safasia, ili sunia emo hugulumo sagaba yoba kakainafia, ilihe Godedai sulu seleso. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Auba safasia, ili sunia bule yegilisia, ilihe <char style="w">Folo</char> sefia fafuaba mimiba yaaso. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Ilihe e bule koleba yagunagalu, maumo Folohe ene misimo ilihe saabia no babiyobafaleba selesi auso. Aufia, ilihe e hano sibi dobia ifoyo saabeo.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Folo e hano sibi asefasia abia, Yelusalame maiyo daalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Inolo ili amo Folo fafuaba sesaifia labi, ninihe ili gadefia maiyomo kolelu alolu. Ausi, nini ili amo gadefia abia, nini hano sibi uleno aseba lagofia, salu hano galubumo ofa lagofia abia, saidudu Koso ami koleba maiyone daalu. Aufia, adigi keafa ami, nini abia, saidudu Lodese ami goalu. Nini Lodese afasia, abia Fadala dauno ami goalu. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Fadala dauno ami, ninihe hano sibi uleno Fonisia disiligi ami segeba maiyone labi baafia, nini amo aseba lagofia, afa daalu. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Aufia abia, nini saidudu Saibulusu amo baaba anogofia, abiamo sone inaloafealomo suniafia, Silia helea ami maiyo daalu. Aufia abiamo, nini Daila sidi ami kalugaalu, maumo, hano sibi amohe kegele noolo ami suluba ufiyofasia auso. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:23">HD 20.23</ref></char></note>Ninihe sigidubulu damenedali noolo ami wakalifasia, hilia domobamo ili galiba asulu. <char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemo</char> alefasia, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folofea</char> koleba selesia, Yelusalame ami malabiyoba seleso. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Auluso, hano sibimo Daila amo afasia maiyo molosi, nini hano sibi dobia maiyo daalu. Nini aasihe, Kelisone inolo ilida, ine eamonodalida, ine faibe suniada, ilihe ninimo sidi amone yala faisafealo ifoyo milibaiso. Aufia, hano saiya ami, nini emo hugulumo sagafia Godedai sulu solu. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Aufia, hawiyoba safasia, nini hano sibi aleba lagosihe, ilida ine moloa obegeba dedaleso.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sisalia sidi ami, saaba ofolo Agabusuhe Folofea sulu saaba melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Aufia, nini Daila afasia abia, nini Dolemese dauno ami goafia, ili hano sibi godaiba ofelesi, nini sigidubulu damenedali noolodai ami wakalisia, hilia ule ilidai alolu. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 6:5-6">HD 6.5-6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:5">8.5</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 8:40">40</ref></char></note>Adigi keafa, nini Dolemese dauno afasia abia, Sisalia sidi ami goafia, Godene manada walelo inolo <char style="w" lemma="Filibi[[2]], digono inolo uleno">Filibi</char> amone moloa hanelu. Inolo Domoba<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Inolo Domoba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amo, ilihe hilibailu inolo sagoba ofolo. Sidifeneda galiba inolo aaiyoba gadefaluso, Sidifene olafasia labi, ili amo Domoba amone sodo. (Lalolu 6.5 ami bamale.)</char></note> amone ulenomo, e alolubiyo. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Ene eleweli biniba budasile asulumo, ilihe saaba ofa sodo alolubiyo.<verse eid="ACT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 11:28">HD 11.28</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Nini hilia noolo ami alefasia labi, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo uleno ene wi Agabusu e Yudiafia huga saabeo. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:23">HD 20.23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 21:33">21.33</ref></char></note>Inolo Agabusu e nini labea huga milifasia, <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folone</char> madibu difasia, ene soneda, ene emoda amo dofalu. Auba dofafia ligia, e selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char> eweguba selefe. Na ewe molosu hamagubasu, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo noolo Yelusalame kakainabu ili amohe madibu ewene enaomo dofafia, e <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau inolone</char> sonefea meyobafemeba” seleso. <verse eid="ACT 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Sulu Agabusu ewe selefe amo dofasia, ninida, idele inolo ami kakainalumoda, ninihe Folofea saaba bebeleba selesia, Yelusalame lago malabiyoba selabasu alolu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:24">HD 20.24</ref></char></note>Auba labi, Folohe ninifea obegeba selesia, “Gilihe enesi ne yagu gelesia, yegilisia waalese? Yelusalame lagi ilihe na dofasenaga, amo na madenefia lolu. Amosuale, na lagi ligia, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Yesune wi amofea alefasia olasenaga, amoneda, na madenefia lolu.” Folo auba seleso. <verse eid="ACT 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Nini e-mo kaeyodoluale baafia, hamaba selesia, Saminilo E hamefeguba waagi moloyobafeba solu.<verse eid="ACT 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e abia, Yelusalame lagi goalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Aufasia ami, ninihe kegele noolo madenefia, Yelusalame lago maiyone daalu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Auba abia, sigidubulu damenedali noolo Sisaliafia milibaifasia, nini galiba inigia, ilihe ninimo inolo Nasono ene moloa ulubia sugaso. Nasono e-mo, saidudu Saibulusu inolo. Samini waagifia, e sigidubulu inolo alolu. Ehe ninimo ene moloa ami haneyone uluba diso. <verse eid="ACT 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Nini Yelusalame ami goasimo, sigidubulu damenedali noolohe nini uluba diyomo heafuba yaaso. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Adigi keafa ami, <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Foloda</char>, nini nooloda, <char style="w" lemma="Yemese[[3]], Yemese Bugoda selelumo, amo e">Yemese</char> babiyone daalu. Ausihe, sesene guni inolo ilida, fogo amohe gagaiyoyo saabeo. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:12">HD 15.12</ref></char></note>Folohe ilifea henelu sulu saafia, Godehe ene sonefea alefasia kegele sunia <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> aleba ami mololumo, ilifea nafuluba gedeba awaba meso.<verse eid="ACT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Guni inolo ilihe Folomo sebele moloa malalelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.20 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 15:1">HD 15.1</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 15:5">5</ref></char>
    </note>Sese guni inolo ilihe Folo sulu solumo dofasia, ilihe Godene wi digiba seleso. Aufia, ilihe Folofea selesia, “Nelewo, ga asigibu, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo daosene wedinale saludiale noolomo Yesufea <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> alebaibiyo. Ili amo suniahe, Mosesene sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> kiwigagaba kuliba ano. <verse eid="ACT 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />Inolo noolo ilihe ga amone saaba sulu eweguba seleso. ‘Gahe Yuda idele inolo ili <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau mosomu</char> aleba ami kakainabumofea, <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> sulu mugulimo hamalesia, ilihe ine faibene bado gelemabiyoba solububa’ seleso. Aufia, ilihe amakelene manamo saabia no kuliba malesialeba ga ilifea solububa seleso. Ilihe ga auba solubiyoba seleso. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Nini asigibu, ilihe ga muluba solumo dubulune, ninihe eneba moloyobi? <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:1-20">Nam 6.1-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:18">HD 18.18</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, ninihe mana uleno ga kuliba malesi hamebumo, gafea selesu. Ninihe iwi inolo biniba labemo, ilihe Godefea aiiba sulu uleno saaba ufia labe. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Gahe inolo biniba ewe luba difasia, ga ilidai Godene si saabia galagololu miliyomone mana molomale. Aufia, ilihe ine guni alu gaseba damesine, gahe amone elebe elegemale. Ga auba molosi, inolo suniahe sulu ga amone saaba solumo, masega solububa hilisemesi. Ili asigisia, gada sulu muguli kuliba anobuba hilisemesi, gahe auba molomale. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 15:29">HD 15.29</ref></char></note>Auluso, yau sigidubulu idele inolo ilifealomo, ninihe sulu samini saaba ufulumone seleba dafelagolu. Ninihe ilifea selesia, ‘Naiyo kegele, masega godefea soba melu amo, namenabiyo. Aufia, ibi namenabiyo. Aufia, kelebulu kolofolo sefia dufa olalu amoda, namenabiyo. Aufia, susugu mana nokene nokeneba molomabiyoba’ solu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CO 9:2">1Kld 9.2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Sese guni inolo auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folohe</char> inolo ili Godefea aiiba sulu solu amo luba difasia, adigi keafa ami, ene eda ili galiba galagololu miliyone mana amone kuliba aaso. Aufia, e <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molomone</char> yala usu sugafasia, <char style="w">soba melo inolo</char> ilifea selesia, hilia halaiyago ili galagololu alefasia, ili elebi elebibahe soba meyone ililiyobafeba saeyo aaso.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda inolo ilihe Folomo sebele moloa ami selu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Ili saaba ufulumone ililisia, hilia domoba amo suniaeyo hagoalesi, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo noolo hele Asiafia milibailu ili amohe, Folomo <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molomone</char> yala usumohe labi baafia, ilihe Folofea gadimesifia, idele inolo suniane libo degeba ofelesia, e seso. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28-29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.28-29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">HD 20.4</ref></char></note>Auba ausiamo, ili koleba wuaaba selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Isolaele">Isolaele inolo</char>, gili koleba nini sagoba homa! Inolo labe ogohe, idele inolo hele sunia alebaibumofea walesia, nine mosomuda, Mosesene sulu mugulimoda, aufia sebele molo eweda, woba ofa waaleba ado. Aufia amosuale. Aubale. Ehe Giligi inolo noolo sebele molo ewene yala usu suga milibaimaba solumohe, sebele molo <char style="w" lemma="Noekene">noekene</char> ewe, e nugumaba moloba ufulu.” Ilihe auba seleso. Ilihe auba selesomone, maumo, samini ilihe Efesa inolo Dolofimusumo <char style="w">Folo</char> galiba Yelusalame sidi iwi siba labi abulu. Aulune, ili hilisesia, Folohe Efesa inolo amo sebele molomone yala usu ami luba dibia suga mulububa hilisesia, auba seleso.<verse eid="ACT 21:28-29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Yelusalame idele inolo ilihe sulu amo dofasia, wobasubale hidigifia, ili sunia naguba milibaiba yaaso. Ilihe Folomo sigiba dibia abia, sebele molomone yala faisafealo ami dedaleso. Auba ausi, alebale ilihe sebele molo yalalu amone enomo sunia kakaba dafaliso.<verse eid="ACT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lomene yobolo inolo ilihe Folo uluba dulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Ilihe Folo dufiyo weiyaaba labihe, inolo noolo abia, Lomene yobolone saminilo amofea selesia, Yelusalame idele inolo ili sunia ine geleba gadiba yaafia belaguba yaafeba solu. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Auba selesi dofasia, alebale ehe yobolo inolo nooloda, ine yasilo inolo nooloda, milibaimafia, e ilidai idele inolo alebaibia ami naguba suga dedalelu. Yuda inolo ilihe yobolo inolo nooloda ine saminilodai saabe baafia, ilihe <char style="w">Folo</char> dufulaba alolumo afeleso.<verse eid="ACT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Ausihe, yobolone saminilomo hagoaleba milifasia, Folo sefia, ehe yobolo inolo noolofea seini aida amohe ene sone dofamaso. Aufia, ehe Yuda idele inolofea eweguba doba besabeo. “Inolo ogo abe? E amene moloso?” <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Idele inolo wedinale alebailu ilihe, wuaaba yaasia, sulu nonoba selaba yaaso. Ilihe sulu gala bule dafelesihe, yobolone saminilohe sulu maumo nafuluba dobelesale. Ausi, ehe yobolo inolo noolofea selesia, Folo uluba dibia abia, yobolone moloa lagi fela maiyo malaleba seleso. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Auluso, Folo e abia molo amone aulo maugaba medesi, yobolo inolo ili bisigia, wamili ilihe Folo dufiyo kiwigagafemo baafia, ilihe e digifia aaso. <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 23:18">Lug 23.18</ref></char></note>Idele inolo wamili kuliba dedalelu ili amohe wuaaba selabia abia, “E dufa olamaleba” seleso.<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe ili Yuda idele inolofea e asigi ule ufulu amone awaba melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Yobolo inolo ilihe <char style="w">Folo</char> lubia yobolone molo usu sugaeyo molosi, Folohe yobolone saminilo amofea, Giligi suluba selesia, “Nahe gafea sulu ule saeyobile?” Auba selesi, yobolone saminilo efea selesia, “Ga Giligi sulu sodola? <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:36-37">HD 5.36-37</ref></char></note>Na hilisesia, ga Isibi inolomo, e fogo olofa anigi alefasia, gamanedai belagufia, inolo helebesi belagulo 4,000 falumo difasia, ilimo lubia, isale hele falaiya ami daalumo, inolo amo ga-buba hilisesu.”<verse eid="ACT 21:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Auba selesi, Folo selesia, “Aa, na Yuda inolo. Ne helemo, Silisia, ne daunomo, Dasusu. Ne dauno amo wida bule dobu. Na koleba idele inolo ilifea sulu saeyone, ga nafea fogo memaleyobile?” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Auba doba besabi, saminilo inolomohe eeba selesi, Folo e aulo saabia ami yoba ligia, idele inolo sulu saumesi sone olaboba meso. Auba ausi, ili sunia sulu sausagasi, Folohe ilifea <char style="w">Hibulu</char> suluba eweguba seleso.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Nelewodali, naodali, gili doma. Aga nahe gilifea nene meleba subuyo sulu selesia, na heleba uleno mololualeba nafuluba fadaba selesu.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Folo auba selesi, ilihe e Hibulu suluba selefe dofasia, ili sausagafia esebalo koleba alolu. Ausi, Folohe selesia, <verse eid="ACT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 5:34">HD 5.34</ref></char></note>“Na Yuda inolo lolu. Ne naehe na seba dulumo, hele Silisia, Dasusu dauno ami seba duluso, na bulelumo, Yelusalame sidi iwi bulelu. Na Gamalilene walelu faibe labi, ehe nauwadaline <char style="w">muguli</char> manamo nafea nafuluba koleba waleso. Aufia, nahe gili aga molofe hamagubasu, nada Gode hilisesia, dabalu kiwigaaba koleba helegeba moloba ado alolu. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:3">HD 8.3</ref></char></note>Auba ligia, nahe Eno eweda kuliba dedalelo idele inolomo woba walesia, ili amo dufa olaeyosia asigaba dafaliba ado. Nahe ilimo seini dofafasia, luba dibia dibolo moloa dafalibagoba ado. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" /><char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">Soba melone yasilo</char> inolo e-da, galisolo inolo ili suniada, mana na mololumo, ili asigibu. Aulune, ili amone gilifea sealeba saeyodolu labe. Ilihe sowi selefasia melumo, ine elewodali Damasegese saabe amofea dibia malesi, nafea meso. Auba mesi, na Damasegese daalumo, sigidubulu idele inolo amone dofaeyone daalu. Ili amo dofafia, nahe ili falasisia, naga namenesi Yelusalame iwi luba dibia obegeba miyone hilisefia daalu.”<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo ehe e keliso inolo alolu amone awalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:3-19">Hilibaisi Daalu 9.3-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26.12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />Folohe sulu no gegoaba eweguba awaba solu. “Na daaba labeofia, halo dogo amoguba adesi, na Damasegese hagoaleba ami goasia, bosolufalumo, yane bule uleno <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> huga inigia, nafea koleba neeba doweso. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Auba ausi, na hele saabia ami gelebaifia ligia, na dobelesia, inolo uleno mofeo nafea eweguba selesi dubulu. ‘Solo-ooo, Solo-ooo, ga Na woba ofelesego, enesi ause?’<verse eid="ACT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Auba selesi, na selesia, ‘<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, ga abe?’ Ausi, e selesia, ‘Na Nasaledene Yesu. Inolo, gahe woba moloyosia asigafe, amo Na.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Ausi, inolo na galiba milibailu ili amoda yane besabeo. Auluso, inolo nafea sulu selefe amo, ili dobelesale. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Ausi, na selesia, ‘Saminilo, aga na eneba moloyobi?’ Auba selesi, Saminilohe nafea selesia, ‘Ga degefia, Damasegese sidi usu suga malaba’ seleso. ‘Ga ami labi, inolo ulenohe ga labea inigia, dabalu sunia Nahe gafea iminiba ufulu amone, gafea saeyobafeba’ seleso. <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Ausi, yane <char style="w">elalelu</char> amo ne si koleba kalaba dafalugulu, inolo na galiba alebailu ili amohe, ne sone gasiba sefia, ilihe na Damasegese ami lubia aaso.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />Na ami labi, inolo uleno ene wi Ananiase na labea saabeo. E Gode sisa ligia, sulu <char style="w" lemma="Muguli">mugulimo</char> nafuluba kuliba ano. <char style="w">Yuda</char> idele inolo Damasegese kakainabu ili suniahe, e-mo inolo nafuluba sodo. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />E inigia, na aniba yoba ligia, selesia, ‘Nelewo Solo, ge si ogo saabia nafulu bebelema!’ Fogo hamagi koleba, ne simo, haiba nafulusi, na e abulu. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Ausi, Ananiasehe nafea selesia, ‘Nine nauwadaline Gode amo Ehe, ga iminiba ofasia, ga Ene hame amone asigimesineda, ga Isolu Inolo amone bamesineda, Ene mofeofia sulu selefemo domesineda, Ehe ga gadefalu. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Gahe idele inolo suniafea, ga dubuluda, ga abuluda, amone saeyobafe. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Aulugulu, ga eneyone yasifia ele? Ga degefia, <char style="w" lemma="Hano gelo">hano gema</char>! Gahe Ene wi selesimo, Ehe ge <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolu</char> sunia hamasia heesia galiyobafe.’ Inolo Ananiase nafea auba seleso.”<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Godehe Folomo yau mosomufea sulu saaba memesi hilibailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />Folohe idele inolofea saabia selesia, “Aufia, dufia na Yelusalame iwi obegeba milifasia, <char style="w">sebele molo</char> usu Godedai sulu selaba ligia, halaga bologuba bisigia, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:29-30">HD 9.29-30</ref></char></note>na Saminilo abulu. E nafea selesia, ‘Degema! Ogoba sisiba, Yelusalame afasia, malaba’ seleso. ‘Enebamo, gahe mosomu ewefea Na mololu amone sulu selesenaga, ili diba diyobafaleba’ seleso.<verse eid="ACT 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22.19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">HD 8.3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:9-11">26.9-11</ref></char>
    </note>Auba selesi, na selesia, ‘Saminilo, ine ili hilisebu, samini nahe <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usu sunia suga daafia, idele inolo gafea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumo</char> dibolo dafalibagofasia, na ili efolo fegoba ado alolu. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:1">HD 8.1</ref></char></note>Aufia, fogo ilihe inolo Sidifene Ge sulu manada sodomo dufelefeyamo, nada ili aniba ami alolune, na bisigiamo, ili mololu amo nafulububa abulu. Amosuale, nahe Sidifeneda dufulu ine fagulo selale huba walelumone yasiba alolu.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:15">HD 9.15</ref></char></note>Na auba selesi, Saminilo nafea eweguba seleso. ‘Ga mala. Nahe ga <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> noolo hago kakainabia ami hilibaiyobasu.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe yobolo inolo ilifea selesia, e Lome inolo loluba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Idele inolo wamili ilihe Folo yau idele inolomone saaba sulu selesi dubulumo, ilihe e sulu selefemo saabia dubiyo habolu. Ausi, ilihe koleba wuaaba selesia, “Dufa olama! Inolo ogogulumo helefealu iwi melesiale. E mesesiale!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Ilihe koleba wuaaba yaasia, ine fagulo hufasia, balualesi, sao analo felalu. Auba mololumo, Folo sulu solumo ili koleba hamebualesia walelu. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Auba ausi, yobolone saminilomohe idele inolo Folofea wuaaba yaafe amone maumo, nafuluba fadaba dubiyo hiliselugulu, ehe yobolo inolo noolofea selesia, “Folo ogo yobolo molosu luba dibia hugama. Aufasia, e fegosia, e wolu mololu ogone mau efea domaleba” solu. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:37">HD 16.37</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, ilihe <char style="w">Folo</char> fegomesine ene sone aida ifea dofaba lagosi, Folohe yobolone yasilo ami yoba alolu amofea selesia, “Na Lome sidine wida solu inolo lolu. Lomene muguli elo alefasia, gahe godo dobale ligia, Lome inolo balu fegolale.”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Yobolone yasilomohe sulu amo dofasia, ehe ene saminilomofea auba saaba mefia selesia, “Ga aga eneba moloyo? Inolo ogomo, e Lome wida solu inolobubasi.” <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Auba selesi, yobolone saminilo amo e Folo labea milifasia, selesia, “Gahe nafea saama. Ga Lome wida solu inolola?” Auba selesi, Folohe “Eeba” solu. <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Auba selesi, saminilo amo selesia, “Nahe Lome inolo wida loluba miliyone, mole bule elegefasia, beba gelelu dulu lolu.” Auba selesi, Folo selesia, “Na auba auluale. Ne nao Lomene beba gelelu amo selugulu, ne nae na Lome wida inologulu seba dulune, na Lome inolo lolu.” <verse eid="ACT 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:38">HD 16.38</ref></char></note>Yobolo inolo eda fegoyone alebailu ili amo, e sulu selefe amo dobelesia, ili alebale sagilisia ami afolu. Ausi, yobolone saminilo amohe Folomo Lome wida inolobuba eloba bisigiamo, e Folomo seini dofamaleba solumone eda sagililu.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Yudane galisolo inolo ilifea sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Yobolone saminilomohe, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo ilihe enesi <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folofea</char> oloba koweba mololubiba nafuluba dubiyo hiliselu. Ausi, adigi keafa ami, ehe Folo seini dofalumo sububa damafia, ehe <char style="w">soba melo guni</char> inolofeada, aufia Yudane galisolo inolo suniafeada, ili gagaiyomesi sulu sabailu. Ili gagaiyofia, ehe Folo yobolo molo afasia, luba dibia suga milifasia, ine si saabia degeba melalu.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Ausi, Folo e galisolo inolo si saabia degeba ligia, ehe ili si galiba sidasia, selesia, “Nelewodali, Na Godene si saabia siba lolu ewemo, mana na molosu ewemo, ne libo isolu mololabia inigia, agada molosu. Na wolu uleno mololuba asigisuale.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:22-23">Yon 18.22-23</ref></char></note>E auba selesi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> Ananiasehe inolo noolo e aniba alolu amofea selesia, “Folone mofe fadamaba” solu. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:27">Mad 23.27</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Folohe efea selesia, “Godehe gada mofe fadaeyobafe! Masega gegelo inolo, ga koleba! Mosesene sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> alefasia, gahe na osolaeyone iwi mulu yoba sabe. Auluso, gene gahe sulu muguli amo gelefebu. Enebamo, gahe ilifea na dumaba selefe ogohe sulu muguli gelefebu.” Folohe auba solu.<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Inolo ami aniba alebailu ili amo, Folo auba selefe dofasia, ilihe Folofea selesia, “Gahe Godene soba melone guni inolo amofea auba woba saeyone sagilifalela?” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:28">Kis 22.28</ref></char></note>Auba selesi, Folo obegeba selesia, “Nelewodali, inolo ogo soba melone guni inolo labebuba na eloba abuluale. Na eloba abulubiaga, na auba sabaiyale. Enebamo, Godene bugo usu sulu eweguba selelu dobu. ‘Gilihe gine guni inolo ulenofea sulu wolu sodale.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 26:5">HD 26.5</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Aufia, Folohe bisigia, galisolo inolo noolomo ili <char style="w">Sadiyusi</char> mosomu inolo alebaibi, noolomo <char style="w">Falisi</char> mosomu inolo alebaibuba bisigia, e mofe koleba selesia, “Nelewodali, na Falisi mosomu inolone faibegulu, nene nada Falisi inolo lolu. Na eweguba asigi ule dobu, inolo olalumo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeyobafeba</char> selesi, mau amohe ili aga na godofe.” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Folohe sulu auba selesi, Falisi mosomudai Sadiyusi mosomudai aleba ami, sulu hegeba yaasia, gagaiyolumo osolalu. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:23">Mad 22.23</ref></char></note>Sadiyusi ilihe inolo olalumo haiba degelaleba sodo. Aufia ili asigisia, <char style="w" lemma="Godene sulu dia ano">Godene sulu dia anoda</char>, asubaneda labaleba asigilo. Auluso, Falisi ilihe kegele sunia amone asigi ule ofolo.<verse eid="ACT 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Ausi, ilihe koleba wuaaba yaaba labi, Falisi mosomune <char style="w" lemma="Muguli manane dawalolu inolo">muguli mana dawalolu inolo</char> noolo, ili degefia koleba selesia, “Ninihe inolo ewefea heleba daalu dobi bosoluale.” Aufia, ili selesia, “No e seale sodosi, asubane ulenomobile, me Godene sulu dia ano uleno efea saaba melubile?” <verse eid="ACT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Ausi, yobolone saminilomohe sulu hegefemo bulefe baafia, e sagilisia, mosomu aidamohe Folone domalamo isasigisia, ene bado gegelesia, e olalosiba hiliselu. Ausi, ehe yobolo inolo noolofea selesia, “Gili suga daafia, Folo Yudane sone saabia ilogo dia daafia, yobolone molo usu lubia sugamaleba” solu.<verse eid="ACT 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.11 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 27:24">HD 27.24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 28:16">28.16</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 28:23">23</ref></char>
    </note>Aufia, nigiliba amoyamo ami, <char style="w">Saminilo</char> E Folo aniba ami yoba ligia selesia, “Ga kiwigaafia melale. Ga sagilimabiyo. Gahe Ne sulu Yelusalame ami solu hamagubasu, Lome sidi amida aubasu saeyobafe.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda ilihe Folo dufa olaeyone sulu muguba daiyalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Adigi keafa ami, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo noolo ili guni gagafia, <char style="w">Folo</char> dufa olaeyo daiyalu. Ilihe moloyoba kiwigaaba seale kolebaba saaba ofelesia, ninihe Folo dufa olaeyolu. Aufia, e aso dufa olabale ligiamo, ninihe naiyoda hanoda aiyayoba daiyalu. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Inolo ili sulu amone kiwigaaba saaba daiyaba ufulu amone alegalumo daabuluba biniba (40) amo sunialu. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Inolo ili amohe <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, asidalu nooloda, kakainabia ami daafia selesia, “Ninihe kiwigaaba sulu eweguba daiyaba ufulu. Nini <char style="w" lemma="Aiiba sodo">aiiba safasia</char>, naiyoda aiyafia ligia, Folo dufa olasi eloyo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:3">HD 25.3</ref></char></note>Aulugulu, gilida, galisolo inolo ilida, gilihe yobolone saminilomofea sulu eweguba sabaisiamo, ehe Folo luba sefia inigia, gili labea suga milalemale. Gilihe e gegesia eweguba saamale. ‘Ninihe Folone sulu mau noolomo nafuluba isaeyo hilisefemeba’ saamale. Auba molosimo, nini madenefia yasifia lolugulu, e inigia aso gili labea goabale labi, ninihe e dufa olaeyobasu.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Auluso, Folone enebabo amo ehe, ili moloyo daiyaba ofelefemo sulu gi dubulu. Ausi, ehe yobolo inolone molo usu suga daafia, Folofea saaba melu. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Aufia, Folohe yobolone yasilo uleno milafia, efea selesia, “Faibe fisamili ewemo yobolone saminilo labea ulubia mala. Ehe sulu uleno efea saaba meyone sebu.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Auba selesi, yasilomohe faibemo lubia, yobolone saminilo labea goafia selesia, “Dibolo inolo Folohe na milafia, nafea selesia, faibe fisamili ewe ga labea lubia malaleso. Ehe sulu uleno gafea saaba meyone sebuba seleso.” <verse eid="ACT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Ausi, saminilo amohe faibe amone sone gasifia e anibalo lubia daalu. Aalibisu ligia, ehe doba bisigia selesia, “Gahe sulu nafea amenegulu saeyo sebu?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Auba doba besabi, faibemo selesia, “Yuda inolo noolohe eweguba daiyaba samodofia labeo. Ilihe gafea eweguba doba babiyobafe. Folomo aide saabia no galisolo alebaibia malesine, gahe e hilibaimaleyobileba saeyobafe. Ilihe ene sulu maumone isaeyone hamefesia, gafea auba gegeba saeyobafe. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Auluso, gahe ine sulu amo kuliba malabiyo. Inolo daabuluba biniba amoguba suniafia, Folo yasisia gele dobu. Ili amo naiyoda hanoda aiyafia ligia, Folo dufa olasi eloyobafe. Aulugulu, agamo ilihe ga Folo aide ami hilibaiyone eefelaba yasiba labe.” <verse eid="ACT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Auba selesi, yobolone saminilomohe faibe fisamilimo ulubia malasia, haguguba koleba selesia, “Inolo ulenofea sulu ewe gahe nafea saaba meluba samabiyo.”<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilihe Folomo gafena Feligisi labea mebailu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Aufia, yobolone saminilo amohe, yasilo aidamo wefia, aalufea selesia, “Aalihe yobolo inolo fula aida (200) dimale. Aufia, hoso saabia asefia yobolo daabuluba domoba (70) dimale. Aufia, goge selu inolo fula aida (200) amoda dimale. Aufia, gilimo kegele sunia madeneba difasia, nigiliba halosi agofolo ami, Sisalia ami malale. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Hoso uleno, <char style="w">Folo</char> amo saabia asefia malesine, madenemale. Aufia, gilihe e nafuluba ulubia abia, Gafena Feligisi labea lubia goayone malale.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Auba saafia, yobolone saminilohe sowi uleno eweguba selelu.<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="pmo">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />Na Kolodiusu Lisiase,</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 23:26">Nahe sowi ewe Gafena Feligisi wabialelo gafea seleba mesu.</para>
  <para style="pmo" vid="ACT 23:26">Gafea geide nafulu kolebaba selesu.<verse eid="ACT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="pm">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23.27 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 21:30-33">HD 21.30-33</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:25-27">22.25-27</ref></char>
    </note>Inolo na aga gafea mebaisu ewemo, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo ilihe e sefasia, e dufa olaeyo weiyaalume. Auluso, na dobelesia e Lome wida solu inoloba solu dofasia, nada, ne yobolo inolo nooloda, ninihe e Yudane sone saabia labi, luba dulume. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 22:30">HD 22.30</ref></char></note>Nahe inolo ewefea ili oloba koweba sulu selefemone mau asigiyo hilisefia, e ine galisolo inolo labea lubia hugalume. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Na ilifea doba besabi, ilihe ine <char style="w">muguli</char> mana noolo nafea safasia, muguli mana amone efea egedidiba oloba koweba seleso. Auluso, na bisigia, ili oloba koweba sulu solu amo, kegele uleno e dufa olaeyoba, me dibolo dafogoyoba male abulume. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:16-23">HD 23.16-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 24:1-9">24.1-9</ref></char></note>Ausi, agamo ilihe inolo ewe dufa olaeyoba sulu muguba daiyaba ufulu dobuba solumo, na dubulume. Ausi, nahe e-mo alebale ga labea malasugo. Aufia, efea oloba koweba selefe ilida ine saeyoguba gene olegia saamesi gadefasume.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ACT 23:30" />
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 23:30">Yobolone saminilohe sowi auba seleba ofasia, gafena Feligisifea mebailu.<verse eid="ACT 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Ausi, yobolo inolo ilihe molomalelu sulu kuliba abia, nigiliba amoyamo Folo uluba difasia, e lubia abia, Adifadilisi dauno ami goalu. <verse eid="ACT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Adigi keafa ami, hoso saabia asefia yobolo inolo ili amosuhe, Folo lubia Sisalia sidi ami goalu. Ausi, yobolo inolo noolomo ine yobolo inolo moloa Yelusalame obegeba daalu. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Aufia, hoso saabia asefia yobolo inolo ili amo abia, Sisalia ami goafia, ilihe sowi selelumo gafenafea mesia, ilihe Foloda lubia inigia, ene si saabia yoba melalu. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Gafenahe sowi selelumo alegafia, Folofea doba bisigia, “Ga hele wagifia?” Auba selesi, Folo selesia, “Na Silisiafia.” <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />Aufia, gafena selesia, “Inolo gafea sulu oloba koweba solu ili amo iwi goasihe, na ge godomo dubiyo.” Aufia, ehe Folomo <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[1]], Buleba sodo e">Helodo</char> gamanene dibolo molo usu ami gadefafia yasiba melalelu. <figure style="fig" alt="Soldiers escort Paul at night" file="IB04214.TIF" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="23.23-33">Yobolo inolo ilihe Folo nigiliba ulubia aafe.</figure><verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Gafena Feligisihe Folone godomo mau isalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Hilia bia alefasia labi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> Ananiaseda, asidalu nooloda, aufia godo dobolo inolo uleno, ene wi Dedulusu, ili e galiba Sisalia ami huga milibailu. Aufia, ilihe gafenamofea <char style="w">Folo</char> godoyo solu amone mau saaba melu. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Aufia, Folomo wesi, e milibia labi, Dedulusu amohe Feligisifea godoyone sulu eweguba maugaba solu. “Inolo wabialelo Feligisi ga, nini ga sisa ligia, onaba fogo selale asulu amone henesu. Ge asigi nafulu ogohe, hele ewe yasiyone dedegeba dibia holobagalu. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Ninihe kegele amo bisigia, hilia sunia nine asigi henebasu adone, gafea henelu sulu selesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Aulugulu, nahe ga saabia boneba ofolosi. Gahe nini heneba ofelesia, fogo wedino domaleyobile? <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:6">HD 17.6</ref></char></note>Nini bisigia, inolo ogo e-mo wolu wedinale molosi bosolu. <char style="w">Yuda</char> idele inolo alebada, helefealu suniada, ehe gadiba belaguba ofolo. Aufia, Nasaledene gulugululo osolalu amone yasilo nomo, e. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6-8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6-8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.6-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:28-30">HD 21.28-30</ref></char></note>Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molomoda</char> nugumaeyo weiyaasi, nini e selu. Aulugulu, gene gahe inolo ogofea doba bisigia, ga ninihe efea oloba koweba selesu ewenemo, sealebuba asigiyobafe.” <verse eid="ACT 24:6-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Godo dobolo Dedulusu amo auba selesi, Yuda ilida oloba koweba sulu auba solumo kulisia selesia, “Sulu solu ewe sunia seale.”<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Feligisifea ene meleba subuyo sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Ausi, gafenamohe <char style="w">Folo</char> sulu samesi sone binibo gaasi, Folo eweguba solu. “Na asigibu, hamu wedinalemo ga hele ewene osolalo inolo alolu. Aulugulu, nahe nene meleba subuyo sulu gafea saeyo amone, na henesu. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Ga fadaba besenaga, amo ga eweguba baaba goleyobafe. Na Yelusalame guluguluyone goalumo, hilia huguluba amo sunialuale dobu. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Aufia, nafea aga oloba koweba sodo ilihe, na <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele molone</char> yala usu ami inolo ulenodai sulu hegeba labi abuluale. Aufia, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> usuda, Yelusalame sidi yalalu usuda, na idele inolo asigi degeba ofelesi, ili abuluale. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Aga ilihe ine oloba koweba sulu solumohe, sealeba saeyomone, gafea gaduba saeyomo male.<verse eid="ACT 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Auluso, sulu seale amo eweguba. Eno na kuliba ano amo, ilihe heleba lubia ano enoba sodo. Auluso, na Eno ewene kuliba daaba ligia, nine nauwadaline Gode amofea aso guluguluba lolu. <char style="w">Muguli</char> sulu selelu dobu suniada, <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> ili sulu selelu dobu suniada, amofea na <char style="w">asigi ule ufulu</char> dobu. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:28-29">Yon 5.28-29</ref></char></note> Inolo ili iwi kakainabu ewe asigibu amogubasu, nada asigi ule ofelesia, Godehe daneba yaalu idele inolo ili suniamo, woludalida, nafuludalida, <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba</char> yaeyobafeba asigifia yasibu. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Aulugulu, hilia sunia, kegele suniafealomo, na-mo, Godene si saabiada, idele inolone si saabiada, ne <char style="w">asigi nafulune si</char> sawaba labi, heleba moloyaleba miliyone dedeba ado.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />Na hamu noolomo hele nolobalo alefasia, dufia na Yelusalame iwi obegeba mulu. Nahe mole kegeleda dia mulumo, weaguba yaalu alebaibu ili sagoba ufiyone dia mulu. Aufia, nahe sebele molo usu Godefea soba meyone hilisesia mulu. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 21:17-28">HD 21.17-28</ref></char></note>Na sebele molo usu galagoloba ufulu ligia, auba soba meba labi, ili na besabeo. Ili na besabi fogo ami, inolo wamili na galiba aloluale. Aufia, gala dafa adefea ami, na aloluale. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Auluso, <char style="w">Yuda</char> inolo noolo hele Asiafia milibailu ili amohe na ami seso. Aulugulu, inolo ili amo sulu nafea saeyo dobunaga, amo ine ili ge olegia iwi milifasia ligia, na godoyodolu dobu. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Auba aulualenaga, inolo aga iwi labe ili ewehe, na ine galisolo moloa yoba ligia, heleba uleno molosi abulunaga, ilihe gafea saaba memesi. <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">HD 23.6</ref></char></note>Na hilisesia, na ili aleba ami degeba yoba ligia, sulu ule solu amohe, ili heneba dobelesale. Sulu amomo eweguba. ‘Na asigi ule ofelesumo, inolo ili danelu amo haiba degeba yaeyobafeba solu mau amohe, gili aga na godofe.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24.22 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 23:26">HD 23.26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Folohe sulu auba saaba samodofia labi, Feligisihe, Eno amone fadaba asigilumo, godo dobolaba alolumo kaalu. E selesia, “Yobolone saminilo Lisiase e iwi goafia labi, nahe gine godo ewemo isoyo.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Aufia, ehe yasilo ulenofea selesia, “Folo ogo dibolo dafogofia, ene damene noolomohe e sagoba ofelesia, naiyoda, kegeleda, meyomo kaamabiyoba” solu.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo hamu aida dibolo dafogofia alolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Hilia noolo daafia labi, Feligisi e ene eamono Dulusiladai, <char style="w">Folo</char> labea babiyone mulu. Dulusila e, <char style="w">Yuda</char> mosomu ido. Aufia, Feligisihe yobolo inolofea Folo dia milalefasia, ehe efea sulu noolo dubulu. Folohe efea Yesu <char style="w" lemma="Keliso">Kelisofea</char> <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufiyo</char> mana amone saaba melu. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Folohe sulu mana walesiamo, isolu mana moloyo amoneda, inolohe ene miliyolu nafuluba ene meleba yasiyo mana amoneda, aufia Godehe nini osolaeyobafe amoneda walelu. Auba waleba labi, Feligisihe sagilifia selesia, “Aga amo isobu. Ga mala. Dufia, na fogo ofelesenaga, na ga saabia milaba weyo.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Aufia, Feligisihe kegele ulenoda yasiba alolu. E hilisesia, Folohe mole noolo efea e sububa dafogomesifia meyobafeba hiliselu. Ausiane, ehe hilia wedinale Folo milalemalefia, e galiba sulu selaba ado. <verse eid="ACT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Hamu aida auba daafia labi, Fosiusu Fesedusuhe gafena Feligisimo alibialu. Ausi, Feligisi afa abiamo, ehe Yuda ilimo henemesine molosia, Folomo dibolo aso waagi melesi gadefalu.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Gafena Fesedusuhe Folone godomo mau isalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Gafena Fesedusu e hele ami hili goafia, hilia osoloa alefasia, e Sisalia sidi afasia, Yelusalame lago maiyo daalu. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:1">HD 24.1</ref></char></note>E ami goafia labi, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inoloda</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> guni inoloda, e labea milibaifia, <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folomo</char> godoyo amone mau ilihe e isoba domesine saaba melu. <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:15">HD 23.15</ref></char></note>Ili selesia, “Gahe nini sagoba ofelesia, inolo ogo Yelusalame mebaimaleyobileba” solu. Ili auba solu maumo, ilihe Folo dufa olaeyone eno kia gele ufiyone muguba daiyaba ufia alolu. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Auluso, Fesedusuhe obegeba selesia, “Folomo Sisalia iligi dibolo labe. Fogo wedino alefasia, nene nada iligi maiyobasu. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Aulugulu, gine guni inolodalida, nadai iligi huga maiyoba. Aufia, inolo ilogohe wolu mololunaga, amo guni inolo ilihe iligi ligia, e godofia fadaba samesi.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fesedusu e hilia aaiyobabile me daabulubabile ami alefasia, e Sisalia huga daalu. Aufia, adigi keafa ami, ehe godo dubiyone weba gagaiyosia, Folo milamaba solu. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:5-6">HD 24.5-6</ref></char></note>Folo milibia labi, Yuda inolo Yelusalamefia huga milibailu ili amo, e aniba amaleba galiba yoba alebaifia, efea sulu noolo woba oloba koweba solu. Ili selesia, “E-mo mana wolu nokene nokeneba mololuba” solu. Auluso, ilihe Fesedusufea sulu ili solumo seale soluba gaduba saeyodoluale alolu.<verse eid="ACT 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Ili safasia labi, Folo ene meleba subuyo sulu eweguba solu. “Na heleba uleno mololuale. Nahe Yudane sulu <char style="w">muguli</char> geleluale. Aufia, nahe <char style="w">sebele molo</char> usu ami wolu uleno mololuale. Aufia, nahe <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisafea</char> wolu uleno mololuale.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Auba selesi, Fesedusuhe Yuda ili henemesine hamefia, ehe Folofea doba bisigia, “Ga Yelusalame lagi godoyo maiyone hilisefela? Ausenaga, nahe ge godo ogo Yelusalame lago ligia dubiyoba.” <verse eid="ACT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Auluso, Folo selesia, “Molo nada aga yoba lolu ewe, Sisane godolo molo. Molo ewehe ne godo dubiyo helemo ewe. Ga asigibu, nahe Yuda ilifea wolu uleno mololuale. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />Seale, na olaeyodolu heleba uleno mololunaga, amo na waagi dufa olamale. Auluso, sulu ili na godofe amo sealealenaga, amo gahe ili henemesisia na-mo ine sone saabia ofelesenaga, amo isoluale. Nahe Sisa ene ehe ne godo domesi hamefe.” <verse eid="ACT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Auba selesi, Fesedusuhe inolo efea asigi melomo ili galiba sulu nenefasia, e Folofea selesia, “Ga selesia, Sisahe ge godo domesi hamefeba selesomo, amo ga Sisa labea malale.”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fesedusuhe Folone godo amone Agilibane kinifea doba abulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Hilia noolo dafasia labi, kini <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[4]], Agiliba 2">Agilibadai</char>, ene enano Benaisidai, aaluhe Fesedusu labea sobele inigia, Sisalia ami mulu. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:27">HD 24.27</ref></char></note>Aalu hilia wedinale Sisalia ami labi, Fesedusuhe <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folone</char> godoyone maumo kinifea saaba mesia selesia, “Inolo uleno iwi labe amo, e samini Feligisihe dibolo dafogolu, amo e aso dibolo waagi labe. <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />Na Yelusalame labi fogomohe, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilida, <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> guni inolo ilida, Folomo godoyo amone mau na isoba domesisia, nafea doba babiyo milibaiso. Ili na eweguba samesi hamelumo, ehe heleba mololu dobune, nahe e osolaba damesiba hameso.<verse eid="ACT 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Auluso, nahe ine sulu obegeba selesia, ‘Nini Lomehe inolo ulenofea mau dobale balu osolaba dafolale. Inolo godoyo dobu amo ehe, inolo eda godoyo weiyaafemone si saabia kalugaeyo dobu. Aulugulu, ninihe efea kegele eda godoyo weiyaafe amone, ene meleba subuyone sulu obegemesi, efea fogo meyo dobu.’ <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Auba safasia, na Sisalia obegeba saabi, inolo ili amoda nadai milibaiso. Nahe ili amo yasimesi mololualegulu, adigi keafa ami na godolo moloa yoba sigia, na inolo amo lubia milamaba solu.<verse eid="ACT 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Ausi, inolo eda godoyo ilimo degeso. Na hilisesia, ilihe e-mo mana wolu mololuba saeyobafebuba hiliseluso, aubalebiyo. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Ilihe ine gulugululo mana amoda, inolo uleno olalumo, ene wi Yesu, amone saabiada, edai hegeso. Auluso, Folo selesia, olalu inolo amo bebea labeba koleba seleso. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Nahe sulu ewene maumo isaeyo hamefeso, ne asigi sawafalegulu, na lililuale alolu. Aulugulu, na efea doba abulu. ‘Ga Yelusalame maiyo hamefela? Nahe ge godo ogo Yelusalame lagi godomesi hamefela?’ <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Auluso, Folo selesia, ‘Yelusalame lagi maiyale, <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisahe</char> ne godo domesi hamefeba’ seleso. Auba selesi, nahe e dibolo waagi melalefia, e Sisafea mebaiyone eno isaba lolu.” Fesudusu auba solu.<verse eid="ACT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agiliba sulu amo dofasia, ehe Fesedusufea selesia, “Nene na inolo ogone sulu dubiyo hamefe.” Ausi, Fesedusu selesia, “Aide ga ene sulu domesi.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Aufia, adigi keafa ami, Agilibadai, ene enano Benaisidai, aalu wabialelone momada kakafasia mulu. Aaluda, yasilo sodolo nooloda, sidi amone guni inoloda, ili gagaiyolo molo usu sugasi, Fesedusuhe Folo lubia milamaba selesi, e mulu. <verse eid="ACT 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Aufia, Fesedusu selesia, “Kini Agiliba, gada, inolo noolo sunia nini galiba labe gilida, inolo ewe bama. Yuda mosomu idele inolo sunia Yelusalame ami alebaibuda, Sisalia iwi alebaibuda, ilihe sulu inolo ewefea oloba koweba solu. Ilihe nafea koleba eweguba seleso. ‘E waagi melesiale, dufa olamaba’ wuaaba seleso. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Auluso, na bisigia, e dufa olaeyone kegele uleno mololumo, na abuluale. Auluso, e hilisesia, Sisahe ene godomo domesiba hamesi, nahe e Sisa labea mebaiyone saaba ufulu. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Auluso, nahe nine wabialelo kini Sisafea inolo ewene saaba sulu halagulu, sowi selefia mebaiyone, na aso sawaba asigiluale lolu. Aulune, na inolo ewe gili suniane olegia iwi lubia milalu. Kini Agiliba, ge olegia koleba e lubia mulu. Enebamo, ninihe ene sulu nafuluba isaba bafasia, nahe kegele noolo sowi amo seleyone diyobasu. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Maumo, na hilisesia, dibolo inolo uleno Sisafea mebaisia, nahe sulu nafuluba fadaba sabaisalenaga, amo mana amo isolualebuba” hilisesu.<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Agilibane olegia Folohe sulu solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[4]], Agiliba 2">Agilibahe</char> <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folofea</char> selesia, “Ga sulu gene samesi fogo mesu.” Auba selesi, Folohe ene sone digiba lagofia, ehe sulu eweguba solu. <verse eid="ACT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Kini Agiliba, <char style="w">Yuda</char> ilihe nafea sulu oloba koweba selefe ogonemo, aga na ge olegia degefia ligia, nene meleba subuyo sulu ilifea obegeba saeyobasu ewemo, nafulu koleba. <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />Nini Yudane mana noolomoda, aufia kegele noolo ninihe sulu hegeba sodo amoda, ga fadaba hiliseba yaabu. Aulugulu, ga esebalo yoba sigia, ne sulu sunia nafuluba domesi hamesu.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />Yuda ili suniahe na fadaba bolo labe. Na aso nene helea faibe wedino aloiya amifia maugafia inigia, Yelusalame lagi alolu amone mana na mololu amo, ili asigibu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHP 3:5-6">Fil 3.5-6</ref></char></note>Ilihe na-mo samini waagifia asigilu labegulu, ili auba hamesiabiaga, ilihe na <char style="w">Falisi</char> inolo alolu amo gafea sealeba saaba mebaiyo. Falisine muguli sulu uleno afelesiale, na ine manamo gedeba dafa kuliba ano amoda, ilihe gafea sealeba saaba mebaiyo. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">HD 23.6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 28:20">28.20</ref></char></note>Aga ili na godofe amone maumo ewe, Godehe nine nauwadalifea oloba huliane sulu saaba ufulu amone, na asigi ule ofasia yasiba lolu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Nine mosomu hugulubamo ilihe, yaidada, nigilibada, Godefea guluguluba ligia, saaba ufulu sulu amo wakaliba hugamesifia, <char style="w" lemma="Hame diba ofogosia yasiyo">hame diba ofogofia yasifiasu</char> alebaibu. Ausi, kini, nada kegele amofea asigi ule ofasia, hame diba ofogofia yasifia lolu. Yasifia lolu hamagane, Yuda ilihe aga nafea oloba koweba selefe. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Godehe danelu inolo <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeba ifoyobafe</char> amo, asigiyodoluale kegele dobububa hilisefe amo, gilihe mau enesi ause?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26.9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">HD 8.3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Samini nada Nasaledene Yesune wimo dufa dafogoyone kegele sunia moloyodolu dobububa hiliseba ado. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Aufia, nahe Yelusalame ami auba moloba ado. Nahe <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> ilifea eelu sulu difasia, <char style="w" lemma="Godedai muuba kalilu idele inolo">Saminilone idele inolo</char> wedinale dibolo dafalibagoba ado. Aufia, yasilo ilihe ili dufa olamesiba sone digisimo, nada sone digiba ado. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Hilia wedinale na <char style="w" lemma="Yudane gulugululo molo">gulugululo molo</char> no, molo noba suga daafia, ili sefia, ilifea mana meba yaaba ado. Nahe ili Saminilofea faiso mefia, Efea soaneba saamalesia, na auba kiwigaaba moloba ado. Nahe ilifea kanolu bule amonesu wasigafia, mosomu noolo hago kakainabu amida, ilifea mana meyone daaba ado.”<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe e keliso inolo alolumone awalu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:3-19">Hilibaisi Daalu 9.3-19</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22.6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />Folohe saabia selesia, “Aufia, <char style="w" lemma="Soba melo inolo">soba melone guni inolo</char> nafea eelu sulu mesia, Damasegese malasi, na ami maiyo daalu. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Aufia, kini Agiliba, ga doma. Na eno aiba daaba ligia, halo dogo amoguba adesi, nahe yane bule hebenefia neeba dowesi abulu. Yane amo nee bule alefasia, halone neemo wasolubiyo. Yane amo nada, inolo nadai dedaleba alolu ili amoda, ninifea neeba amaleba doweso. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Nini sunia hele saabia gelebaisafia ligia, na mofebu uleno <char style="w">Hibulu</char> suluba nafea selesi dobelesia, ‘Solo-ooo, Solo-ooo, ga Na woba ofelesego, enesi ause? Ga kegele minilu amofea dowesi, gene gafea naga mefe.’<verse eid="ACT 26:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Auba selesi, na selesia, ‘<char style="w">Saminilo</char>, Ga abe?’ Ausi, Saminilo selesia, ‘Na Yesu. Inolo, gahe woba moloyosia asigafe, amo Na. <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Auluso, ga aga degefia, kalugama. Na aga ga labea holobagalumo, Ne dabalu ga molomesi molobebelefia iminiba ufiyo mulu. Aufia, abulumoneda, aufia kegele noolo Na gafea waleyobasu amoneda, gahe idele inolofea saaba memesi, Nahe ga iminiba gadefaeyo mulu. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17-18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.17-18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:16">Ais 42.16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 2:2">Efe 2.2</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:13">Kol 1.13</ref></char></note>Ge idele inoloda, <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inoloda</char>, ga ine sone libo labi, Nahe ga sagoba ofelesia, obegeba diyobasu. Nahe ga ili labea hilibaisumo, gahe ine si fisigaba waalemesi hilibaisu. Aufia, gahe ili nigili gagalufealo labea amifia difasia, ili nolofasia, yanefealo diba homesineda, ili <char style="w" lemma="Sedene">Sedenene</char> kiwigagalu sisa labea amifia nolofasia, Godefealo diba homesineda, Nahe amone ga gadefalu. Ausi, Nahe ine <char style="w" lemma="Wolu / Wolu mololo">wolumo</char> galiba dafelesia, hamasia heeyobasu. Ausi, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulumofea</char> alefasia, ili Nadai <char style="w">muuba kalilu</char> miliyobafe. Aufia, Nadai muuba kalilu idele inolo sunia ine daalo ua osolaba diaba ligia, ilida ine hele fogo diyobafe.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 26:17-18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Agilibafea e misini dabalu mololu amone awaba melu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />Aufia, Folohe sulu no gegoaba selesia, “Aulugulu, kini <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[4]], Agiliba 2">Agiliba</char>, doma. Auba molomalelu sulu na yanene nee auba <char style="w" lemma="Hebene">hebenefia</char> nafea doweiya ami dubulu amo, na saidafuluale. Aubale. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Nahe Damasegese idele inolo ili amofeadale walefasia, dufia Yelusalame alebaibu ili amofeada, Yudia hele sunia amida, aufia <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolo</char> suniafeada, na Godene sulu mana walelu. Auba Godene sulu mana walesiamo, na selesia, ‘Gili <char style="w" lemma="Asigi besiyo">asigi besifia</char>, Godefea nolomale. Aufia, gine mana molofe ogofea alefasia, gili asigi besiluba walemaleba’ solu. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Na sulu auba selesi mau amohe, <char style="w">Yuda</char> ilihe na <char style="w" lemma="Sebele Molo">sebele moloa</char> sefasia, na dufa olaeyo weiyaaso. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Auluso, Godehe na sagoba ofelesi, na adabia inigia, aga iwi kalugaafia ligia, nahe inolo widafeada, widalefeada, imini ule aiba saaba meba lolu. <char style="w">Saaba ofolo</char> inolo ilida, <char style="w">Mosese</char> eda, samini sulu solu amonesu nada sodo. Sulu no na sodale. <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">26.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:44-47">Lug 24.44-47</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:20">1Kld 15.20</ref></char></note>Saaba ofolo ilida, Mosese eda, ili eweguba saaba ufulu. ‘<char style="w">Keliso</char> E naga diyodolu ufulu. Aufia, olalofealo amone Edale <char style="w" lemma="Haiba degelu - Haiba degeba ifolu">haiba degeyodolu</char> ufulu. Aufia, Ene idele inolofeada, yau idele inolofeada, yanefealo milesine saaba meyodolu ufuluba,’ ilihe samini saaba ufulu.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe Agiliba e asigi besimaleba solu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folohe</char> sulu auba selaba labi, Fesedusu e kaafia, koleba selesia, “Folo, ga asigi kagoafe! Ga dawalolu bule dulu ogohe, ga kagoaba ufulubu.” <verse eid="ACT 26:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Auba selesi, Folo selesia, “Wabialelo Fesedusu, na asigi kagoabuale. Aubale. Na asigida ligia, sulu seale amone selesu. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Kini Agiliba, gahe kegele sunia nahe gafea solumo asigiba samodobu. Aulugulu, na gafea saeyomo sagilibale selesu. Na hilisefe, kegele amohe, gene sida, gene konenida, oloba halolualebu. Aubale. Kegele amo muguba dugia mololualegulu, gahe amo hiliseba samodoba yaalubu. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Kini <char style="w" lemma="Helodo[[4]], Agiliba 2">Agiliba</char>, gahe <char style="w">saaba ofolo</char> inolo ine sulufea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule ufulula</char>, me ufulualela? Na hilisesia, ga asigi ule ufulububa hilisesu.”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Folo auba selesi, Agilibahe efea doba bisigia, “Eneba? Fogo abobodeno ewe, gahe na <char style="w" lemma="Kelisone idele inolo">Kelisone inolo</char> melesi moloyo hilisesela?” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Auba selesi, Folo obegeba selesia, “Fogo abobonagada, me fogo selalenagada, na Godedai sulu eweguba selesu. Gada, aga ne sulu dobelefe ili eweda, gili sunia na waagulu melesiba selesu. Na waagulu adesiaso, seini na dofalu ewesu hamale.” <verse eid="ACT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Auba selesi, kinida, gafenada, Benaisida, inolo noolo ili galiba asulumoda, ili degefia, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />abia, molo hogolilu amo afa dedalelu. Aufia, ili ine geleba sulu eweguba selaba yaalu. “Inolo ogo dufa olaeyoda, dibolo dafogoyoda, heleba uleno moloba labalebu.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Ausi, Agilibahe Fesedusufea selesia, “Inolo ogo <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisahe</char> ene godo domesiba solualebiaga, amo gahe e sububa dafogomalebaiyo.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Ilihe Folo Lome sidi maiyone hano sibi mesalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Ilihe ninidali Idali helea ami malesiba daiyaba ofasia, ilihe <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Foloda</char>, dibolo inolo nooloda, yobolone yasilo ulenone sone saabia ufulu. Yasilo amone, ene wimo Yuliese, Sisa mosomune yobolo inolo ulenomo, e. <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">HD 19.29</ref></char></note>Hano sibi nini aseba lagolu amo, Adamidiumu amifia mulu ligia, Asia helea kalugaaba ada ami kalugaeyofia maiyone ufulu. Masedonia inolo Alisidakusu amo eda nini galiba aaso. E Desalonaika dauno amifia mulubiyo. <figure style="fig" alt="Folo e Lome sidi ami daalu" file="Paul's Fourth Journey.tif" size="span" loc="27.1" ref="27.1-28.14">Folo e Lome sidi ami daalu (27.1–28.14)</figure><verse eid="ACT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Adigi keafamo, nini Saidono ami goafia, kalugaafia labi, yobolo yasilo Yuliesehe mana nafulu Folofea molosia, e-mo ene damene moloa waagi sobele malesi fogo meso. Ausi, damene ilihe efea naiyo kegele nooloda meso. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Amifia, nini salu hano galulu saabia ofa lagofia, abia Saidono afasia, fufulohe nini doweyo weiyaasi, sibimo saidudu Saibulusu faisalo haguba maiyo daalu. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Aufia, nini hele Silisiada, hele Famifiliada, amone saiimo anibalo daalumo afasia, nini salu hano galulu segefia abia, hele Lisia, Maila dauno ami goalu. <verse eid="ACT 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Dauno ami, yobolone yasilo inolo amohe hano sibi uleno Idali helea maiyone dobi abulu. Hano sibi amo Alegesadilia amifia mulu ufulubiyo. Sibi amo bafasia, e nini hano sibi amo dobia lubia aaso. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Nini hano sibi amo asefia, esebalo esebaloba alebagolabia abia, hilia noolo daalumo, fufulo kolelumohe hano sibi doweso. Hano sibi dabalu mololo ili amo hogololu dabalu molofia, nini Nidiusu hagoaleba goalu. Auluso, fufulo nini kaasihe, nini nolofasia abia, saidudu Kilidi ami Salamone walaeyo ami goafasia, aufia nini saidudu amone nolobalo ami haguba daalu. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Sibi dabalu mololo ili amo dabalu hogoloba mololabia abia, nini Kilidine saii anibalo daalu. Aufia, nini hele uleno amone wimo Saii Fuwelu Yogoleluba soda ami goalu. Hele amo Lasea dauno aniba ami dobu.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Hilia noolo wedinale samodofia labi, Yuda ine <char style="w">naiyo aiyalo</char> iminilu hilia amoda suniaba aaso. Ausi, fufulo gi ama maugalubiyo. Salu hano galulu amo fufulo wobasubale fufulesihe, Folo ilifea haguguba selesia, <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Inolo gili doma. Na hilisefe, nini aga aasenaga, nini hilia wolu amo koleba besabi, kegele wedinale sibi ufulumoda daba dafaliyobafe. Kegeleda, hano sibida, amosuale. Aubale. Nine miliyoluda daba dafaliyobafe.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Folo auba selesoso, yobolone yasilo inolo amohe Folone sulu selefemo dobelesale. Aubale. Ehe hano sibida selo amoda, sibi amone enao amoda, aine asigi kuliba aaso. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Hele amo kenegia sibi haguba ufiyomo nafulualebiyo. Aulune, inolo wedinale hano sibi amo kakainalu ili amohe, hele amo gadefia maiyone sulu ule ofeleso. Ili amo isobunaga, ili abia, Finigisi dauno ami goafia, fufulo gi samodomesi ami yasiba miliyo maiyo hiliseso. Finigisi dauno ami hano sibida kalugaalo hele uleno dobubiyo. Sibida kalugaalo hele amo, saidudu Kilidi ami, halo sugalofealo amolo baaba ilogoba dobubiyo.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Fufulo bule dowesia, salu hano galulu fufulelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Afafafealo fufulo mulu amohe kiwigaafale baafia, ili hilisesia, nini nafulusu abia, hano sibida kalugaala ami nafuluba kalugaeyone maiyoba hiliseso. Ausi, ilihe sibida godailo efolomo fisigafasia, nini abia Kilidine saii anibalomo maiyone daalu. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Auba abia, bosolufalumo, mumugu kolelu uleno degeso. Mumugu amo ilihe halo holobagalofealo mumugu fufuloba sodo. Mumugu amo Kilidifealo mulu amohe, hano sibimo koleba iluwaso. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Hano sibi dabalu mololo ili amohe hano sibi amo nolofasia, obegeyo hamesabiyoso, ili auba moloyodoluale adesi, ili hano sibimo fufulo waagi dia daaba melesi gadefaso. <figure style="fig" alt="Ship in terrible storm" file="IB04217b.tif" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="27.14-20">Mogaifo bule inigia, hano sibi woba dafiyo weiyaafe.</figure> <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Nini saidudu wedino uleno Kaudaba sodomo haguba maiyo aasi, hano kasu wedinomo sigiba lagoyo hogololu adeso. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Ausi, dabalu mololo ilihe hano kasu amo sibi bule saabia ami sigiba lagofasia, amo koleba godaiba ofeleso. Aufia, hano sibi amo gaselelosi kolemesisia, ilihe efolo doganelu bule amo hano sibi sisalo ilogolo dafogofia, nolobalo sigiba lagofia, koleba godaiba waaleso. Aufia, ili Afilikafealo saidudu amo dowelosine, ili sagilisia, sibine balaimo uluba sesi, fufulohe hano sibi amo waagi dia malesi gadefaso. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Fufuloda, hano fufulefe amodahe, hano sibi amo koleba fufuleba dowesia fofagosi, adigi keafa ami, hano sibi dabalu mololo ilihe kegele noolo hano sibi selumo, salu hano galulu amone usu maugaba dafalibagoso.<verse eid="ACT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Hilia osolo adesi, hano sibi dabalu mololo ili keleba hilisefia, ilihe hano sibi amone balaida, efolomo, ida, sibine afafafealo dafaliba ilogoso. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Aufia, mumugu fufulo bulehe nini hilia sunia dowebasu labine, haloda, sigabida, nini abuluale. Auba ausi, nini nafulu misiyobasuba asigiluale. Aubale. Nini hilisesia, nini sunia afiyobasububa hiliselu.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Ili amo naiyoda nabale hilia wedinale labeofia, <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folomo</char> ili aleba ami degefia yoba ligia, selesia, “Inolo gili doma. Gilihe ne sulu kuliba abia, saidudu Kilidi afolualebiaga, nini hilia wolu ewe bisigiale, nine kegeleda daba dafalibaiyale. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Auluso, na aga gilifea gadaeaba mesaba selesumo, nine inolo uleno asigileyobafale. Hano sibi ewesu asigileyobafe. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Na Godene inolo lolugulu, na Efea gulugululo. Aulugulu, aga nigiliba ami <char style="w">Godene sulu dia ano</char> inolo uleno na aniba yoba miliyo saabeo. <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:11">HD 23.11</ref></char></note>Aufia, e selesia, ‘Folo, ga sagilimabiyo. Ga <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisane</char> olegia godoyone maiyo dobu. Aulugulu, doma, Godehe ga edai sulu solumo dubulune, inolo sunia aga gadai hano sibi kakainabu ogo, uleno daba dafiyobafaleba’ seleso. <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Godene sulu dia anohe auba nafea solugulu, inolo gili sagilimabu. Na Godefea <char style="w" lemma="Asigi ule ufulu">asigi ule dobumohe</char>, Gode kegele sunia nafea holobagaeyobafeba soluguba moloyobafe. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 28:1">HD 28.1</ref></char></note>Auluso, fufulohe hano sibimo waagi dia aasi, sibihe saidudu ulenomofea doweyobafe.” Folo auba seleso.<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Nini Adilia salu hano galulu saabia siba alolumo, hilia daabuluba ulefia biniba (14) adesi, nigili dogolea ami, hano sibi dabalu mololo ili amo bisigia, hano sibimo hele saabia goafebuba asigiso. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Ausi, ilihe salu hano galulu fadaba sugalulaba babiyone, ilihe iminilomo dafelagofasia, iminilumo daabuluba biniba (40) adesi besabeo. Auba adesi, hano sibimo aso wedino daafia, saabia iminilomo dafogosi, iminilu amone alegalumo daabuluba osoloa (30) alolubiyo.<verse eid="ACT 27:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Ili sagililu, maumo hano sibimo koleba abia, abaneda dobia ami dowefia, sunia gaseleba dafalilosiba hiliseso. Ausi, ilihe anka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Anka </char><char style="ft" closed="false">amomo, aeyene kegele, higinilu bule koleba. Ilihe efolo selale amofea godailo. Ilihe hano sibi kalugaamesi hilisesenaga, ili anka amo hano usu dafa ilogolo. Ausi, ankamo hanokiwi iligi diba ofelesi, higinilu amofea alefasia, hano sibi anale.</char></note> biniba amo hano sibi amone sosafealo haumofea godaiba yaafia dafaliba ilogoso. Aufasia, halo ogoba holobagamesisia, ilihe ine godefea sulu selaba yaaso. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Hano sibi dabalu mololo ilihe hano sibi amo afasia, saiifealo fisaba maiyone eno isasia, ili masega gegeba selesia, “Hano sibi amone mi hau amofea, anka noolomoda dafalibagoyoba” seleso. Auluso, ilihe hano kasu wedinomo efolo sefia, hano saabia fisigaba dafa ilogoso. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Ilihe kasu wedino auba fisigaba dafa ilogoba adesi, Folohe yasilomofeada yobolo inolo ilifeada selesia, “Inolo ili ogo aso hano sibi iwi aselesalenaga, amo gili siba dafaliyobafale.” <verse eid="ACT 27:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Auba selesi, yobolo inolo noolo ilihe efolo kasu wedino amoda godailumo gelesi, kasu amo hano saabia hodobaiba ilogoso.<verse eid="ACT 27:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Hiliaeyo hagoalesi, Folohe inolo ili suniafea naiyo namenaleso. E selesia, “Doma. Fogo selale koleba gine libo ogo nafuluba alolualene, gili naiyo naasale. Gili naiyoda nabalesu ligia, hilia daabuluba ulefia biniba (14) auba adeso. <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Aulugulu, na gilifea koleba selesu, gili koleba naiyo noolo namena. Amohe gili kiwigaaba ufiyobafe. Doma. Gili ewe suniane gunifea guni kau uleno daba dafiyobafale. Gili sunia siba dafaliyobafe.” <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Auba safasia, ehe <char style="w">boledi</char> noolo difasia, ine si saabia Godefea henelu sulu safasia, boledi olabofia, naiyo maugaba naaso. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Auba ausi, inolo ili amo sunia ine libomo heneba yaasia, ilida naiyo noolomo naaso. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Nini hano sibi amo kakainalu inolomo, 276 inolo auba kakainalu. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Ili amo naiyo liliba nafasia, hano sibimo higinilosifia, <char style="w" lemma="Widi">widimo</char> salu hano galulu amone usu saidafaliba ilogoso.<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hano sibimo gaselesia wolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Hiliasi, hano sibine dabalu mololo ili amohe, saii ninida holobagaiyamo abuluso, ilihe hele amo eloba bisigiale, nini wagi lolubiba babealu. Ilihe saii fuwelu amofea dobi besabeo. Aufia, ili hilisesia, hano sibimo ami daafia, kalugaeyo malesiba hiliseso. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Aufia, ilihe ankada godailu efolomo sunia gegelefia, hano usu waagi dafaliba ilogofia gadefaso. Aufia, ilihe hanoda olabolo bule aidamone efolo godailumo amoda fisigabaiso. Aufia, ili balai uleno hisu dimesine, gigiliba lagosi, hano sibimo saiifealomo maiyo aaso. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Auluso, hano sibimo abia, saii ulenomo salu hano galulu aleba ufulune ami dowesia alefaso. Hano sibine mi haumo saii amofea koleba daoofia adesihe, hano fufuleba dibia inigia, hano sibine sosamo koleba doweba labi, gaseleso.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Ausi, dibolo inolo ilimo salu hano galulumo dasafia fisaba dedalelosifia, yobolo inolo ilihe dibolo inolo ili amo dufa olaeyoba hiliseso. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Auluso, yasilomohe <char style="w">Folo</char> sagoba ufiyone hilisesia, ehe yobolo inolo ilifea dibolo inolo ili amo dumabiyoba elo ofeleso. Ehe inolo sunia hanoda dasalomofea selesia, “Gili salu hano galulu ilogo suga alefasia, gilidale saii saabia siba damaleba” seleso. <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />“Aufia, inolo noolo ilimo i salilu seba hano sibi gaseleba yaalu amofea sesaifia, saii saabia goayone malaleba” seleso. Aulugulu, ili suniahe yasilo sulu solu amoguba mololune, nini sunia ulenoda daba dafelesiale, saii saabia nafulusu siba dafalilu. <figure style="fig" alt="Shipwrecked survivors" file="IB04218.TIF" size="col" copy="Farid Faadil © Biblica, Inc. Used with permission. All rights reserved worldwide." ref="27.39-44">Hano sibi gaselesi, inolo sunia saii saabia siba dafalife.</figure><verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Folo e saidudu Malada ami alolu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Nini saii saabia ami nafulu siba dafelesia, bosolufalumo, nini dobelesia, ninimo saidudu Maladaba soda ami goafia labeba selesi dubulu. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CO 11:27">2Kld 11.27</ref></char></note>Malada idele inolo ili amohe, ninifea mana nafulu koleba moloso. Hele sugasia nini badisihe, ilihe de gamefia nini ninamesifia, nini suniamo de gamelu aniba ami lubia dedaleso. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" /><char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folohe</char> de yobe noolo molafia, de saidafogosihe, soiye uleno de gamelumo halosia, de yobelu amofeafia holobagasia, ene besehe Folone sone mubagafia, goloba helefia alolubiyo. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Molada idele inolo ili amohe, soiye Folone sonefea goloba helefia labe amone bisigia, ine geleba selesia, “Bama, inolo ogo inoloda dufa olalo amobu. E salu hano galulu ami olalualene, aga wolu mololu sabe obegelo godemohe e aso mesesiale hamefebuba” seleso. <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 16:18">Mag 16.18</ref></char></note>Auluso, Folohe soiye amo balualefia, de saidafogosi, efea kegele ulenoda holobagasale. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 14:11">HD 14.11</ref></char></note>Idele inolo ili yasifia alolu, maumo Folone domalamo galufia gelebaifia, alebale olaeyobafebuba hiliseso. Auluso, ili fogo selale yasifia alebaibiyoso, ilihe kegele uleno efea holobagasi besabeale. Ausi, ine asigi dedegeba yaafia selesia, “E gode ulenomo labebuba” seleso.<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Hele aniba ami ufulumo, saidudu amone guni inolo amone hele. Inolo amone wimo, Fubilusu. Inolo amohe ninimo ene moloa lubia daafia, ehe nini hilia osoloa heafuba luba adeso. <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Fubilusu amone enaomo haloba walefasia, gali hanoda daaba alolubiyo. Ausi, Folo e-mo e labea daafia, Godedai sulu selesia, ene sone inolo amofea ofelesi, e waiso. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Folo auba molofia labi, walefa idele inolo saidudu ami ofolaba yaalu ili amoda, e labea milibaisi, ilida waiba waaleso. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Ilihe mana nafulu koleba ninifea moloso. Aufia, hilia nini ili gadefia maiyo molosi, ilihe kegele nini abobolumo sunia ninifea mesia, ilihe hano sibi seba waaleso.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folo e abia Lome sidi goalu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Nini aube osoloa saidudu Malada ami alolu. Aufia, fogo ami, hano sibi uleno fufulo gi samodomesine yasifia ligia ami ufia alolu. Fufulo gi samodosi, nini sibi amo aleba lagolu. Hano sibi amo Alegesadilia sidi amifia mulu ufulubiyo. Hano sibi amone mi haumohe, Susi godene faibe aidane mimisililumo ami moloba ufulubiyo. Hano sibi amo aleba lagofia, nini hele amo afasia daalu. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Nini hano segefia abia, Silakusu dauno kalugaafia ligia, ami hilia osoloa alolu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Aufia, nini Silakusu afasia, dufia nini hano segefia abia, Legiyumu dauno ami goafia kalugaalu. Hilia amone faisa amohe, fufulo saabihe, nini Legiyumu afasia daalu. Aufia, hilia amone faisa amohe, nini hano segefia abia, Fudeoli dauno ami goalu. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Dauno ami ninihe nelewodali noolo wakalilu. Aufia, ilihe ninimo ili galiba melaba selesi, nini hilia domoba ili galiba alolu. Aufasia, ninihe ili afasia, abia Lome sidi ami hele aiba maiyone daalu. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Nelewodali noolo Lome kakainalu ilihe nini saabeba solumo dofasia, inigia, Afiusune Elegela ami, nini wakaliyone milibaifia alebailubiyo. Noolomo inigia, Sobele Molo Osoloaba soda ami nini wakalilu. <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folohe</char> ili amo bisigia, e Godefea henefia ene asigi kolelu adeso. <verse eid="ACT 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Nini Lome sugasimo, gamanehe Folo e-mo molo ulenomo hanemasia, yobolo inolo ulenomo e yasimesi gadefaso.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Folohe awalu sulu nafulu Lome ami walelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Folo e hilia osoloa Lome ami alefasia, ehe <char style="w" lemma="Yuda">Yudane</char> guni inolo noolo welu. Ili milifasia, gagaiyofia labi, ehe ilifea selesia, “Nelewodali doma. Nahe nine mosomumone dufa dafogoyone kegele uleno mololuale, me nine nauwane mana amone diba dafiyone, kegele ulenoda mololuale. Auluso, ilihe Yelusalame ami na sefia, Lomene sone saabia ofeleso. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:31">HD 26.31</ref></char></note>Ausi, Lome ilihe ne godomo godofasia, ili bisigia na heleba daalu uleno male baafia, ilihe na sububa dafogoyo hiliseso. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 25:11">HD 25.11</ref></char></note>Auluso, Yuda ilihe sulu amo saidafelesi, na eno no male adesi, na selesia, <char style="w" lemma="Sisa">Sisahe</char> ne godomo domesiba solu. Auluso, nahe ne mosomumo kegele ulenomo godoyone hamesuale. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 26:6-7">HD 26.6-7</ref></char></note>Mau amone kolebane, nahe gili milafia, gili galiba sulu saeyo hamefe. <char style="w">Isolaele</char> mosomu ili yasibu amonemo, seini ewe na dofalu lolu.” <verse eid="ACT 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Folo auba selesi, ilihe efea selesia, “Gafealo sulu saaba, inolo ulenohe Yudiafia sowi ninifea seleba mebailualebiyo. Aufia, Yuda noolo inigia, ninifea ga woba ofa saaba sadalu noolo awaba saeyone mulualebiyo. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 24:14">HD 24.14</ref></char></note>Auluso, ninihe gene ga asigife amoguba dubiyo hamefe. Enebamo, nini asigisia, hele sunia idele inolo ili gulugululo olabolu ewemo wolububa selaba yaafe.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Auba safasia, ili hilia uleno Folodai sulu neneyone iminilu. Iminilu hilia amo, inolo wedinale milibaifia, Folo ene moloa ami kakainalu. Hilia amoyamo keafafia abia, geide Folohe ilifea waleba ligia, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia Saminilo Adamone fadaba seleba alolu. Ehe <char style="w" lemma="Mosese">Mosesene</char> bugo amoda, <char style="w" lemma="Saaba ofolo">saaba ofolone</char> bugo noolomoda, alegasia, sulu ami selelu dobu amone, ili Yesufea asigi ule homesi kiwigaaba degeba ifosia waleba alolu. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Auba walesi, inolo noolohe hilisesia, Folo e selefemo isoluba hiliselu. Auluso, noolohe ene sulumofea asigi ule ufuluale. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Ili ine geleba sulu hegeba safasia, dedaleyo labi, <char style="w" lemma="Folo">Folohe</char> sulu uleno ilifea selesia, “<char style="w" lemma="Asubane Noekene">Asubane Noekenemohe</char>, saaba ofolo <char style="w" lemma="Aisaia">Aisaiane</char> mofeyofeafia, gine gauwadalifea sulu seale eweguba solubiyo.<verse eid="ACT 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">28.26 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Ais 6.9-10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 25:13">HD 25.13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:2">26.2</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:24">27.24</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:5">Lom 1.5</ref></char>
    </note>
    <char style="qt">‘Ga mosomu idele inolo ili amo labea daafia eweguba saamale,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">
    <char style="qt">“Gili dobolabasu miliyobafeso,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">
    <char style="qt">mau fadaba hiliseyobafale.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">
    <char style="qt">Gili beabasu miliyobafeso</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">
    <char style="qt">baaba goleyobafale.”</char><verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />
    <char style="qt">Maumo, mosomu ewene asigimo kolesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">ine konenihe sulu selefemo dubiyo habosia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">ine sida sisuguba yaalu.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">Ausialebiaga,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">ine si kegele bisigia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">ine koneni sulu selefemo dobelesia,</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">ili asigi fadaba hiliseba yaabaiyo.</char></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">
    <char style="qt">Ili Nafealo nolosi, Nahe ili waiba ofaiyo.’ ”</char><verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28-29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28-29" />Aufia, Folo selesia, “Aulugulu, gili eweguba asigimesi hamesu. Godehe idele inolo <char style="w" lemma="Gasiba dafelagoba dilo">gasiba dafelagoba difeba</char> solu sulu amo, aga <char style="w" lemma="Yau idele inolo - Yau mosomu">yau idele inolofea</char> mebailugulu, ili sigiba dubiyobafe.” <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28.28-29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dawalolo inolo noolohe hilisesia, hogolilu ewe ufuluiya ami, sulu haisi noolo aso dobu. Amo ewe. “Ilihe Folo auba selefe dofasia, Yuda inolo ili amo, ine geleba sulu hegeba selaba labeofia, dedaleba yaalu.”</char></note><verse eid="ACT 28:28-29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Hamu aida amo sunia, Folo e molo uleno asulu. E molo amo misiyone, molo amone enaomofea mole meba ado. Aufia, ehe inolo noolo e labea sobele milibaifemo ilifea heneba ofolo. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Ehe walesia, Godehe Yasifia Luba Ligia <char style="w">Saminilo</char> Ada amone sulu walelu. Aufia, ehe Saminilo Yesu <char style="w">Keliso</char> amone manamo waleba alolu. E Godene sulu mana sagilibale selaba labi, inolo ulenohe e kaaluale.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 28:31">
    <figure style="fig" alt="End of book bilas" file="End of Book OnobasuluNarrativeGreen.tiff" size="span" loc="End of Book" ref="28.19-20" /><verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>